i blog siteleri, yardımcı araçlar ve eğitim videolarının gelişmiş listesi.\", \"forks_count\": 10, \"full_name\": \"celil/ASOKaynaklari\", \"homepage\": null, \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/celil/ASOKaynaklari\", \"name\": \"ASOKaynaklari\", \"stargazers_count\": 180, \"topics\": [], \"updated_at\": \"2026-05-19T16:35:19Z\", \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/celil/ASOKaynaklari\", \"watchers_count\": 180}\n{\"name\": \"Apache License 2.0\", \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/licenses/apache-2.0\"}\n{\"html_url\": \"https://github.com/celil\", \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/celil\"}\n\n### /Users/anicca/anicca/skills/earn/marketing-engine/evidence/intel/pulls/43faf31ec6ce403f9aae9b8c0b0ca21b/github.kdp-scout.json\n{\"canonical_url\": \"https://github.com/rxpelle/kdp-scout\", \"source_id\": \"github.kdp-scout\"}\n{\"author\": {\"avatar_url\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/258741235?v=4\", \"events_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/nanookclaw/events{/privacy}\", \"followers_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/nanookclaw/followers\", \"following_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/nanookclaw/following{/other_user}\", \"gists_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/nanookclaw/gists{/gist_id}\", \"gravatar_id\": \"\", \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/nanookclaw\", \"id\": 258741235, \"login\": \"nanookclaw\", \"node_id\": \"U_kgDOD2wT8w\", \"organizations_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/nanookclaw/orgs\", \"received_events_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/nanookclaw/received_events\", \"repos_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/nanookclaw/repos\", \"site_admin\": false, \"starred_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/nanookclaw/starred{/owner}{/repo}\", \"subscriptions_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/nanookclaw/subscriptions\", \"type\": \"User\", \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/nanookclaw\", \"user_view_type\": \"public\"}, \"commit\": {\"author\": {\"date\": \"2026-06-05T23:28:08Z\", \"email\": \"nanook@agentmail.to\", \"name\": \"nanookclaw\"}, \"comment_count\": 0, \"committer\": {\"date\": \"2026-06-05T23:28:08Z\", \"email\": \"noreply@github.com\", \"name\": \"GitHub\"}, \"message\": \"feat: add output option for reports and exports (#8)\\n\\n* feat: add output option for reports and exports\\n\\n* test: add real-engine integration tests for output file capture\\n\\nThe existing CLI output tests mock ReportingEngine and emit via the\\nbuiltin print(), so they never exercise the actual Rich console\\nrendering that --output relies on (contextlib.redirect_stdout capturing\\nrich.console.Console). Add two tests that run the real engine against a\\nseeded temp database and assert the rendered Rich table lands in the\\nfile, plus the empty-DB zero-row boundary.\\n\\nAlso fix the existing mock-based tests, which assumed Click >=8.2's\\nalways-separate stderr and failed under the project's pinned Click\\n8.1.8. A make_runner() helper requests mix_stderr=False on 8.1.x and\\nfalls back to the default runner on 8.2+, keeping the suite green on\\nboth.\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\\n\\n---------\\n\\nCo-authored-by: Nanook <nanookclaw@users.noreply.github.com>\\nCo-authored-by: Randy Pellegrini <rxpelle@users.noreply.github.com>\\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\", \"tree\": {\"sha\": \"387cb3b8a67a75f6f86320b4b0b58f80765aeb87\", \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/rxpelle/kdp-scout/git/trees/387cb3b8a67a75f6f86320b4b0b58f80765aeb87\"}, \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/rxpelle/kdp-scout/git/commits/92131151378f83142ac214ed2eca7474c405efee\", \"verification\": {\"payload\": \"tree 387cb3b8a67a75f6f86320b4b0b58f80765aeb87\\nparent 61c320fbd85dcfcb633cb1526294392c621de3af\\nauthor nanookclaw <nanook@agentmail.to> 1780702088 +0000\\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780702088 -0700\\n\\nfeat: add output option for reports and exports (#8)\\n\\n* feat: add output option for reports and exports\\n\\n* test: add real-engine integration tests for output file capture\\n\\nThe existing CLI output tests mock ReportingEngine and emit via the\\nbuiltin print(), so they never exercise the actual Rich console\\nrendering that --output relies on (contextlib.redirect_stdout capturing\\nrich.console.Console). Add two tests that run the real engine against a\\nseeded temp database and assert the rendered Rich table lands in the\\nfile, plus the empty-DB zero-row boundary.\\n\\nAlso fix the existing mock-based tests, which assumed Click >=8.2's\\nalways-separate stderr and failed under the project's pinned Click\\n8.1.8. A make_runner() helper requests mix_stderr=False on 8.1.x and\\nfalls back to the default runner on 8.2+, keeping the suite green on\\nboth.\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\\n\\n---------\\n\\nCo-authored-by: Nanook <nanookclaw@users.noreply.github.com>\\nCo-authored-by: Randy Pellegrini <rxpelle@users.noreply.github.com>\\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\", \"reason\": \"valid\", \"signature\": \"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\\n\\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqI1uICRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAWyIQAD3Ve64IcsrDvjVBOBpbDh03\\n1WiHbTojOEbC/Uq+bQueFKm1fdZ9MV5Xj5l26rR0NJEfO8rj08WayWlTY2mlTvfF\\ndN6v9hKzs9Rn8EKLXNCnlLQ50eovzZjCE5QEwVxQRSAYwoss637DGau9kd9gMmJa\\nj1gyQmxPhI0D0waxyZKDoQLE3CRpKdQTAj8dk9tc9kOsETMCwRp1Bm1sq0emGGYC\\nCHiPJjZJ3WiBSgQfjAFX5NAo1Jz46vFDwVwNzXzUBO1IDgP8Ig3Ib022KlugHY15\\n8Ws8gw5njOUo96dfAF7/4073WV1Ptq6YWzcq32SkKW2EWZeA8joyJbX0n4EdaQlN\\nni1P5x3ovRDsuqqtUiKZX4JlX4wjOGIeedervu0O/rxWYCvc6jXzMh4KnzhfO6oK\\nYoX7bt3g4/p8ajZBNt5gaDsfhT3s2Jz5CaL7VlYPh4rwtuGPw5aIWiT5vZ1eUHQa\\naBL47i8FzFA8kAtxFWm0Cy+AsgIVgB155G2eZI5mQI/Ardt8DZcvHMteZutFWAxQ\\nSyYRJ2sAGPZqYTvQlA4/pYqdFERO7rSvQ9moRbPL4raZawLNZTzRILIfJxEmV/Fs\\nuJdCFuGRCixvjScMQ7F0rMraDEBo/JmLKQYIF7pISTkKhQPu9xGNb29sFZIwhSXe\\nIxOtnpaw6XZA8qPzHFfx\\n=r8GL\\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\\n\", \"verified\": true, \"verified_at\": \"2026-06-05T23:28:08Z\"}}, \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/rxpelle/kdp-scout/commit/92131151378f83142ac214ed2eca7474c405efee\", \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/rxpelle/kdp-scout/commits/92131151378f83142ac214ed2eca7474c405efee\"}\n{\"html_url\": \"https://github.com/nanookclaw\", \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/nanookclaw\"}\n{\"author\": {\"date\": \"2026-06-05T23:28:08Z\", \"email\": \"nanook@agentmail.to\", \"name\": \"nanookclaw\"}, \"message\": \"feat: add output option for reports and exports (#8)\\n\\n* feat: add output option for reports and exports\\n\\n* test: add real-engine integration tests for output file capture\\n\\nThe existing CLI output tests mock ReportingEngine and emit via the\\nbuiltin print(), so they never exercise the actual Rich console\\nrendering that --output relies on (contextlib.redirect_stdout capturing\\nrich.console.Console). Add two tests that run the real engine against a\\nseeded temp database and assert the rendered Rich table lands in the\\nfile, plus the empty-DB zero-row boundary.\\n\\nAlso fix the existing mock-based tests, which assumed Click >=8.2's\\nalways-separate stderr and failed under the project's pinned Click\\n8.1.8. A make_runner() helper requests mix_stderr=False on 8.1.x and\\nfalls back to the default runner on 8.2+, keeping the suite green on\\nboth.\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\\n\\n---------\\n\\nCo-authored-by: Nanook <nanookclaw@users.noreply.github.com>\\nCo-authored-by: Randy Pellegrini <rxpelle@users.noreply.github.com>\\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\", \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/rxpelle/kdp-scout/git/commits/92131151378f83142ac214ed2eca7474c405efee\"}\n{\"name\": \"nanookclaw\"}\n{\"name\": \"GitHub\"}\n{\"url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/rxpelle/kdp-scout/git/trees/387cb3b8a67a75f6f86320b4b0b58f80765aeb87\"}\n{\"html_url\": \"https://github.com/web-flow\", \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow\"}\n{\"html_url\": \"https://github.com/rxpelle/kdp-scout/commit/61c320fbd85dcfcb633cb1526294392c621de3af\", \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/rxpelle/kdp-scout/commits/61c320fbd85dcfcb633cb1526294392c621de3af\"}\n{\"created_at\": \"2026-02-27T23:04:36Z\", \"description\": \"Amazon KDP keyword research and competitor analysis CLI tool for self-published authors\", \"forks_count\": 13, \"full_name\": \"rxpelle/kdp-scout\", \"homepage\": null, \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/rxpelle/kdp-scout\", \"name\": \"kdp-scout\", \"stargazers_count\": 53, \"topics\": [], \"updated_at\": \"2026-08-01T03:35:40Z\", \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/rxpelle/kdp-scout\", \"watchers_count\": 53}\n{\"name\": \"MIT License\", \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/licenses/mit\"}\n{\"html_url\": \"https://github.com/rxpelle\", \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/rxpelle\"}\n\n### /Users/anicca/anicca/skills/earn/marketing-engine/evidence/intel/pulls/43faf31ec6ce403f9aae9b8c0b0ca21b/github.auto-kdp.json\n{\"canonical_url\": \"https://github.com/ekr0/auto-kdp\", \"source_id\": \"github.auto-kdp\"}\n{\"author\": {\"avatar_url\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/439340?v=4\", \"events_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/ekr0/events{/privacy}\", \"followers_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/ekr0/followers\", \"following_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/ekr0/following{/other_user}\", \"gists_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/ekr0/gists{/gist_id}\", \"gravatar_id\": \"\", \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/ekr0\", \"id\": 439340, \"login\": \"ekr0\", \"node_id\": \"MDQ6VXNlcjQzOTM0MA==\", \"organizations_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/ekr0/orgs\", \"received_events_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/ekr0/received_events\", \"repos_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/ekr0/repos\", \"site_admin\": false, \"starred_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/ekr0/starred{/owner}{/repo}\", \"subscriptions_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/ekr0/subscriptions\", \"type\": \"User\", \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/ekr0\", \"user_view_type\": \"public\"}, \"commit\": {\"author\": {\"date\": \"2026-04-30T06:43:12Z\", \"email\": \"439340+ekr0@users.noreply.github.com\", \"name\": \"ekr0\"}, \"comment_count\": 0, \"committer\": {\"date\": \"2026-04-30T06:43:12Z\", \"email\": \"439340+ekr0@users.noreply.github.com\", \"name\": \"ekr0\"}, \"message\": \"pudate\", \"tree\": {\"sha\": \"11f79ea58298c865668b3f00ce394da3d4a7b4da\", \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/ekr0/auto-kdp/git/trees/11f79ea58298c865668b3f00ce394da3d4a7b4da\"}, \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/ekr0/auto-kdp/git/commits/a0e406a8165bfa3f0a55e14fc6e1a8b6e48dba4a\", \"verification\": {\"payload\": null, \"reason\": \"unsigned\", \"signature\": null, \"verified\": false, \"verified_at\": null}}, \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/ekr0/auto-kdp/commit/a0e406a8165bfa3f0a55e14fc6e1a8b6e48dba4a\", \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/ekr0/auto-kdp/commits/a0e406a8165bfa3f0a55e14fc6e1a8b6e48dba4a\"}\n{\"html_url\": \"https://github.com/ekr0\", \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/ekr0\"}\n{\"author\": {\"date\": \"2026-04-30T06:43:12Z\", \"email\": \"439340+ekr0@users.noreply.github.com\", \"name\": \"ekr0\"}, \"message\": \"pudate\", \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/ekr0/auto-kdp/git/commits/a0e406a8165bfa3f0a55e14fc6e1a8b6e48dba4a\"}\n{\"name\": \"ekr0\"}\n{\"name\": \"ekr0\"}\n{\"url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/ekr0/auto-kdp/git/trees/11f79ea58298c865668b3f00ce394da3d4a7b4da\"}\n{\"html_url\": \"https://github.com/ekr0\", \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/ekr0\"}\n{\"html_url\": \"https://github.com/ekr0/auto-kdp/commit/c486fa0e89be1d0f6955629197ab987460e564f0\", \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/ekr0/auto-kdp/commits/c486fa0e89be1d0f6955629197ab987460e564f0\"}\n{\"created_at\": \"2022-08-23T07:02:47Z\", \"description\": \"Automating Amazon KDP book submission and update\", \"forks_count\": 6, \"full_name\": \"ekr0/auto-kdp\", \"homepage\": null, \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/ekr0/auto-kdp\", \"name\": \"auto-kdp\", \"stargazers_count\": 28, \"topics\": [], \"updated_at\": \"2026-07-19T20:59:00Z\", \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/ekr0/auto-kdp\", \"watchers_count\": 28}\n{\"name\": \"MIT License\", \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/licenses/mit\"}\n{\"html_url\": \"https://github.com/ekr0\", \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/ekr0\"}\n\n### /Users/anicca/anicca/skills/earn/marketing-engine/evidence/intel/pulls/43faf31ec6ce403f9aae9b8c0b0ca21b/x.ernesto-software-articles.json\n{\"canonical_url\": \"https://x.com/ErnestoSOFTWARE\", \"source_id\": \"x.ernesto-software-articles\"}\n{\"author\": {\"avatar_url\": \"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1930138018951643136/wEgZY178_200x200.jpg\", \"banner_url\": \"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1890388644273258496/1742417398\", \"description\": \"I own a few apps. currently at $200k MRR, sharing daily B2C scaling strategies. founder of @tryviewtrack\", \"followers\": 58728, \"following\": 794, \"id\": \"1890388644273258496\", \"joined\": \"Fri Feb 14 13:12:38 +0000 2025\", \"likes\": 13792, \"location\": \"\", \"media_count\": 1917, \"name\": \"Ernesto Lopez\", \"protected\": false, \"raw_description\": {\"facets\": [], \"text\": \"I own a few apps. currently at $200k MRR, sharing daily B2C scaling strategies. founder of @tryviewtrack\"}, \"screen_name\": \"ErnestoSOFTWARE\", \"statuses\": 7090, \"type\": \"profile\", \"url\": \"https://x.com/ErnestoSOFTWARE\", \"verification\": {\"type\": \"individual\", \"verified\": true, \"verified_at\": null}, \"website\": null}, \"created_at\": \"Wed Jul 29 18:02:50 +0000 2026\", \"text\": \"\", \"url\": \"https://x.com/ErnestoSOFTWARE/status/2082527284301300023\"}\n{\"content\": {\"blocks\": [{\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"7qrp2\", \"text\": \"Our app is currently doing $50,000/week. \\nThis month we will wrap up at $150K MRR.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [{\"key\": 0, \"length\": 1, \"offset\": 0}], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"64orr\", \"text\": \" \", \"type\": \"atomic\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"cnblf\", \"text\": \"and thats just 1 of my businesses, I have have many others \\n\\nbringing in over $200k/mo in personal income.and all of these businesses are built on the back of claude.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [{\"key\": 1, \"length\": 1, \"offset\": 0}], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"ddoqh\", \"text\": \" \", \"type\": \"atomic\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"34hat\", \"text\": \"Claude is literally my COO.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"8i2md\", \"text\": \"and yet 99% of people still use Claude like an assistant,\\nto help them with basic tasks.\\n\\nat this point thats caveman behavior.\\n\\nThe reason i'm able to run so many \\n6 figure/mo business at once\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"87c0t\", \"text\": \"boils down to the precision in which I use Claude. \\nand thats exactly what i will break down in this article\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"384t3\", \"text\": \"STEP 1: MCP MAXING\", \"type\": \"header-two\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"caunq\", \"text\": \"The first step to get above average results with Claude\\nIs to give claude access to useful MCPS:\\n\\nMCP's are like super powers for Claude\\nFor example, recently i tried re creating a very famous game\\n\\nThat has over 4 Billion downloads\\nI sent the same prompt to 2 agents\\n\\n1 claude agent had access to 2 MCPS   \\n( higgsfield MCP for images + meshy AI for 3d models )\\n\\nThe other agent had no access to mcps.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [{\"key\": 2, \"length\": 1, \"offset\": 0}], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"19i1q\", \"text\": \" \", \"type\": \"atomic\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"cm3s5\", \"text\": \"The results speak for themselves.\\n\\nthe agent with access to MCP delivered exceptional results \\ncompared to the other agent.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [{\"length\": 29, \"offset\": 0, \"style\": \"Bold\"}], \"key\": \"4ith9\", \"text\": \"SO WHICH MCPS SHOULD YOU GET?\", \"type\": \"header-two\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [{\"length\": 38, \"offset\": 30, \"style\": \"Bold\"}], \"key\": \"av60j\", \"text\": \"Lets say you want to build a  SAAS that turns images into 3D models.\\nI'll send Claude a prompt like this:\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [{\"key\": 3, \"length\": 1, \"offset\": 0}], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"1hf5b\", \"text\": \" \", \"type\": \"atomic\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"4ecmj\", \"text\": \"My Claude code agent is connected to all of these MCPS by default:\\n\\n→  Dribbble API to research visual direction\\n→ Higgsfield MCP for every image gen and video gen model\\n→ Blender MCP to make 3D assets for games\\n→ Vercel MCP to host the website\\n→ Resend API to send emails (login codes, receipts, everything)\\n→ Supabase MCP to spin up the database\\n→ GoDaddy MCP to manage DNS records\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [{\"length\": 54, \"offset\": 0, \"style\": \"Bold\"}, {\"length\": 51, \"offset\": 131, \"style\": \"Bold\"}, {\"length\": 38, \"offset\": 281, \"style\": \"Bold\"}], \"key\": \"8uk23\", \"text\": \"so now instead of wasting days setting \\neverything up myself \\n\\nClaude handles it all.  \\n\\nbut even with all these super powers\\n\\nyou would still need to be sending 1 prompt at a time. \\nbecause AI has a cap on how many tokens it can spend per prompt.\\n\\nthats when the loops comes in.\\n\\nCLAUDE LOOPS + MCPS = SUPER EFFICIENCY\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [{\"key\": 4, \"length\": 1, \"offset\": 0}], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"b3469\", \"text\": \" \", \"type\": \"atomic\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"cnl5a\", \"text\": \"Instead of prompting 1 prompt a time,\\nYou can run this fun little command inside claude code \\n\\n/loop \\n\\nbasically this makes claude automatically \\nprompts itself over and over again for hours.\\n\\nIt writes the code, tests it, sees what broke, fixes it, tests again.\\nuntil it achieves the goal you set for it.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"ekd64\", \"text\": \"This is how I build all of my websites, apps and businesses:\\n\\n→Claude Code \\n→Opus 5\\n→Ultra think mode \\n→/loop command\\n→ + a text file called TASKS.md \\nwhich sets the goal that claude has to achieve\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"9vo1o\", \"text\": \"rules for a clean loop\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"jcj1\", \"text\": \"→ Write TASKS.md like you are briefing a junior developer.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"3gghf\", \"text\": \"Vague goals = vague output.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"h9r\", \"text\": \"→ Give each task one clear outcome.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"1glbj\", \"text\": \"“Deploy the app to Vercel”\\nnot “Make the app better.”\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"fc8ms\", \"text\": \"You have to be extremely specific.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"16rno\", \"text\": \"→ Put spending limits on every API key.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"7teqf\", \"text\": \"Claude will burn through your credits\\nif you let it.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"4dvl1\", \"text\": \"→ Run the loop inside a sandboxed folder.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"2u50i\", \"text\": \"Never point /loop at your main repository.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"84icv\", \"text\": \"→ Add a kill switch using a MAX_RUNTIME variable.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"31rnf\", \"text\": \"I usually cap mine at 12 hours.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"6mhd1\", \"text\": \"If it still has not shipped by then,\\nsomething is probably wrong.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"5da2u\", \"text\": \"Now here is where loops and MCPs\\nget even crazier.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"dkphm\", \"text\": \"You do not have to run just one loop at a time.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"1utst\", \"text\": \"You can run multiple loops in parallel.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"8elhl\", \"text\": \"Loop 1 builds the app.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"5sjur\", \"text\": \"Loop 2 generates 50 pieces of UGC\\nto promote the app.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"fobrl\", \"text\": \"For example:\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"8r2tf\", \"text\": \"I recently built a brand-new app\\nusing a Claude loop.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"ep64o\", \"text\": \"And this is how it turned out:\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [{\"key\": 5, \"length\": 1, \"offset\": 0}], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"49fk5\", \"text\": \" \", \"type\": \"atomic\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"5cjc2\", \"text\": \"then in parallel I ran another loop that made a bunch of different ads with Higgsfield MCP and it made me a bunch of professional UGC ads that i can now use to promote the app.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [{\"key\": 6, \"length\": 1, \"offset\": 0}], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"7st08\", \"text\": \" \", \"type\": \"atomic\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"fh2ma\", \"text\": \"And all of this took 10 minutes of my attention, set the loops off \\nAnd forgot about it, welcome to the future.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"26fl8\", \"text\": \"BUILDING SYSTEMS WITH CLAUDE:\", \"type\": \"header-two\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"3ng2h\", \"text\": \"We covered MCP maxxing\\nand loop maxxing with Claude.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"bb6jn\", \"text\": \"But another way I abuse Claude\\nis by using it to build systems.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"658qb\", \"text\": \"Most parts of a business can be automated.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"8qj04\", \"text\": \"The more you automate,\\nthe more you can handle\\nwithout needing a massive team.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"bvj99\", \"text\": \"For example, I had Claude build a complete content system for my UGC team.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"bc1jg\", \"text\": \"It includes:\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"7gv88\", \"text\": \"→ Daily videos for creators to record\\n→ Scripts for every video\\n→ Step-by-step recording instructions\\n→ Tools that help them create better content\\n→ A full content calendar that keeps everything organized\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"d61u5\", \"text\": \"Because of this system,\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"aqt7e\", \"text\": \"we are able to run a team of 20+ UGC creators\\nwithout needing managers or extra hands.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"1m4p0\", \"text\": \"It is almost completely automated.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"5jmqc\", \"text\": \"And that is just one of the hundreds of systems\\nI have integrated across all of my companies.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"a8pkb\", \"text\": \"So ask yourself:\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"6jcit\", \"text\": \"What part of my business am I still doing manually\\nthat Claude could turn into a system?\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"a8l2c\", \"text\": \"Then run a /loop\\nand have Claude build the automation for you.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"86l6b\", \"text\": \"THE $1M OPPORTUNITY\", \"type\": \"header-two\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"5k9un\", \"text\": \"Most people are still using Claude\\n\\nto write emails, summarize documents,\\nand complete basic tasks.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"7fddm\", \"text\": \"But that is barely scratching the surface.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"6cpi6\", \"text\": \"The real opportunity is using Claude\\nto build products, create content, automate operations,\\nand run entire parts of your business.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"eso3l\", \"text\": \"MCPs give Claude access to better tools.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"bqeqj\", \"text\": \"Loops give Claude the ability\\nto keep working until the job is finished.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"8bogf\", \"text\": \"Systems turn that work\\ninto something your business can use every day.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"cigp2\", \"text\": \"When you combine all three,\\nClaude stops being an assistant.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"1bufc\", \"text\": \"It becomes an operator.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"ap8i4\", \"text\": \"That is how I am able to run multiple businesses\\nwithout needing a massive team\\nor spending every hour managing people.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"dshjp\", \"text\": \"And we are still extremely early.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"ffen5\", \"text\": \"So stop asking Claude\\nto help you complete random tasks.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"9djo0\", \"text\": \"Give it a real goal.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"c1hq9\", \"text\": \"Connect it to the right tools.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"3hne5\", \"text\": \"Put it inside a loop.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"ea49l\", \"text\": \"And have it build a system\\nthat continues creating value long after you close your laptop.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"s0ep\", \"text\": \"The people who understand this now\\nare going to have an unfair advantage\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"c3imi\", \"text\": \"over everyone who still thinks AI is just a chatbot.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}], \"entityMap\": [{\"key\": \"4\", \"value\": {\"data\": {\"entityKey\": \"e319e9e4-b8ed-4b8b-90f8-da3d5ae8742a\", \"mediaItems\": [{\"localMediaId\": \"5\", \"mediaCategory\": \"DraftTweetImage\", \"mediaId\": \"2082450513891643392\"}]}, \"mutability\": \"Immutable\", \"type\": \"MEDIA\"}}, {\"key\": \"5\", \"value\": {\"data\": {\"entityKey\": \"adfd8182-5805-4bf7-a80b-461e10a5b748\", \"mediaItems\": [{\"localMediaId\": \"12\", \"mediaCategory\": \"AmplifyVideo\", \"mediaId\": \"2082451034341834752\"}]}, \"mutability\": \"Immutable\", \"type\": \"MEDIA\"}}, {\"key\": \"6\", \"value\": {\"data\": {\"entityKey\": \"3c681835-780d-4052-9a8a-0396c20c095f\", \"mediaItems\": [{\"localMediaId\": \"13\", \"mediaCategory\": \"AmplifyVideo\", \"mediaId\": \"2082451054243774464\"}]}, \"mutability\": \"Immutable\", \"type\": \"MEDIA\"}}, {\"key\": \"1\", \"value\": {\"data\": {\"entityKey\": \"7216938e-d793-4a2c-94a6-eef75033e003\", \"mediaItems\": [{\"localMediaId\": \"10\", \"mediaCategory\": \"DraftTweetImage\", \"mediaId\": \"2082527603118809088\"}]}, \"mutability\": \"Immutable\", \"type\": \"MEDIA\"}}, {\"key\": \"0\", \"value\": {\"data\": {\"entityKey\": \"f553c05d-e6cc-4dd9-9620-d2087677390c\", \"mediaItems\": [{\"localMediaId\": \"8\", \"mediaCategory\": \"DraftTweetImage\", \"mediaId\": \"2082527563184803840\"}]}, \"mutability\": \"Immutable\", \"type\": \"MEDIA\"}}, {\"key\": \"2\", \"value\": {\"data\": {\"entityKey\": \"4b95022c-51cd-40ba-8f22-ffe25bc48857\", \"mediaItems\": [{\"localMediaId\": \"8\", \"mediaCategory\": \"AmplifyVideo\", \"mediaId\": \"2082450827289980928\"}]}, \"mutability\": \"Immutable\", \"type\": \"MEDIA\"}}, {\"key\": \"3\", \"value\": {\"data\": {\"entityKey\": \"40032c20-04d6-4dee-ba63-f922d5dcca29\", \"mediaItems\": [{\"localMediaId\": \"3\", \"mediaCategory\": \"DraftTweetImage\", \"mediaId\": \"2082450414109167616\"}]}, \"mutability\": \"Immutable\", \"type\": \"MEDIA\"}}]}, \"created_at\": \"2026-07-29T18:02:50.000Z\", \"title\": \"How I use claude to make $200,000/mo ( FULL GUIDE )\"}\n{\"text\": \"Our app is currently doing $50,000/week. \\nThis month we will wrap up at $150K MRR.\"}\n{\"text\": \" \"}\n{\"text\": \"and thats just 1 of my businesses, I have have many others \\n\\nbringing in over $200k/mo in personal income.and all of these businesses are built on the back of claude.\"}\n{\"text\": \" \"}\n{\"text\": \"Claude is literally my COO.\"}\n{\"text\": \"and yet 99% of people still use Claude like an assistant,\\nto help them with basic tasks.\\n\\nat this point thats caveman behavior.\\n\\nThe reason i'm able to run so many \\n6 figure/mo business at once\"}\n{\"text\": \"boils down to the precision in which I use Claude. \\nand thats exactly what i will break down in this article\"}\n{\"text\": \"STEP 1: MCP MAXING\"}\n{\"text\": \"The first step to get above average results with Claude\\nIs to give claude access to useful MCPS:\\n\\nMCP's are like super powers for Claude\\nFor example, recently i tried re creating a very famous game\\n\\nThat has over 4 Billion downloads\\nI sent the same prompt to 2 agents\\n\\n1 claude agent had access to 2 MCPS   \\n( higgsfield MCP for images + meshy AI for 3d models )\\n\\nThe other agent had no access to mcps.\"}\n{\"text\": \" \"}\n{\"text\": \"The results speak for themselves.\\n\\nthe agent with access to MCP delivered exceptional results \\ncompared to the other agent.\"}\n{\"text\": \"SO WHICH MCPS SHOULD YOU GET?\"}\n{\"text\": \"Lets say you want to build a  SAAS that turns images into 3D models.\\nI'll send Claude a prompt like this:\"}\n{\"text\": \" \"}\n{\"text\": \"My Claude code agent is connected to all of these MCPS by default:\\n\\n→  Dribbble API to research visual direction\\n→ Higgsfield MCP for every image gen and video gen model\\n→ Blender MCP to make 3D assets for games\\n→ Vercel MCP to host the website\\n→ Resend API to send emails (login codes, receipts, everything)\\n→ Supabase MCP to spin up the database\\n→ GoDaddy MCP to manage DNS records\"}\n{\"text\": \"so now instead of wasting days setting \\neverything up myself \\n\\nClaude handles it all.  \\n\\nbut even with all these super powers\\n\\nyou would still need to be sending 1 prompt at a time. \\nbecause AI has a cap on how many tokens it can spend per prompt.\\n\\nthats when the loops comes in.\\n\\nCLAUDE LOOPS + MCPS = SUPER EFFICIENCY\"}\n{\"text\": \" \"}\n{\"text\": \"Instead of prompting 1 prompt a time,\\nYou can run this fun little command inside claude code \\n\\n/loop \\n\\nbasically this makes claude automatically \\nprompts itself over and over again for hours.\\n\\nIt writes the code, tests it, sees what broke, fixes it, tests again.\\nuntil it achieves the goal you set for it.\"}\n{\"text\": \"This is how I build all of my websites, apps and businesses:\\n\\n→Claude Code \\n→Opus 5\\n→Ultra think mode \\n→/loop command\\n→ + a text file called TASKS.md \\nwhich sets the goal that claude has to achieve\"}\n{\"text\": \"rules for a clean loop\"}\n{\"text\": \"→ Write TASKS.md like you are briefing a junior developer.\"}\n{\"text\": \"Vague goals = vague output.\"}\n{\"text\": \"→ Give each task one clear outcome.\"}\n{\"text\": \"“Deploy the app to Vercel”\\nnot “Make the app better.”\"}\n{\"text\": \"You have to be extremely specific.\"}\n{\"text\": \"→ Put spending limits on every API key.\"}\n{\"text\": \"Claude will burn through your credits\\nif you let it.\"}\n{\"text\": \"→ Run the loop inside a sandboxed folder.\"}\n{\"text\": \"Never point /loop at your main repository.\"}\n{\"text\": \"→ Add a kill switch using a MAX_RUNTIME variable.\"}\n{\"text\": \"I usually cap mine at 12 hours.\"}\n{\"text\": \"If it still has not shipped by then,\\nsomething is probably wrong.\"}\n{\"text\": \"Now here is where loops and MCPs\\nget even crazier.\"}\n{\"text\": \"You do not have to run just one loop at a time.\"}\n{\"text\": \"You can run multiple loops in parallel.\"}\n{\"text\": \"Loop 1 builds the app.\"}\n{\"text\": \"Loop 2 generates 50 pieces of UGC\\nto promote the app.\"}\n{\"text\": \"For example:\"}\n{\"text\": \"I recently built a brand-new app\\nusing a Claude loop.\"}\n{\"text\": \"And this is how it turned out:\"}\n{\"text\": \" \"}\n{\"text\": \"then in parallel I ran another loop that made a bunch of different ads with Higgsfield MCP and it made me a bunch of professional UGC ads that i can now use to promote the app.\"}\n{\"text\": \" \"}\n{\"text\": \"And all of this took 10 minutes of my attention, set the loops off \\nAnd forgot about it, welcome to the future.\"}\n{\"text\": \"BUILDING SYSTEMS WITH CLAUDE:\"}\n{\"text\": \"We covered MCP maxxing\\nand loop maxxing with Claude.\"}\n{\"text\": \"But another way I abuse Claude\\nis by using it to build systems.\"}\n{\"text\": \"Most parts of a business can be automated.\"}\n{\"text\": \"The more you automate,\\nthe more you can handle\\nwithout needing a massive team.\"}\n{\"text\": \"For example, I had Claude build a complete content system for my UGC team.\"}\n{\"text\": \"It includes:\"}\n{\"text\": \"→ Daily videos for creators to record\\n→ Scripts for every video\\n→ Step-by-step recording instructions\\n→ Tools that help them create better content\\n→ A full content calendar that keeps everything organized\"}\n{\"text\": \"Because of this system,\"}\n{\"text\": \"we are able to run a team of 20+ UGC creators\\nwithout needing managers or extra hands.\"}\n{\"text\": \"It is almost completely automated.\"}\n{\"text\": \"And that is just one of the hundreds of systems\\nI have integrated across all of my companies.\"}\n{\"text\": \"So ask yourself:\"}\n{\"text\": \"What part of my business am I still doing manually\\nthat Claude could turn into a system?\"}\n{\"text\": \"Then run a /loop\\nand have Claude build the automation for you.\"}\n{\"text\": \"THE $1M OPPORTUNITY\"}\n{\"text\": \"Most people are still using Claude\\n\\nto write emails, summarize documents,\\nand complete basic tasks.\"}\n{\"text\": \"But that is barely scratching the surface.\"}\n{\"text\": \"The real opportunity is using Claude\\nto build products, create content, automate operations,\\nand run entire parts of your business.\"}\n{\"text\": \"MCPs give Claude access to better tools.\"}\n{\"text\": \"Loops give Claude the ability\\nto keep working until the job is finished.\"}\n{\"text\": \"Systems turn that work\\ninto something your business can use every day.\"}\n{\"text\": \"When you combine all three,\\nClaude stops being an assistant.\"}\n{\"text\": \"It becomes an operator.\"}\n{\"text\": \"That is how I am able to run multiple businesses\\nwithout needing a massive team\\nor spending every hour managing people.\"}\n{\"text\": \"And we are still extremely early.\"}\n{\"text\": \"So stop asking Claude\\nto help you complete random tasks.\"}\n{\"text\": \"Give it a real goal.\"}\n{\"text\": \"Connect it to the right tools.\"}\n{\"text\": \"Put it inside a loop.\"}\n{\"text\": \"And have it build a system\\nthat continues creating value long after you close your laptop.\"}\n{\"text\": \"The people who understand this now\\nare going to have an unfair advantage\"}\n{\"text\": \"over everyone who still thinks AI is just a chatbot.\"}\n{\"url\": \"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2082450827289980928/pl/BNNLxr74bwESI0bg.m3u8?tag=29&v=cfc\"}\n{\"url\": \"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2082450827289980928/vid/avc1/1620x1060/0VJkj9Rb8ch_BD7a.mp4?tag=29\"}\n{\"url\": \"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2082450827289980928/vid/avc1/412x270/tIiKtdn1GzzrD9y2.mp4?tag=29\"}\n{\"url\": \"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2082450827289980928/vid/avc1/1100x720/GmJhbZqZVUmVJBy5.mp4?tag=29\"}\n{\"url\": \"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2082450827289980928/vid/avc1/550x360/dJNd2BbWi5zF6q0N.mp4?tag=29\"}\n{\"url\": \"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2082451054243774464/vid/avc1/1280x720/EGBQVzi0U5nh2vp3.mp4?tag=29\"}\n{\"url\": \"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2082451054243774464/vid/avc1/1920x1080/J9U3GVUpJ5-gbWyn.mp4?tag=29\"}\n{\"url\": \"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2082451054243774464/pl/cgUBp6oGJ6iXITQl.m3u8?tag=29\"}\n{\"url\": \"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2082451054243774464/vid/avc1/640x360/YgSd_Yr3FSmHT1Z1.mp4?tag=29\"}\n{\"url\": \"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2082451054243774464/vid/avc1/480x270/-hkk2rJjdN-kGT1b.mp4?tag=29\"}\n{\"url\": \"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2082451034341834752/vid/avc1/274x270/PnhicD6mOL-I-Gc1.mp4?tag=29\"}\n{\"url\": \"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2082451034341834752/vid/avc1/366x360/FpLFtElJx_SQL-wL.mp4?tag=29\"}\n{\"url\": \"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2082451034341834752/pl/EuK3McXgLymZmLNU.m3u8?tag=29&v=cfc\"}\n{\"url\": \"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2082451034341834752/vid/avc1/732x720/smg1U1vMoX9-gCC7.mp4?tag=29\"}\n{\"url\": \"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2082451034341834752/vid/avc1/1080x1060/0kxqv3GVimkpVh5_.mp4?tag=29\"}\n{\"description\": \"I own a few apps. currently at $200k MRR, sharing daily B2C scaling strategies. founder of @tryviewtrack\", \"name\": \"Ernesto Lopez\", \"url\": \"https://x.com/ErnestoSOFTWARE\"}\n{\"text\": \"I own a few apps. currently at $200k MRR, sharing daily B2C scaling strategies. founder of @tryviewtrack\"}\n{\"text\": \"https://t.co/bI99JKujeH\"}\n{\"author\": {\"avatar_url\": \"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1930138018951643136/wEgZY178_200x200.jpg\", \"banner_url\": \"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1890388644273258496/1742417398\", \"description\": \"I own a few apps. currently at $200k MRR, sharing daily B2C scaling strategies. founder of @tryviewtrack\", \"followers\": 58726, \"following\": 794, \"id\": \"1890388644273258496\", \"joined\": \"Fri Feb 14 13:12:38 +0000 2025\", \"likes\": 13792, \"location\": \"\", \"media_count\": 1917, \"name\": \"Ernesto Lopez\", \"protected\": false, \"raw_description\": {\"facets\": [], \"text\": \"I own a few apps. currently at $200k MRR, sharing daily B2C scaling strategies. founder of @tryviewtrack\"}, \"screen_name\": \"ErnestoSOFTWARE\", \"statuses\": 7090, \"type\": \"profile\", \"url\": \"https://x.com/ErnestoSOFTWARE\", \"verification\": {\"type\": \"individual\", \"verified\": true, \"verified_at\": null}, \"website\": null}, \"created_at\": \"Fri Jun 19 15:35:35 +0000 2026\", \"text\": \"\", \"url\": \"https://x.com/ErnestoSOFTWARE/status/2067994710841360596\"}\n{\"content\": {\"blocks\": [{\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"6r4ll\", \"text\": \"There is an app called 75HER pulling $200,000 a month right now, Go look at their TikTok videos, Every video looks like a real women sharing their before and after transformation.... yet none of those women are real.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"c11k8\", \"text\": \"Every creator in their UGC program is an AI character. \\nThis is only the beginning of the future\\n\\na new form of marketing is here, \\nand this app is only proof of how powerful it already is.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [{\"key\": 0, \"length\": 6, \"offset\": 126}], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"fudar\", \"text\": \"Im this article I am going to break down exactly how 75HER does this, \\nand how you copy the whole system for your app \\n\\nusing Arcads MCP Step by step.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [{\"key\": 1, \"length\": 1, \"offset\": 0}], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"8ts82\", \"text\": \" \", \"type\": \"atomic\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"c8vqc\", \"text\": \"How the 75HER app makes $200k/mo\", \"type\": \"header-two\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"7murp\", \"text\": \"75HER is a women's fitness app built around the 75 Hard challenge.\\nbut targeting only women, which is a great choice \\n\\nConsidering women are some of the most impulsive buyers. \\nwhich is part of the reason they are printing $200k/mo\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [{\"key\": 2, \"length\": 1, \"offset\": 0}], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"cidcs\", \"text\": \" \", \"type\": \"atomic\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"2dkt3\", \"text\": \"Their whole content strategy is drastic before and afters of the women\\n\\nbefore being fat \\nafter being ripped  \\n\\nwhich is VERY easy to do with AI \\nnot only is this content strategy genius, but its also very profitable.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"1bu9j\", \"text\": \"Real human UGC runs $15-25 per video \\nAI UGC videos: $0.20 cents per video\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"4b4fk\", \"text\": \"so not only are they at $200k/mo their margins are probably insane. \\nSince they don't have to spend that much money on marketing.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"ebtdm\", \"text\": \"but enough yapping, let's break down their entire system right now:\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [{\"key\": 3, \"length\": 1, \"offset\": 0}], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"862vr\", \"text\": \" \", \"type\": \"atomic\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"54cq6\", \"text\": \"so now that you've seen the system actually works, let me break down exactly how to build it yourself.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"36cjv\", \"text\": \"Step 1: Set up the MCP\", \"type\": \"header-two\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"1chu8\", \"text\": \"With RCATS, it generates videos.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"3a0fu\", \"text\": \"Here's how you set up the MCP so Claude can run it for you.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"8orl5\", \"text\": \"the MCP is just what lets Claude actually use RCATS for you. instead of you sitting there clicking through a dashboard, Claude talks to it directly and does the work.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"9ssbp\", \"text\": \"you set it up once and you don't really have to touch it again.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"bbuk8\", \"text\": \"Step 2: Talk to Claude\", \"type\": \"header-two\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"aph74\", \"text\": \"once the MCP is connected, you don't prompt a video tool anymore.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"79h7c\", \"text\": \"you just talk to Claude like you would a creative director.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [{\"key\": 4, \"length\": 6, \"offset\": 36}], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"89egi\", \"text\": \"you tell him what you want, he runs Arcads, and the videos comes back.\\nbut before he can make anything, you need to give him a character to work with.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"99kt5\", \"text\": \"Step 3: Create your character\", \"type\": \"header-two\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"1lvr2\", \"text\": \"this is the part most people skip, \\nand its exactly why their videos end up looking fake.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"5pc36\", \"text\": \"before you make any video you first need a reference \\nfor who your character actually is.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"84td6\", \"text\": \"so you describe them to Claude, and you have to be insanely specific:\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [{\"key\": 5, \"length\": 6, \"offset\": 334}, {\"key\": 6, \"length\": 6, \"offset\": 386}], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"e6q64\", \"text\": \"→ Age, ethnicity, hair color, skin tone\\n→ Lighting ( natural, gym lighting, golden hour )\\n→ Environment ( gym, kitchen, outdoor, bedroom )\\n→ Accessories ( water bottle, resistance band, airpods )\\n→ Vibe ( serious athlete, wellness girlie, biohacker, morning routine guy )\\n\\nthe best way is to start from a real human \\nand send that to arcads then change it up with nano banana inside of arcads.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"291c3\", \"text\": \"the before is the problem and the after is the result. \\n\\nthat contrast is basically the whole hook, people stop \\nscrolling for the transformation\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"ak2db\", \"text\": \"generate a few and keep the 2-3 that look the most real.\\nexample of before and after below\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [{\"key\": 7, \"length\": 1, \"offset\": 0}], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"u6iu\", \"text\": \" \", \"type\": \"atomic\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"c4h57\", \"text\": \"now you have a character thats real enough to build a whole account around.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"5aic3\", \"text\": \"Step 4: Make them move\", \"type\": \"header-two\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"bk3rv\", \"text\": \"a static image is only where you start.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [{\"key\": 8, \"length\": 6, \"offset\": 498}], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"8bg6p\", \"text\": \"now you need actual moving footage, and this is where most people overcomplicate it.\\n\\n they spend hours trying to prompt realistic motion, sending the longest prompts trying to get the girl to pose and it just looks un-natural\\n\\nthere's a much easier way.\\nDownload a video from pinterest of someone posing \\n\\nsend that video to Gemini and tell it to analyze every body movement\\nAsk it to give you a prompt to replicate those exact movements\\n\\nthen send the prompt to Claude + the start image \\nand the arcads mcp will take care of the rest.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"eo699\", \"text\": \"Super simple.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"auuan\", \"text\": \"Step 5: Edit and add your CTA\", \"type\": \"header-two\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"datp3\", \"text\": \"Once you have both the before and after videos \\nyou can have claude literally stitch them together\\n\\nWhat I personally did is I vibe coded myself a web editor \\nThat Claude can use and that way i can see how it works\\n\\nThat way I see what he is working on \\nThen make sure to add a call to action to your videos in the caption\\n\\nor in the comments \\nsimilar to how the 75 her app does it\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [{\"key\": 9, \"length\": 1, \"offset\": 0}], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"24sfa\", \"text\": \" \", \"type\": \"atomic\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [{\"length\": 47, \"offset\": 0, \"style\": \"Bold\"}], \"key\": \"di8im\", \"text\": \"Step 6: Automate the whole pipeline with Claude\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"97bpo\", \"text\": \"at this point you have a system thats repeatable, \\nso now let's make the whole thing run without you.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [{\"length\": 63, \"offset\": 429, \"style\": \"Bold\"}], \"key\": \"64s1o\", \"text\": \"since the MCP is connected,\\nClaude doesn't just make one video, he runs the entire pipeline.\\n\\nhe can now \\n→ Make the before and after videos\\n→ Put them together\\n→ And edit elements on top\\n\\nSo all you have to do is post those videos and wait to go viral, \\nMost of the virality will actually come from your characters\\n\\nAnd the before and after format you chose to replicate\\nbecause there are multiple, just follow whats trending.\\n\\nand to actually distribute the content you can do 1 of 2 things\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [{\"length\": 25, \"offset\": 0, \"style\": \"Bold\"}], \"key\": \"1icuv\", \"text\": \"1 You can do it manually by creating a few accounts on your phone. You can do up to five per phone and then buy a few phones and constantly be posting yourself.\", \"type\": \"ordered-list-item\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [{\"length\": 24, \"offset\": 0, \"style\": \"Bold\"}], \"key\": \"98h0d\", \"text\": \"2 you can do what we do, \\n\\nwhich is pay somebody $50 a week per account to post.\\n\\nBasically, for $200 a month, we have them post 60 videos across Instagram, TikTok, and YouTube. \\n\\nIt saves us a lot of time because, at scale, this can get pretty tedious, but that is what we do. \\n\\nWe don't use any posting service except for YouTube because that can get you shadow banned pretty quickly\", \"type\": \"ordered-list-item\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"evdkf\", \"text\": \"Step 7: Print views and scale your app\", \"type\": \"header-two\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [{\"key\": 10, \"length\": 1, \"offset\": 0}], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"v13b\", \"text\": \" \", \"type\": \"atomic\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"2cpmh\", \"text\": \"once your AI influencers start performing, if your CTA is good, you'll start seeing spikes in downloads and sales for your app.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"5ud59\", \"text\": \"at that point you take the influencer videos that already worked in organic, and you put them behind paid ads.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"5ude7\", \"text\": \"and thats how $200k/mo apps are born.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"d14mn\", \"text\": \"except now you have full control over the content, \\nand you don't need to micro manage any influencers.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"1daf7\", \"text\": \"you are the influencer now, the orchestrator.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"56cli\", \"text\": \"if you found this guide useful feel free to doomscroll my account, I share sauce on how to make money with apps every day.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}], \"entityMap\": [{\"key\": \"8\", \"value\": {\"data\": {\"url\": \"http://www.arcads.ai/?comet_custom=ernestoSOFTWARE\"}, \"mutability\": \"Mutable\", \"type\": \"LINK\"}}, {\"key\": \"4\", \"value\": {\"data\": {\"url\": \"http://www.arcads.ai/?comet_custom=ernestoSOFTWARE\"}, \"mutability\": \"Mutable\", \"type\": \"LINK\"}}, {\"key\": \"9\", \"value\": {\"data\": {\"entityKey\": \"6b59bfb6-98d3-44dc-b7ec-dc8bce65a232\", \"mediaItems\": [{\"localMediaId\": \"7\", \"mediaCategory\": \"DraftTweetImage\", \"mediaId\": \"2067990137368137728\"}]}, \"mutability\": \"Immutable\", \"type\": \"MEDIA\"}}, {\"key\": \"5\", \"value\": {\"data\": {\"url\": \"http://www.arcads.ai/?comet_custom=ernestoSOFTWARE\"}, \"mutability\": \"Mutable\", \"type\": \"LINK\"}}, {\"key\": \"10\", \"value\": {\"data\": {\"entityKey\": \"9329be4b-2ca5-4025-9271-00e5953b7be6\", \"mediaItems\": [{\"localMediaId\": \"9\", \"mediaCategory\": \"DraftTweetImage\", \"mediaId\": \"2067990183018942464\"}]}, \"mutability\": \"Immutable\", \"type\": \"MEDIA\"}}, {\"key\": \"6\", \"value\": {\"data\": {\"url\": \"http://www.arcads.ai/?comet_custom=ernestoSOFTWARE\"}, \"mutability\": \"Mutable\", \"type\": \"LINK\"}}, {\"key\": \"1\", \"value\": {\"data\": {\"entityKey\": \"a6058e30-a744-42e0-85ab-b352b17b68d2\", \"mediaItems\": [{\"localMediaId\": \"11\", \"mediaCategory\": \"AmplifyVideo\", \"mediaId\": \"2067990291043188737\"}]}, \"mutability\": \"Immutable\", \"type\": \"MEDIA\"}}, {\"key\": \"0\", \"value\": {\"data\": {\"url\": \"http://www.arcads.ai/?comet_custom=ernestoSOFTWARE\"}, \"mutability\": \"Mutable\", \"type\": \"LINK\"}}, {\"key\": \"2\", \"value\": {\"data\": {\"entityKey\": \"5998ae66-e36a-4275-9f13-2340547fc84e\", \"mediaItems\": [{\"localMediaId\": \"1\", \"mediaCategory\": \"DraftTweetImage\", \"mediaId\": \"2067989721943343104\"}]}, \"mutability\": \"Immutable\", \"type\": \"MEDIA\"}}, {\"key\": \"7\", \"value\": {\"data\": {\"entityKey\": \"b1a17e7b-53a5-4253-9985-56617f21da83\", \"mediaItems\": [{\"localMediaId\": \"5\", \"mediaCategory\": \"DraftTweetImage\", \"mediaId\": \"2067990088840044544\"}]}, \"mutability\": \"Immutable\", \"type\": \"MEDIA\"}}, {\"key\": \"3\", \"value\": {\"data\": {\"entityKey\": \"131d9bd6-d3d2-4bdf-a38a-848ed77af0fd\", \"mediaItems\": [{\"localMediaId\": \"3\", \"mediaCategory\": \"DraftTweetImage\", \"mediaId\": \"2067989778637750272\"}]}, \"mutability\": \"Immutable\", \"type\": \"MEDIA\"}}]}, \"created_at\": \"2026-06-19T15:35:35.000Z\", \"title\": \"This app makes $200K/month with 10 AI UGC creators ( full guide )\"}\n{\"text\": \"There is an app called 75HER pulling $200,000 a month right now, Go look at their TikTok videos, Every video looks like a real women sharing their before and after transformation.... yet none of those women are real.\"}\n{\"text\": \"Every creator in their UGC program is an AI character. \\nThis is only the beginning of the future\\n\\na new form of marketing is here, \\nand this app is only proof of how powerful it already is.\"}\n{\"text\": \"Im this article I am going to break down exactly how 75HER does this, \\nand how you copy the whole system for your app \\n\\nusing Arcads MCP Step by step.\"}\n{\"text\": \" \"}\n{\"text\": \"How the 75HER app makes $200k/mo\"}\n{\"text\": \"75HER is a women's fitness app built around the 75 Hard challenge.\\nbut targeting only women, which is a great choice \\n\\nConsidering women are some of the most impulsive buyers. \\nwhich is part of the reason they are printing $200k/mo\"}\n{\"text\": \" \"}\n{\"text\": \"Their whole content strategy is drastic before and afters of the women\\n\\nbefore being fat \\nafter being ripped  \\n\\nwhich is VERY easy to do with AI \\nnot only is this content strategy genius, but its also very profitable.\"}\n{\"text\": \"Real human UGC runs $15-25 per video \\nAI UGC videos: $0.20 cents per video\"}\n{\"text\": \"so not only are they at $200k/mo their margins are probably insane. \\nSince they don't have to spend that much money on marketing.\"}\n{\"text\": \"but enough yapping, let's break down their entire system right now:\"}\n{\"text\": \" \"}\n{\"text\": \"so now that you've seen the system actually works, let me break down exactly how to build it yourself.\"}\n{\"text\": \"Step 1: Set up the MCP\"}\n{\"text\": \"With RCATS, it generates videos.\"}\n{\"text\": \"Here's how you set up the MCP so Claude can run it for you.\"}\n{\"text\": \"the MCP is just what lets Claude actually use RCATS for you. instead of you sitting there clicking through a dashboard, Claude talks to it directly and does the work.\"}\n{\"text\": \"you set it up once and you don't really have to touch it again.\"}\n{\"text\": \"Step 2: Talk to Claude\"}\n{\"text\": \"once the MCP is connected, you don't prompt a video tool anymore.\"}\n{\"text\": \"you just talk to Claude like you would a creative director.\"}\n{\"text\": \"you tell him what you want, he runs Arcads, and the videos comes back.\\nbut before he can make anything, you need to give him a character to work with.\"}\n{\"text\": \"Step 3: Create your character\"}\n{\"text\": \"this is the part most people skip, \\nand its exactly why their videos end up looking fake.\"}\n{\"text\": \"before you make any video you first need a reference \\nfor who your character actually is.\"}\n{\"text\": \"so you describe them to Claude, and you have to be insanely specific:\"}\n{\"text\": \"→ Age, ethnicity, hair color, skin tone\\n→ Lighting ( natural, gym lighting, golden hour )\\n→ Environment ( gym, kitchen, outdoor, bedroom )\\n→ Accessories ( water bottle, resistance band, airpods )\\n→ Vibe ( serious athlete, wellness girlie, biohacker, morning routine guy )\\n\\nthe best way is to start from a real human \\nand send that to arcads then change it up with nano banana inside of arcads.\"}\n{\"text\": \"the before is the problem and the after is the result. \\n\\nthat contrast is basically the whole hook, people stop \\nscrolling for the transformation\"}\n{\"text\": \"generate a few and keep the 2-3 that look the most real.\\nexample of before and after below\"}\n{\"text\": \" \"}\n{\"text\": \"now you have a character thats real enough to build a whole account around.\"}\n{\"text\": \"Step 4: Make them move\"}\n{\"text\": \"a static image is only where you start.\"}\n{\"text\": \"now you need actual moving footage, and this is where most people overcomplicate it.\\n\\n they spend hours trying to prompt realistic motion, sending the longest prompts trying to get the girl to pose and it just looks un-natural\\n\\nthere's a much easier way.\\nDownload a video from pinterest of someone posing \\n\\nsend that video to Gemini and tell it to analyze every body movement\\nAsk it to give you a prompt to replicate those exact movements\\n\\nthen send the prompt to Claude + the start image \\nand the arcads mcp will take care of the rest.\"}\n{\"text\": \"Super simple.\"}\n{\"text\": \"Step 5: Edit and add your CTA\"}\n{\"text\": \"Once you have both the before and after videos \\nyou can have claude literally stitch them together\\n\\nWhat I personally did is I vibe coded myself a web editor \\nThat Claude can use and that way i can see how it works\\n\\nThat way I see what he is working on \\nThen make sure to add a call to action to your videos in the caption\\n\\nor in the comments \\nsimilar to how the 75 her app does it\"}\n{\"text\": \" \"}\n{\"text\": \"Step 6: Automate the whole pipeline with Claude\"}\n{\"text\": \"at this point you have a system thats repeatable, \\nso now let's make the whole thing run without you.\"}\n{\"text\": \"since the MCP is connected,\\nClaude doesn't just make one video, he runs the entire pipeline.\\n\\nhe can now \\n→ Make the before and after videos\\n→ Put them together\\n→ And edit elements on top\\n\\nSo all you have to do is post those videos and wait to go viral, \\nMost of the virality will actually come from your characters\\n\\nAnd the before and after format you chose to replicate\\nbecause there are multiple, just follow whats trending.\\n\\nand to actually distribute the content you can do 1 of 2 things\"}\n{\"text\": \"1 You can do it manually by creating a few accounts on your phone. You can do up to five per phone and then buy a few phones and constantly be posting yourself.\"}\n{\"text\": \"2 you can do what we do, \\n\\nwhich is pay somebody $50 a week per account to post.\\n\\nBasically, for $200 a month, we have them post 60 videos across Instagram, TikTok, and YouTube. \\n\\nIt saves us a lot of time because, at scale, this can get pretty tedious, but that is what we do. \\n\\nWe don't use any posting service except for YouTube because that can get you shadow banned pretty quickly\"}\n{\"text\": \"Step 7: Print views and scale your app\"}\n{\"text\": \" \"}\n{\"text\": \"once your AI influencers start performing, if your CTA is good, you'll start seeing spikes in downloads and sales for your app.\"}\n{\"text\": \"at that point you take the influencer videos that already worked in organic, and you put them behind paid ads.\"}\n{\"text\": \"and thats how $200k/mo apps are born.\"}\n{\"text\": \"except now you have full control over the content, \\nand you don't need to micro manage any influencers.\"}\n{\"text\": \"you are the influencer now, the orchestrator.\"}\n{\"text\": \"if you found this guide useful feel free to doomscroll my account, I share sauce on how to make money with apps every day.\"}\n{\"url\": \"http://www.arcads.ai/?comet_custom=ernestoSOFTWARE\"}\n{\"url\": \"http://www.arcads.ai/?comet_custom=ernestoSOFTWARE\"}\n{\"url\": \"http://www.arcads.ai/?comet_custom=ernestoSOFTWARE\"}\n{\"url\": \"http://www.arcads.ai/?comet_custom=ernestoSOFTWARE\"}\n{\"url\": \"http://www.arcads.ai/?comet_custom=ernestoSOFTWARE\"}\n{\"url\": \"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2067990291043188737/vid/avc1/2348x1840/Scu855McrdOl87t1.mp4?tag=28\"}\n{\"url\": \"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2067990291043188737/vid/avc1/1378x1080/8SzSc4VEqsHHKamP.mp4?tag=28\"}\n{\"url\": \"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2067990291043188737/pl/RLOxRTSH8f0s0Xpz.m3u8?tag=28&v=cfc\"}\n{\"url\": \"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2067990291043188737/vid/avc1/458x360/hD2SWtw-h6qOIvOq.mp4?tag=28\"}\n{\"url\": \"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2067990291043188737/vid/avc1/918x720/_53riOCkeYpFhyEa.mp4?tag=28\"}\n{\"url\": \"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2067990291043188737/vid/avc1/344x270/HbMXbCVnh5eaLzNo.mp4?tag=28\"}\n{\"description\": \"I own a few apps. currently at $200k MRR, sharing daily B2C scaling strategies. founder of @tryviewtrack\", \"name\": \"Ernesto Lopez\", \"url\": \"https://x.com/ErnestoSOFTWARE\"}\n{\"text\": \"I own a few apps. currently at $200k MRR, sharing daily B2C scaling strategies. founder of @tryviewtrack\"}\n{\"text\": \"https://t.co/MalWXQnGZa\"}\n{\"author\": {\"avatar_url\": \"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1930138018951643136/wEgZY178_200x200.jpg\", \"banner_url\": \"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1890388644273258496/1742417398\", \"description\": \"I own a few apps. currently at $200k MRR, sharing daily B2C scaling strategies. founder of @tryviewtrack\", \"followers\": 58728, \"following\": 794, \"id\": \"1890388644273258496\", \"joined\": \"Fri Feb 14 13:12:38 +0000 2025\", \"likes\": 13792, \"location\": \"\", \"media_count\": 1917, \"name\": \"Ernesto Lopez\", \"protected\": false, \"raw_description\": {\"facets\": [], \"text\": \"I own a few apps. currently at $200k MRR, sharing daily B2C scaling strategies. founder of @tryviewtrack\"}, \"screen_name\": \"ErnestoSOFTWARE\", \"statuses\": 7090, \"type\": \"profile\", \"url\": \"https://x.com/ErnestoSOFTWARE\", \"verification\": {\"type\": \"individual\", \"verified\": true, \"verified_at\": null}, \"website\": null}, \"created_at\": \"Thu Jun 04 17:08:06 +0000 2026\", \"text\": \"\", \"url\": \"https://x.com/ErnestoSOFTWARE/status/2062582178236727320\"}\n{\"content\": {\"blocks\": [{\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"dtp68\", \"text\": \"we automated an entire AI UGC studio with Claude + Higgsfield AI for context I make $1M+/yr across my apps and businesses. and very recently we scaled one of our apps to $720,000/yr and #22 on the appstore.\\n\\nWe did this with a combination of Meta ads, tiktok ads and UGC. \\n\\nthe most effective being UGC, however.. UGC can get quite expensive at scale, think about it \\n\\n$15 per video  x 2 videos per day\\n$30 per creator/day * 7 days in the week\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"20c9h\", \"text\": \"its $210/week or $900/mo \\nwithout counting the virality bonuses.\\n\\nif our team is 30 creators we are looking to spend\\n$27,000/mo just base on creators.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [{\"key\": 0, \"length\": 1, \"offset\": 0}], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"evkv6\", \"text\": \" \", \"type\": \"atomic\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"fopvl\", \"text\": \"and with our campaign generating over many millions of views/mo we \\nof course have creators hitting bonuses quite often.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"8h7ta\", \"text\": \"this is not unprofitable for us at all. \\nwe see great margins from our UGC efforts.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"1rlbo\", \"text\": \"the only problem is.. that to expand your team from 10  to 20 creators for example it gets complicated.\\n\\ninstead of just hiring 10 more people\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"5pqv4\", \"text\": \"you end up having to hire 30 more, then end up firing about 70% of them\\nuntil you are left with the top 10 from that batch that you can keep long term\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"4sabf\", \"text\": \"this is just how UGC works, usually most of the results from your UGC campaign will come from the top 20% of creators.\\n\\nthe other 20 are basically a waste of money. \\nSo we built a system to fix this.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [{\"length\": 35, \"offset\": 0, \"style\": \"Bold\"}], \"key\": \"70aju\", \"text\": \"I combined Claude + higgsfield mcp which is now thats generating us 100s of new realisitc UGC videos daily.\\n\\nthis allows us to test new formats for pennies on the dollar.\\nThe whole thing runs without us touching it.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [{\"length\": 13, \"offset\": 185, \"style\": \"Bold\"}], \"key\": \"6k799\", \"text\": \"This is not theory, AI really is there now.\\n\\nwe have seen some  AI videos get as high as \\n10k-50k+ views and have many comments asking whats the app.\\n\\nWhich proves that this converts.\\n\\n( DISCLAIMER: always disclose that your videos are AI generated with a tag or somewhere on your post ) 99% won't notice the tag, but it's important to disclose to avoid any legal issues.\\n\\nwe have also spoken to multiple founders running this AI ugc playbook\\nwith apps making over $100k/mo purely from AI content.\\n\\nand the cost per video is basically < $0 for us, because we are sponsored by higgsfield haha, but for you it would be around a $29 or $39 subscription \\n\\nin this article ill break down our exact system to make Realistic AI UGC at scale.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"eglei\", \"text\": \"#1 connect higgsfield MCP ( super easy )\", \"type\": \"header-two\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [{\"key\": 1, \"length\": 1, \"offset\": 0}], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"7srcg\", \"text\": \" \", \"type\": \"atomic\"}, {\"data\": {\"urls\": [{\"fromIndex\": 38, \"text\": \"higgsfield.ai/cli\", \"toIndex\": 55}]}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"ea5tq\", \"text\": \"This part is super simlple just go to higgsfield.ai/cli\\nsend the command on your terminal or just send it to claude\\n\\nand just like that you gave Claude a weapon of mass generation.\\nClaude can now generate world-class images and videos at scale.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [{\"length\": 25, \"offset\": 0, \"style\": \"Bold\"}], \"key\": \"44kpb\", \"text\": \"#2 Research viral scripts\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {\"urls\": [{\"fromIndex\": 262, \"text\": \"viewtrack.app\", \"toIndex\": 275}]}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"4b4ov\", \"text\": \"You cannot prompt your way to virality. \\nYou need data aka Viral formats in your niche that are proven to work.\\n\\nThen and only then you can use claude + higgs to recreate them.\\n\\nyou can find plenty of viral formats by doom scrolling on your niche \\n\\nor inside of viewtrack.app we have a collection of over 4000+ \\nviral formats you can take inspiration from.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [{\"key\": 2, \"length\": 1, \"offset\": 0}], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"dtc6p\", \"text\": \" \", \"type\": \"atomic\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"297v3\", \"text\": \"#3 GENERATE THE CHARACTER ( Nano Banana Pro )\", \"type\": \"header-two\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"3ai86\", \"text\": \"You can use the MCP for this but i prefer to do this in higgsfield UI first \\nThen delegating video creation to the MCP \\n\\nTo make your character its super simple\\nget clear on how you want your character to look\\n\\nmake sure to go for what works best in your niche\\nthese things matter a lot to go viral\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"bcn50\", \"text\": \"-> Age, ethnicity, hair, skin\\n-> Lighting (gym, golden hour, natural)\\n-> Environment (kitchen, gym, bedroom)\\n-> Accessories (resistance band, AirPods, water bottle)\\n-> Vibe (biohacker, wellness girlie, morning routine guy)\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"c2q3u\", \"text\": \"once you are clear on those variables\\ngo to pinterest and literally look for someone who matches those characteristics\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [{\"key\": 3, \"length\": 1, \"offset\": 0}], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"464fj\", \"text\": \" \", \"type\": \"atomic\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"6jgte\", \"text\": \"in this case let's say I want to use a guy that is in his car talking to the camera\\nI will use a pinterest image as a reference point\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"1ri15\", \"text\": \"then get that picture and send it to higgsfield\\n and make some edits to the character by prompting it.\\n\\nto end up with a completely different look but in a realistic enviroment.\\n\\nbut having a starting image of a real person will ensure your final result also looks real which is the goal here. \\n\\nplease be ethical and don't steal anyones identity. ( it's ilegal )\\nonce you have that character down you are ready to mass produce videos\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"cj4bq\", \"text\": \"#4 THE CONTENT FACTORY\", \"type\": \"header-two\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [{\"length\": 39, \"offset\": 0, \"style\": \"Bold\"}], \"key\": \"cu36l\", \"text\": \"We are in the ERA of 24 hour software. With a claude max plan of $200/mo you are virtually unstoppable in what you can create.\\n\\nWhich is why I recommend to create your own website with your own workflow\\nand have claude + higgs MCP drop videos in there. \\n\\nthink about it like this\\n\\n> Claude is your executioner \\n> Higgsfield is your artist \\n> your workflow is what ties everything together.\\n\\nIn our case we made a custom website that stiches everthing togehter\\nhiggs can also do this using their new feature Super computer.\\n\\nbut for our use case its a little different.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"7b6mj\", \"text\": \"higgsfield generates four 15 second seedance videos which is the max length a seedance video can be.\\n\\nthen we have claude drop that video into our custom website and \\n\\nthen the website stitches them together and automatically\\nedits them.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [{\"key\": 4, \"length\": 1, \"offset\": 0}], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"bc128\", \"text\": \" \", \"type\": \"atomic\"}, {\"data\": {\"mentions\": [{\"fromIndex\": 187, \"text\": \"postbridge\", \"toIndex\": 198}]}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"655h0\", \"text\": \"In summarythe complexity of automating this can vary depending on what format you are trying to replicate.\\n\\nBut ultimately everything can be done with enough prompting.\\n\\nThen you can use @postbridge to schedule out the content to Tiktok, Youtube and Instagram right from the custom platform.\\n\\nand thats literally it, now you have a content factory that can generate unlimited videos for unlimited characters\\n\\nAnd post them across dozens of accounts.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [{\"key\": 5, \"length\": 1, \"offset\": 0}], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"dducq\", \"text\": \" \", \"type\": \"atomic\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"c5knu\", \"text\": \"IN SUMARRY\", \"type\": \"header-two\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"4ueov\", \"text\": \"> connect your higgsfield MCP\\n> find a viral format to replicate\\n> create your character using nano banana in higgs\\n> have the MCP generate the video using your start image\\n> create your own custom website to scheduele out content and auto edit it\\n> generate 100s of new creatives per day and post them out\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"60lb9\", \"text\": \"try this for your app and thank me later.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}], \"entityMap\": [{\"key\": \"4\", \"value\": {\"data\": {\"entityKey\": \"c0d8cdd9-fccd-4c3d-8dd8-a40d0c405849\", \"mediaItems\": [{\"localMediaId\": \"11\", \"mediaCategory\": \"DraftTweetImage\", \"mediaId\": \"2062578706036436992\"}]}, \"mutability\": \"Immutable\", \"type\": \"MEDIA\"}}, {\"key\": \"5\", \"value\": {\"data\": {\"entityKey\": \"86078e59-aec0-4860-aef4-7f3edd0ccfa7\", \"mediaItems\": [{\"localMediaId\": \"13\", \"mediaCategory\": \"DraftTweetImage\", \"mediaId\": \"2062578756183584768\"}]}, \"mutability\": \"Immutable\", \"type\": \"MEDIA\"}}, {\"key\": \"1\", \"value\": {\"data\": {\"entityKey\": \"9cf0da91-f951-4a3a-af71-ac1cd5c367b0\", \"mediaItems\": [{\"localMediaId\": \"5\", \"mediaCategory\": \"DraftTweetImage\", \"mediaId\": \"2062578528055361536\"}]}, \"mutability\": \"Immutable\", \"type\": \"MEDIA\"}}, {\"key\": \"0\", \"value\": {\"data\": {\"entityKey\": \"2bac28c7-50ee-4af7-8cb2-c765274ec0f0\", \"mediaItems\": [{\"localMediaId\": \"3\", \"mediaCategory\": \"DraftTweetImage\", \"mediaId\": \"2062578458400583680\"}]}, \"mutability\": \"Immutable\", \"type\": \"MEDIA\"}}, {\"key\": \"2\", \"value\": {\"data\": {\"entityKey\": \"dd178d39-9e37-42ee-9b09-03482d6114af\", \"mediaItems\": [{\"localMediaId\": \"7\", \"mediaCategory\": \"DraftTweetImage\", \"mediaId\": \"2062578576008851456\"}]}, \"mutability\": \"Immutable\", \"type\": \"MEDIA\"}}, {\"key\": \"3\", \"value\": {\"data\": {\"entityKey\": \"07fc2ef8-ce7a-4e08-bfaa-4b00873b0f1c\", \"mediaItems\": [{\"localMediaId\": \"9\", \"mediaCategory\": \"DraftTweetImage\", \"mediaId\": \"2062578641771413504\"}]}, \"mutability\": \"Immutable\", \"type\": \"MEDIA\"}}]}, \"created_at\": \"2026-06-04T17:08:06.000Z\", \"title\": \"Our app makes $720,000/yr and print 8M views/week using this agentic AI UGC system.\"}\n{\"text\": \"we automated an entire AI UGC studio with Claude + Higgsfield AI for context I make $1M+/yr across my apps and businesses. and very recently we scaled one of our apps to $720,000/yr and #22 on the appstore.\\n\\nWe did this with a combination of Meta ads, tiktok ads and UGC. \\n\\nthe most effective being UGC, however.. UGC can get quite expensive at scale, think about it \\n\\n$15 per video  x 2 videos per day\\n$30 per creator/day * 7 days in the week\"}\n{\"text\": \"its $210/week or $900/mo \\nwithout counting the virality bonuses.\\n\\nif our team is 30 creators we are looking to spend\\n$27,000/mo just base on creators.\"}\n{\"text\": \" \"}\n{\"text\": \"and with our campaign generating over many millions of views/mo we \\nof course have creators hitting bonuses quite often.\"}\n{\"text\": \"this is not unprofitable for us at all. \\nwe see great margins from our UGC efforts.\"}\n{\"text\": \"the only problem is.. that to expand your team from 10  to 20 creators for example it gets complicated.\\n\\ninstead of just hiring 10 more people\"}\n{\"text\": \"you end up having to hire 30 more, then end up firing about 70% of them\\nuntil you are left with the top 10 from that batch that you can keep long term\"}\n{\"text\": \"this is just how UGC works, usually most of the results from your UGC campaign will come from the top 20% of creators.\\n\\nthe other 20 are basically a waste of money. \\nSo we built a system to fix this.\"}\n{\"text\": \"I combined Claude + higgsfield mcp which is now thats generating us 100s of new realisitc UGC videos daily.\\n\\nthis allows us to test new formats for pennies on the dollar.\\nThe whole thing runs without us touching it.\"}\n{\"text\": \"This is not theory, AI really is there now.\\n\\nwe have seen some  AI videos get as high as \\n10k-50k+ views and have many comments asking whats the app.\\n\\nWhich proves that this converts.\\n\\n( DISCLAIMER: always disclose that your videos are AI generated with a tag or somewhere on your post ) 99% won't notice the tag, but it's important to disclose to avoid any legal issues.\\n\\nwe have also spoken to multiple founders running this AI ugc playbook\\nwith apps making over $100k/mo purely from AI content.\\n\\nand the cost per video is basically < $0 for us, because we are sponsored by higgsfield haha, but for you it would be around a $29 or $39 subscription \\n\\nin this article ill break down our exact system to make Realistic AI UGC at scale.\"}\n{\"text\": \"#1 connect higgsfield MCP ( super easy )\"}\n{\"text\": \" \"}\n{\"text\": \"This part is super simlple just go to higgsfield.ai/cli\\nsend the command on your terminal or just send it to claude\\n\\nand just like that you gave Claude a weapon of mass generation.\\nClaude can now generate world-class images and videos at scale.\"}\n{\"text\": \"higgsfield.ai/cli\"}\n{\"text\": \"#2 Research viral scripts\"}\n{\"text\": \"You cannot prompt your way to virality. \\nYou need data aka Viral formats in your niche that are proven to work.\\n\\nThen and only then you can use claude + higgs to recreate them.\\n\\nyou can find plenty of viral formats by doom scrolling on your niche \\n\\nor inside of viewtrack.app we have a collection of over 4000+ \\nviral formats you can take inspiration from.\"}\n{\"text\": \"viewtrack.app\"}\n{\"text\": \" \"}\n{\"text\": \"#3 GENERATE THE CHARACTER ( Nano Banana Pro )\"}\n{\"text\": \"You can use the MCP for this but i prefer to do this in higgsfield UI first \\nThen delegating video creation to the MCP \\n\\nTo make your character its super simple\\nget clear on how you want your character to look\\n\\nmake sure to go for what works best in your niche\\nthese things matter a lot to go viral\"}\n{\"text\": \"-> Age, ethnicity, hair, skin\\n-> Lighting (gym, golden hour, natural)\\n-> Environment (kitchen, gym, bedroom)\\n-> Accessories (resistance band, AirPods, water bottle)\\n-> Vibe (biohacker, wellness girlie, morning routine guy)\"}\n{\"text\": \"once you are clear on those variables\\ngo to pinterest and literally look for someone who matches those characteristics\"}\n{\"text\": \" \"}\n{\"text\": \"in this case let's say I want to use a guy that is in his car talking to the camera\\nI will use a pinterest image as a reference point\"}\n{\"text\": \"then get that picture and send it to higgsfield\\n and make some edits to the character by prompting it.\\n\\nto end up with a completely different look but in a realistic enviroment.\\n\\nbut having a starting image of a real person will ensure your final result also looks real which is the goal here. \\n\\nplease be ethical and don't steal anyones identity. ( it's ilegal )\\nonce you have that character down you are ready to mass produce videos\"}\n{\"text\": \"#4 THE CONTENT FACTORY\"}\n{\"text\": \"We are in the ERA of 24 hour software. With a claude max plan of $200/mo you are virtually unstoppable in what you can create.\\n\\nWhich is why I recommend to create your own website with your own workflow\\nand have claude + higgs MCP drop videos in there. \\n\\nthink about it like this\\n\\n> Claude is your executioner \\n> Higgsfield is your artist \\n> your workflow is what ties everything together.\\n\\nIn our case we made a custom website that stiches everthing togehter\\nhiggs can also do this using their new feature Super computer.\\n\\nbut for our use case its a little different.\"}\n{\"text\": \"higgsfield generates four 15 second seedance videos which is the max length a seedance video can be.\\n\\nthen we have claude drop that video into our custom website and \\n\\nthen the website stitches them together and automatically\\nedits them.\"}\n{\"text\": \" \"}\n{\"text\": \"In summarythe complexity of automating this can vary depending on what format you are trying to replicate.\\n\\nBut ultimately everything can be done with enough prompting.\\n\\nThen you can use @postbridge to schedule out the content to Tiktok, Youtube and Instagram right from the custom platform.\\n\\nand thats literally it, now you have a content factory that can generate unlimited videos for unlimited characters\\n\\nAnd post them across dozens of accounts.\"}\n{\"text\": \"postbridge\"}\n{\"text\": \" \"}\n{\"text\": \"IN SUMARRY\"}\n{\"text\": \"> connect your higgsfield MCP\\n> find a viral format to replicate\\n> create your character using nano banana in higgs\\n> have the MCP generate the video using your start image\\n> create your own custom website to scheduele out content and auto edit it\\n> generate 100s of new creatives per day and post them out\"}\n{\"text\": \"try this for your app and thank me later.\"}\n{\"description\": \"I own a few apps. currently at $200k MRR, sharing daily B2C scaling strategies. founder of @tryviewtrack\", \"name\": \"Ernesto Lopez\", \"url\": \"https://x.com/ErnestoSOFTWARE\"}\n{\"text\": \"I own a few apps. currently at $200k MRR, sharing daily B2C scaling strategies. founder of @tryviewtrack\"}\n{\"text\": \"https://t.co/vwKQ5fWGMd\"}\n{\"author\": {\"avatar_url\": \"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1930138018951643136/wEgZY178_200x200.jpg\", \"banner_url\": \"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1890388644273258496/1742417398\", \"description\": \"I own a few apps. currently at $200k MRR, sharing daily B2C scaling strategies. founder of @tryviewtrack\", \"followers\": 58728, \"following\": 794, \"id\": \"1890388644273258496\", \"joined\": \"Fri Feb 14 13:12:38 +0000 2025\", \"likes\": 13792, \"location\": \"\", \"media_count\": 1917, \"name\": \"Ernesto Lopez\", \"protected\": false, \"raw_description\": {\"facets\": [], \"text\": \"I own a few apps. currently at $200k MRR, sharing daily B2C scaling strategies. founder of @tryviewtrack\"}, \"screen_name\": \"ErnestoSOFTWARE\", \"statuses\": 7090, \"type\": \"profile\", \"url\": \"https://x.com/ErnestoSOFTWARE\", \"verification\": {\"type\": \"individual\", \"verified\": true, \"verified_at\": null}, \"website\": null}, \"created_at\": \"Tue May 19 14:14:19 +0000 2026\", \"text\": \"\", \"url\": \"https://x.com/ErnestoSOFTWARE/status/2056740238890766383\"}\n{\"content\": {\"blocks\": [{\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [{\"length\": 28, \"offset\": 78, \"style\": \"Bold\"}], \"key\": \"7of27\", \"text\": \"We have scaled our business to over $1M/yr with  projects across every space, B2C apps, SaaS and services.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"aannd\", \"text\": \"And so far SaaS has been the hardest to crack by a mile.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"43qfh\", \"text\": \"With B2C apps the formula is pretty simple.\\n→ You get attention,\\n→ build a good onboarding,\\n→ add a strong paywall\\n→ and scale with creators or paid ads.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"2he85\", \"text\": \"Services are also pretty straight forward.\\n→ You find a painful problem,\\n→ find the people with the proble\\n→ sell the outcome, \\n→and fulfill the service.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"8dhd1\", \"text\": \"But SaaS is different, because mostly you are selling to other founders\\nspecially if your SAAS is X based\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"dd6q4\", \"text\": \"but we found a clear blueprint on how anyone can take their SaaS\\nfrom $0 to $10k MRR from doing it ourselves\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [{\"key\": 0, \"length\": 1, \"offset\": 0}], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"31q2a\", \"text\": \" \", \"type\": \"atomic\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"3avto\", \"text\": \"\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"bhgrc\", \"text\": \"1. Build software from your own pain\", \"type\": \"header-two\"}, {\"data\": {\"urls\": [{\"fromIndex\": 0, \"text\": \"viewtrack.app\", \"toIndex\": 13}]}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"d968j\", \"text\": \"viewtrack.app came from a problem inside our own business\\nMost people start SaaS by asking the wrong question.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"5j875\", \"text\": \"They ask “what SaaS should I build?” \\n\\nwhen the better question is what problem am I already dealing with every day that could be turned into software.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"6ngcs\", \"text\": \"That is exactly how Viewtrack started.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"5hm56\", \"text\": \"We were scaling multiple apps with creators. \\n\\nUGC creators, influencers, faceless pages, organic content.\\nAt first, it was manageable because we only had a few creators.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"19vqr\", \"text\": \"But once you start working with 10, 20, 30+ creators,\\n the whole thing starts breaking.\\n\\nso we said why don't we simply creator tracking from this: \", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [{\"key\": 1, \"length\": 1, \"offset\": 0}], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"as7gn\", \"text\": \" \", \"type\": \"atomic\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"d2nsr\", \"text\": \"to this: \", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [{\"key\": 2, \"length\": 1, \"offset\": 0}], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"31kq9\", \"text\": \" \", \"type\": \"atomic\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"4nunj\", \"text\": \"And when you are running creator campaigns for apps, \\nthis is not a small problem.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"8lkhe\", \"text\": \"This is directly tied to revenue.\\n If they use the wrong CTA, you lose downloads.\\n\\nIf you don’t know which videos are working, you can’t scale.\\nSo Viewtrack was not some random idea we pulled out of nowhere.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"6adbc\", \"text\": \"It was software we needed for ourselves.\\n\\nThe best SaaS ideas usually come from a problem \\nyou already understand deeply.\\n\\nwhen you understand the pain, \\n\\nyou know exactly what needs to be built.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"dme58\", \"text\": \"2. Validate the pain before building too much\", \"type\": \"header-two\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"fuo6h\", \"text\": \"Once you find a problem, \\ndon’t disappear for 6 months building a giant product nobody will use.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"f8m2e\", \"text\": \"That is how founders waste their life.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"e98eg\", \"text\": \"The goal is to find out if other people have the same problem\\nbefore you overbuild.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"5j4ut\", \"text\": \"For Viewtrack, the validation was pretty obvious because we were already talking to founders, agencies and creators every day.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"8r8e2\", \"text\": \"Everyone running UGC had some version of the same mess.\\nThat is usually a good sign.\\n\\nbut for your SAAS you can validate on reddit or looking for the top people in your space and dming people in their comments.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"4cp72\", \"text\": \"Your job is to build a version that saves time and ultimately helps them make more money..\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"9vk8r\", \"text\": \"3. Build the smallest useful version\", \"type\": \"header-two\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"81gnu\", \"text\": \"Your first version should not be huge. \\nIt should be useful.\\n\\nmost founders overbuild \\nWhich is literally why most of them make $0\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"brgq4\", \"text\": \"For Viewtrack, the first version only needed to answer a few questions.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"18uol\", \"text\": \"Who are the creators? \\nWhat are they supposed to post?\\nWhen are they supposed to post? \\nDid they post? \\nHow many views did they get? \\nWhich creators are actually worth keeping?\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"fomug\", \"text\": \"That’s the all we needed to solve for mvp 1.\\n\\nVersion 1 should be simple enough that you can send it out to a few people\\nand use it for it's core purpose.\\n\\nfor example this is viewtrack MVP1 vs how it looks now\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [{\"key\": 3, \"length\": 1, \"offset\": 0}], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"81jck\", \"text\": \" \", \"type\": \"atomic\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"fr2em\", \"text\": \"\\n4. HOW TO ACTUALLY GET SALES THROUGH X MARKETING\", \"type\": \"header-two\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"7c7a\", \"text\": \"The most important part here is to not be a bot.\\nMost founders post on X like clankers.\\n\\n They say stuff like “just launched my new SaaS” \\nor “excited to announce” literally nobody cares g.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"fbigg\", \"text\": \"You need a format that actually gets attention.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"1ql6\", \"text\": \"I’ve been doing X for about a year now, and the main reason it worked is because I shared my own experiences and real valuable information in my niche.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"c2ul6\", \"text\": \"So now when I launched something like Viewtrack, \\npeople already know I’m not just saying random stuff.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"4vbrn\", \"text\": \"They have seen me scale apps with creators before.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"d6huc\", \"text\": \"That’s why I think it’s ideal to build a SaaS around something you have already done yourself, which will help your X strategy\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"3c4ro\", \"text\": \"For Viewtrack, I started making posts that i knew would go super viral.\\nX loves free sauce. \\n\\nSo instead of saying \\\" go try viewtrack \\\"\\n\\nI gave away valuable information while displaying Viewtrack in action \\nAnd that got me 500k views with just 1 post\\n\\nthen to convert i simply added a small CTA in the visual + in the text copy.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [{\"key\": 4, \"length\": 1, \"offset\": 0}], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"btmsi\", \"text\": \" \", \"type\": \"atomic\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"7kfsq\", \"text\": \"People click because the information is good,\\nand then they realize theres a product they can use behind it.\\n\\nThat is how you should market on X.\\ndon't talk about your SAAS show your SAAS in action.\\n\\nit may take some time, but consistency is key.\\nbig accounts like mine with 50k+ followers \\n\\nalso  started with 0 followers at some point \", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"1ueea\", \"text\": \"5. Prevent churn \", \"type\": \"header-two\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"b7nfa\", \"text\": \"Once you have a banger product and actually start getting sales, the most important part is preventing churn.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"5ej2m\", \"text\": \"This is where SaaS gets annoying.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"8t9a\", \"text\": \"Because most users don’t churn because your product is trash.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"bsd45\", \"text\": \"A lot of the time they churn because they literally don’t understand how to use it.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"1tt3e\", \"text\": \"Especially with a product like Viewtrack.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"5tuu8\", \"text\": \"The product has a ton of different capabilities, so if someone signs up and gets overwhelmed, the easiest thing for them to do is just leave.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"6tvcq\", \"text\": \"That is what we are trying to prevent.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"ealh9\", \"text\": \"This is where Poly is insane.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"9kge6\", \"text\": \"We use Poly to have a voice agent inside the product that users can talk to whenever they get confused.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"ddfre\", \"text\": \"The agent talks super clearly, just like a human, and it is trained on the whole platform.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"452nh\", \"text\": \"So when a user clicks the little button, the agent can see their dashboard, understand what they are trying to do, and guide them through the exact question they have.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"btpus\", \"text\": \"It’s literally like being on a call with a specialist.\\n\\n\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [{\"key\": 5, \"length\": 1, \"offset\": 0}], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"7c7c0\", \"text\": \" \", \"type\": \"atomic\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"8uj2d\", \"text\": \"Except you don’t need to hire a whole support team.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"fh3jh\", \"text\": \"And hiring a support team for every confused user gets expensive fast.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"5ceqn\", \"text\": \"With Poly, you can basically give every user instant help without adding a ton of overhead.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"5nc2r\", \"text\": \"and thats an easy way to reduce churn by 30% to 50%\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"62itp\", \"text\": \"The $0 to $10k MRR blueprint\", \"type\": \"header-two\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"3lrlj\", \"text\": \"those are the 5 steps i would follow to build a world class $10k/mrr SAAS from scratch all over again. \\n\\nif you found this article useful!  feel free to follow me for more value.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}], \"entityMap\": [{\"key\": \"4\", \"value\": {\"data\": {\"entityKey\": \"27452d13-6ecd-4a0f-bd82-71d7ed8bca5e\", \"mediaItems\": [{\"localMediaId\": \"1\", \"mediaCategory\": \"AmplifyVideo\", \"mediaId\": \"2056111557067632640\"}]}, \"mutability\": \"Immutable\", \"type\": \"MEDIA\"}}, {\"key\": \"5\", \"value\": {\"data\": {\"entityKey\": \"2b054f58-fba6-4987-947e-422d2379895c\", \"mediaItems\": [{\"localMediaId\": \"23\", \"mediaCategory\": \"DraftTweetImage\", \"mediaId\": \"2056121811562004481\"}]}, \"mutability\": \"Immutable\", \"type\": \"MEDIA\"}}, {\"key\": \"1\", \"value\": {\"data\": {\"entityKey\": \"c08b3461-bde7-4ed2-a9f1-c961cc5603af\", \"mediaItems\": [{\"localMediaId\": \"7\", \"mediaCategory\": \"DraftTweetImage\", \"mediaId\": \"2056114834538704896\"}]}, \"mutability\": \"Immutable\", \"type\": \"MEDIA\"}}, {\"key\": \"0\", \"value\": {\"data\": {\"entityKey\": \"6eaf40d7-9480-45ba-a955-5fc7f9c3827d\", \"mediaItems\": [{\"localMediaId\": \"5\", \"mediaCategory\": \"DraftTweetImage\", \"mediaId\": \"2056114547455356928\"}]}, \"mutability\": \"Immutable\", \"type\": \"MEDIA\"}}, {\"key\": \"2\", \"value\": {\"data\": {\"entityKey\": \"a39fb961-6529-402f-8ba9-6f02237d00da\", \"mediaItems\": [{\"localMediaId\": \"14\", \"mediaCategory\": \"DraftTweetImage\", \"mediaId\": \"2056115659008831488\"}]}, \"mutability\": \"Immutable\", \"type\": \"MEDIA\"}}, {\"key\": \"3\", \"value\": {\"data\": {\"entityKey\": \"d6ef1eb2-a5e4-43c1-813f-3944df7b395b\", \"mediaItems\": [{\"localMediaId\": \"21\", \"mediaCategory\": \"DraftTweetImage\", \"mediaId\": \"2056117110003089408\"}]}, \"mutability\": \"Immutable\", \"type\": \"MEDIA\"}}]}, \"created_at\": \"2026-05-19T14:14:19.000Z\", \"title\": \"HOW TO BUILD A $10K/MO SAAS ( in 5 simple steps )\"}\n{\"text\": \"We have scaled our business to over $1M/yr with  projects across every space, B2C apps, SaaS and services.\"}\n{\"text\": \"And so far SaaS has been the hardest to crack by a mile.\"}\n{\"text\": \"With B2C apps the formula is pretty simple.\\n→ You get attention,\\n→ build a good onboarding,\\n→ add a strong paywall\\n→ and scale with creators or paid ads.\"}\n{\"text\": \"Services are also pretty straight forward.\\n→ You find a painful problem,\\n→ find the people with the proble\\n→ sell the outcome, \\n→and fulfill the service.\"}\n{\"text\": \"But SaaS is different, because mostly you are selling to other founders\\nspecially if your SAAS is X based\"}\n{\"text\": \"but we found a clear blueprint on how anyone can take their SaaS\\nfrom $0 to $10k MRR from doing it ourselves\"}\n{\"text\": \" \"}\n{\"text\": \"\"}\n{\"text\": \"1. Build software from your own pain\"}\n{\"text\": \"viewtrack.app came from a problem inside our own business\\nMost people start SaaS by asking the wrong question.\"}\n{\"text\": \"viewtrack.app\"}\n{\"text\": \"They ask “what SaaS should I build?” \\n\\nwhen the better question is what problem am I already dealing with every day that could be turned into software.\"}\n{\"text\": \"That is exactly how Viewtrack started.\"}\n{\"text\": \"We were scaling multiple apps with creators. \\n\\nUGC creators, influencers, faceless pages, organic content.\\nAt first, it was manageable because we only had a few creators.\"}\n{\"text\": \"But once you start working with 10, 20, 30+ creators,\\n the whole thing starts breaking.\\n\\nso we said why don't we simply creator tracking from this: \"}\n{\"text\": \" \"}\n{\"text\": \"to this: \"}\n{\"text\": \" \"}\n{\"text\": \"And when you are running creator campaigns for apps, \\nthis is not a small problem.\"}\n{\"text\": \"This is directly tied to revenue.\\n If they use the wrong CTA, you lose downloads.\\n\\nIf you don’t know which videos are working, you can’t scale.\\nSo Viewtrack was not some random idea we pulled out of nowhere.\"}\n{\"text\": \"It was software we needed for ourselves.\\n\\nThe best SaaS ideas usually come from a problem \\nyou already understand deeply.\\n\\nwhen you understand the pain, \\n\\nyou know exactly what needs to be built.\"}\n{\"text\": \"2. Validate the pain before building too much\"}\n{\"text\": \"Once you find a problem, \\ndon’t disappear for 6 months building a giant product nobody will use.\"}\n{\"text\": \"That is how founders waste their life.\"}\n{\"text\": \"The goal is to find out if other people have the same problem\\nbefore you overbuild.\"}\n{\"text\": \"For Viewtrack, the validation was pretty obvious because we were already talking to founders, agencies and creators every day.\"}\n{\"text\": \"Everyone running UGC had some version of the same mess.\\nThat is usually a good sign.\\n\\nbut for your SAAS you can validate on reddit or looking for the top people in your space and dming people in their comments.\"}\n{\"text\": \"Your job is to build a version that saves time and ultimately helps them make more money..\"}\n{\"text\": \"3. Build the smallest useful version\"}\n{\"text\": \"Your first version should not be huge. \\nIt should be useful.\\n\\nmost founders overbuild \\nWhich is literally why most of them make $0\"}\n{\"text\": \"For Viewtrack, the first version only needed to answer a few questions.\"}\n{\"text\": \"Who are the creators? \\nWhat are they supposed to post?\\nWhen are they supposed to post? \\nDid they post? \\nHow many views did they get? \\nWhich creators are actually worth keeping?\"}\n{\"text\": \"That’s the all we needed to solve for mvp 1.\\n\\nVersion 1 should be simple enough that you can send it out to a few people\\nand use it for it's core purpose.\\n\\nfor example this is viewtrack MVP1 vs how it looks now\"}\n{\"text\": \" \"}\n{\"text\": \"\\n4. HOW TO ACTUALLY GET SALES THROUGH X MARKETING\"}\n{\"text\": \"The most important part here is to not be a bot.\\nMost founders post on X like clankers.\\n\\n They say stuff like “just launched my new SaaS” \\nor “excited to announce” literally nobody cares g.\"}\n{\"text\": \"You need a format that actually gets attention.\"}\n{\"text\": \"I’ve been doing X for about a year now, and the main reason it worked is because I shared my own experiences and real valuable information in my niche.\"}\n{\"text\": \"So now when I launched something like Viewtrack, \\npeople already know I’m not just saying random stuff.\"}\n{\"text\": \"They have seen me scale apps with creators before.\"}\n{\"text\": \"That’s why I think it’s ideal to build a SaaS around something you have already done yourself, which will help your X strategy\"}\n{\"text\": \"For Viewtrack, I started making posts that i knew would go super viral.\\nX loves free sauce. \\n\\nSo instead of saying \\\" go try viewtrack \\\"\\n\\nI gave away valuable information while displaying Viewtrack in action \\nAnd that got me 500k views with just 1 post\\n\\nthen to convert i simply added a small CTA in the visual + in the text copy.\"}\n{\"text\": \" \"}\n{\"text\": \"People click because the information is good,\\nand then they realize theres a product they can use behind it.\\n\\nThat is how you should market on X.\\ndon't talk about your SAAS show your SAAS in action.\\n\\nit may take some time, but consistency is key.\\nbig accounts like mine with 50k+ followers \\n\\nalso  started with 0 followers at some point \"}\n{\"text\": \"5. Prevent churn \"}\n{\"text\": \"Once you have a banger product and actually start getting sales, the most important part is preventing churn.\"}\n{\"text\": \"This is where SaaS gets annoying.\"}\n{\"text\": \"Because most users don’t churn because your product is trash.\"}\n{\"text\": \"A lot of the time they churn because they literally don’t understand how to use it.\"}\n{\"text\": \"Especially with a product like Viewtrack.\"}\n{\"text\": \"The product has a ton of different capabilities, so if someone signs up and gets overwhelmed, the easiest thing for them to do is just leave.\"}\n{\"text\": \"That is what we are trying to prevent.\"}\n{\"text\": \"This is where Poly is insane.\"}\n{\"text\": \"We use Poly to have a voice agent inside the product that users can talk to whenever they get confused.\"}\n{\"text\": \"The agent talks super clearly, just like a human, and it is trained on the whole platform.\"}\n{\"text\": \"So when a user clicks the little button, the agent can see their dashboard, understand what they are trying to do, and guide them through the exact question they have.\"}\n{\"text\": \"It’s literally like being on a call with a specialist.\\n\\n\"}\n{\"text\": \" \"}\n{\"text\": \"Except you don’t need to hire a whole support team.\"}\n{\"text\": \"And hiring a support team for every confused user gets expensive fast.\"}\n{\"text\": \"With Poly, you can basically give every user instant help without adding a ton of overhead.\"}\n{\"text\": \"and thats an easy way to reduce churn by 30% to 50%\"}\n{\"text\": \"The $0 to $10k MRR blueprint\"}\n{\"text\": \"those are the 5 steps i would follow to build a world class $10k/mrr SAAS from scratch all over again. \\n\\nif you found this article useful!  feel free to follow me for more value.\"}\n{\"url\": \"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2056111557067632640/vid/avc1/344x270/6myreqx_ch4NbiPj.mp4?tag=27\"}\n{\"url\": \"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2056111557067632640/vid/avc1/1378x1080/J705QD_UOX8n2Rru.mp4?tag=27\"}\n{\"url\": \"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2056111557067632640/vid/avc1/918x720/__YoLKStKGRgjVDb.mp4?tag=27\"}\n{\"url\": \"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2056111557067632640/vid/avc1/458x360/uBg1zLOQFsdbypgX.mp4?tag=27\"}\n{\"url\": \"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2056111557067632640/pl/vlKY472ZoxbzjRLj.m3u8?tag=27\"}\n{\"description\": \"I own a few apps. currently at $200k MRR, sharing daily B2C scaling strategies. founder of @tryviewtrack\", \"name\": \"Ernesto Lopez\", \"url\": \"https://x.com/ErnestoSOFTWARE\"}\n{\"text\": \"I own a few apps. currently at $200k MRR, sharing daily B2C scaling strategies. founder of @tryviewtrack\"}\n{\"text\": \"https://t.co/UVi5HEaz1e\"}\n{\"author\": {\"avatar_url\": \"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1930138018951643136/wEgZY178_200x200.jpg\", \"banner_url\": \"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1890388644273258496/1742417398\", \"description\": \"I own a few apps. currently at $200k MRR, sharing daily B2C scaling strategies. founder of @tryviewtrack\", \"followers\": 58728, \"following\": 794, \"id\": \"1890388644273258496\", \"joined\": \"Fri Feb 14 13:12:38 +0000 2025\", \"likes\": 13792, \"location\": \"\", \"media_count\": 1917, \"name\": \"Ernesto Lopez\", \"protected\": false, \"raw_description\": {\"facets\": [], \"text\": \"I own a few apps. currently at $200k MRR, sharing daily B2C scaling strategies. founder of @tryviewtrack\"}, \"screen_name\": \"ErnestoSOFTWARE\", \"statuses\": 7090, \"type\": \"profile\", \"url\": \"https://x.com/ErnestoSOFTWARE\", \"verification\": {\"type\": \"individual\", \"verified\": true, \"verified_at\": null}, \"website\": null}, \"created_at\": \"Fri May 15 20:11:57 +0000 2026\", \"text\": \"\", \"url\": \"https://x.com/ErnestoSOFTWARE/status/2055380685452640538\"}\n{\"content\": {\"blocks\": [{\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"953v5\", \"text\": \"Last 2 weeks we generated 17M views with an army of 30 UGC creators\\nwhich is great, yet this posed a problem we had not thought about before.\\n\\nrunning a team at this scale  is costing us over $6,000/week base,  but its working... our revenue nearly tripled in the last 2 weeks and our app is ranking #30 in the appstore.\\n\\nlast week it was more like $10,000 in spend between ads and our UGC team\\nwhich is normal when you mass hire. \\n\\nbecause 90% of our UGC campaigns success comes from the top 5-6 creators the rest are mostly noise.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [{\"key\": 0, \"length\": 1, \"offset\": 0}], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"cvqec\", \"text\": \" \", \"type\": \"atomic\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"2b97m\", \"text\": \"These cost will obviously decrease as we fire the creators that are not performing and keep the killers.\\n\\nbut i encourage you to watch $10,000 leaving your bank account every week \\nit really makes you ask yourself some questions. \\n\\nand for us that question was, how do we take our margins from 30% to 70%\\nand become extremely profitable? \", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"5ljh7\", \"text\": \"and the answer to that question is the reason i'm writing this article. \", \"type\": \"header-two\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [{\"length\": 38, \"offset\": 684, \"style\": \"Bold\"}], \"key\": \"8jtrd\", \"text\": \"We paid a guy $3.5k last week in bonuses \\n\\nand he told us that he was surprised we wanted to continue \\nworking with him.\\n\\nHe explained that most brands he works with fire him after he goes viral.\\n\\nIn my opinion thats either because their product sucks or because they have no money to sustain the cost. \\n\\nThankfully we have a great app all around that helps us stay profitable nonetheless.\\n\\nso while the average NGMI founder is stopping their UGC campaing\\nwe are thinking how do we go beyond 30 creators \\n\\nHow do we get 60 creators without having to double our weekly spend which would be $12,000/week \\n\\nand thats when we turned our eyes toward AI UGC\\n\\nviral content is no more than \\nHook, script, face, delivery, post.  \\n\\nits a system, a system that can skillfully be replicated with AI. \\nand distributed at mass scale to create the same effect of Real UGC\\n\\nat 1/10th of the cost, this is why I deeply believe AI ugc is the future.\\n\\nwe have already started to test AI ugc and it works \\nwith some of our videos getting up to 18k views.\\n\\nand while thats not a lot, we literally just started, and nobody knows it's AI\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [{\"key\": 1, \"length\": 1, \"offset\": 0}], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"5l46e\", \"text\": \" \", \"type\": \"atomic\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"fm9ec\", \"text\": \"AI ugc is not a theory, its all around us already.  \\nI've talked to the team from a looks maxing app  \\n\\nthey're doing over $30k/mo  running only AI UGC content.\\n\\nI also talked to another 18yo kid who scaled his quit gooning app to $10k/mo with 1 single AI UGC creator.\\n\\nthere are plenty of examples so let me just list them a few out here:\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [{\"key\": 2, \"length\": 1, \"offset\": 0}], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"6li5h\", \"text\": \" \", \"type\": \"atomic\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [{\"key\": 3, \"length\": 1, \"offset\": 0}], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"4plg2\", \"text\": \" \", \"type\": \"atomic\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [{\"key\": 4, \"length\": 1, \"offset\": 0}], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"bog37\", \"text\": \" \", \"type\": \"atomic\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [{\"key\": 5, \"length\": 1, \"offset\": 0}], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"btbcn\", \"text\": \" \", \"type\": \"atomic\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"1be46\", \"text\": \"\", \"type\": \"header-two\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [{\"key\": 6, \"length\": 1, \"offset\": 0}], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"623cn\", \"text\": \" \", \"type\": \"atomic\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"cff9n\", \"text\": \"\\nThese accounts alone together have generated over 300+ million views, but how do you actually build an AI UGC creator\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"2tags\", \"text\": \"What I learned from talking to a founder making $100k/mo with AI UGC\", \"type\": \"header-two\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"bilg3\", \"text\": \"I wanted to see how the top killers in the AI UGC space were scaling\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [{\"length\": 44, \"offset\": 182, \"style\": \"Bold\"}], \"key\": \"9cimn\", \"text\": \"So I got on a call with a founder making $100k/mo with his app that he is scaling with AI UGC, he has been on starter story with verified metrics.\\n\\nhe gave me a super simple system\\n\\n1.  you find a format that already works. \\n\\nfind videos that already went viral in your niche.\\n\\nFor us, this is easy because our real UGC creators already \\nshowed us what works.\\n\\nbut you can find this by just scrolling on your niche.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"a8ppd\", \"text\": \"so he basically takes the winning viral format, him and his team finds\\nand rebuild them with AI.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"38dvj\", \"text\": \"Then they break the video down.\\nEvery viral UGC video is basically:\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"44c2g\", \"text\": \"Hook → Script →Face → Delivery .\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"2tnss\", \"text\": \"Once you see it that way, it stops being a video \\nand becomes a recipe  that can be automated.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [{\"length\": 33, \"offset\": 0, \"style\": \"Bold\"}], \"key\": \"27rj1\", \"text\": \"2. you build your AI UGC creator.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [{\"key\": 7, \"length\": 1, \"offset\": 0}], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"40tjk\", \"text\": \" \", \"type\": \"atomic\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"7dvib\", \"text\": \"\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"6k5i9\", \"text\": \"you can run the whole thing through Higgsfield Supercomputer.  so you give higgsfield supercomputer the winning format,  the creator and the prompt.\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"fjp8e\", \"text\": \"and It handles the rest.\\nScript, Video Editing, Final asset.\\n\\nAnd the best part is once you get the AI video back if it looks good.\\nyou can just tell higgs super computer  to create your 100s of variations \\n\\nAnd then again spread that across 5-10 influencers\\nAnd now you literally have an army.\\n\\nI've already created 4 influencers for our app\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [{\"key\": 8, \"length\": 1, \"offset\": 0}], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"8i52p\", \"text\": \" \", \"type\": \"atomic\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [{\"length\": 59, \"offset\": 0, \"style\": \"Bold\"}], \"key\": \"bom14\", \"text\": \"3. Scale with clippers \\n\\nOnce you have your AI ugc creators \", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"entityRanges\": [], \"inlineStyleRanges\": [], \"key\": \"mkbi\", \"text\": \"you can basically hire US based clippers for $100 a month,literally, to just hit post on the videos that you give them, \\n\\n ideally someone you know like you 14yo cousin with a scrolling addiction. \\n\\nsince Higgsfield already edits the videos for you and makes them for you. \\nyou just give the clippers a google drive folder with the content to post\\n\\nIf you don't wanna fully automate it, it's fine to start just posting yourself. \\n\\nYou can do up to 4 or 8  account in your own phone , and if you run out of space just buy a new iphone 8 for $250 and run up 8 more.\\n\\nShadow bans don't exist. \\nand so now instead of paying $900/mo per creator \\n\\nyou can pay  $30-$100/mo per realistic AI UGC creator that you make.\\n\\nand thats literally all you have to do. \\n\\nI will keep using  this tech and keep you guys posted on how this continues to work for us.\\n\\nbe sure to follow for more daily sauce like this!\\n\", \"type\": \"unstyled\"}], \"entityMap\": [{\"key\": \"8\", \"value\": {\"data\": {\"entityKey\": \"0591eaa3-a4a6-413b-92d3-17d511c6e0e1\", \"mediaItems\": [{\"localMediaId\": \"28\", \"mediaCategory\": \"DraftTweetImage\", \"mediaId\": \"2055119664225656832\"}]}, \"mutability\": \"Immutable\", \"type\": \"MEDIA\"}}, {\"key\": \"4\", \"value\": {\"data\": {\"entityKey\": \"bb77f28b-534e-4ad7-ab4a-2499ce772ca4\", \"mediaItems\": [{\"localMediaId\": \"12\", \"mediaCategory\": \"AmplifyVideo\", \"mediaId\": \"2055117754051481600\"}]}, \"mutability\": \"Immutable\", \"type\": \"MEDIA\"}}, {\"key\": \"5\", \"value\": {\"data\": {\"entityKey\": \"2dd7055b-a1c8-49ad-8662-8c5f9abb0b62\", \"mediaItems\": [{\"localMediaId\": \"16\", \"mediaCategory\": \"AmplifyVideo\", \"mediaId\": \"2055117865531908096\"}]}, \"mutability\": \"Immutable\", \"type\": \"MEDIA\"}}, {\"key\": \"6\", \"value\": {\"data\": {\"entityKey\": \"66ca9ac0-b91f-4b17-8d8e-5a4388df2dfb\", \"mediaItems\": [{\"localMediaId\": \"23\", \"mediaCategory\": \"AmplifyVideo\", \"mediaId\": \"2055118074542489600\"}]}, \"mutability\": \"Immutable\", \"type\": \"MEDIA\"}}, {\"key\": \"1\", \"value\": {\"data\": {\"entityKey\": \"d3e4c68f-45fb-408a-b1b9-617dc27a3cec\", \"mediaItems\": [{\"localMediaId\": \"31\", \"mediaCategory\": \"DraftTweetImage\", \"mediaId\": \"2055120237872168960\"}]}, \"mutability\": \"Immutable\", \"type\": \"MEDIA\"}}, {\"key\": \"0\", \"value\": {\"data\": {\"entityKey\": \"4e1967fb-58dd-44cf-b5f5-60164258ae29\", \"mediaItems\": [{\"localMediaId\": \"2\", \"mediaCategory\": \"DraftTweetImage\", \"mediaId\": \"2055078890956013568\"}]}, \"mutability\": \"Immutable\", \"type\": \"MEDIA\"}}, {\"key\": \"2\", \"value\": {\"data\": {\"entityKey\": \"4610d09c-62e5-4d7b-890b-cd78c78b6a6b\", \"mediaItems\": [{\"localMediaId\": \"3\", \"mediaCategory\": \"AmplifyVideo\", \"mediaId\": \"2055096528679686144\"}]}, \"mutability\": \"Immutable\", \"type\": \"MEDIA\"}}, {\"key\": \"7\", \"value\": {\"data\": {\"entityKey\": \"1a58d160-d60a-4395-b086-3f976dfc1253\", \"mediaItems\": [{\"localMediaId\": \"10\", \"mediaCategory\": \"AmplifyVideo\", \"mediaId\": \"2055167361766879232\"}]}, \"mutability\": \"Immutable\", \"type\": \"MEDIA\"}}, {\"key\": \"3\", \"value\": {\"data\": {\"entityKey\": \"54027b61-81d1-4dd2-b0f8-ee00897d909a\", \"mediaItems\": [{\"localMediaId\": \"14\", \"mediaCategory\": \"AmplifyVideo\", \"mediaId\": \"2055117831969116160\"}]}, \"mutability\": \"Immutable\", \"type\": \"MEDIA\"}}]}, \"created_at\": \"2026-05-15T20:11:57.000Z\", \"title\": \"How we scaled our APP to $50K/mo and 8M views per week.\"}\n{\"text\": \"Last 2 weeks we generated 17M views with an army of 30 UGC creators\\nwhich is great, yet this posed a problem we had not thought about before.\\n\\nrunning a team at this scale  is costing us over $6,000/week base,  but its working... our revenue nearly tripled in the last 2 weeks and our app is ranking #30 in the appstore.\\n\\nlast week it was more like $10,000 in spend between ads and our UGC team\\nwhich is normal when you mass hire. \\n\\nbecause 90% of our UGC campaigns success comes from the top 5-6 creators the rest are mostly noise.\"}\n{\"text\": \" \"}\n{\"text\": \"These cost will obviously decrease as we fire the creators that are not performing and keep the killers.\\n\\nbut i encourage you to watch $10,000 leaving your bank account every week \\nit really makes you ask yourself some questions. \\n\\nand for us that question was, how do we take our margins from 30% to 70%\\nand become extremely profitable? \"}\n{\"text\": \"and the answer to that question is the reason i'm writing this article. \"}\n{\"text\": \"We paid a guy $3.5k last week in bonuses \\n\\nand he told us that he was surprised we wanted to continue \\nworking with him.\\n\\nHe explained that most brands he works with fire him after he goes viral.\\n\\nIn my opinion thats either because their product sucks or because they have no money to sustain the cost. \\n\\nThankfully we have a great app all around that helps us stay profitable nonetheless.\\n\\nso while the average NGMI founder is stopping their UGC campaing\\nwe are thinking how do we go beyond 30 creators \\n\\nHow do we get 60 creators without having to double our weekly spend which would be $12,000/week \\n\\nand thats when we turned our eyes toward AI UGC\\n\\nviral content is no more than \\nHook, script, face, delivery, post.  \\n\\nits a system, a system that can skillfully be replicated with AI. \\nand distributed at mass scale to create the same effect of Real UGC\\n\\nat 1/10th of the cost, this is why I deeply believe AI ugc is the future.\\n\\nwe have already started to test AI ugc and it works \\nwith some of our videos getting up to 18k views.\\n\\nand while thats not a lot, we literally just started, and nobody knows it's AI\"}\n{\"text\": \" \"}\n{\"text\": \"AI ugc is not a theory, its all around us already.  \\nI've talked to the team from a looks maxing app  \\n\\nthey're doing over $30k/mo  running only AI UGC content.\\n\\nI also talked to another 18yo kid who scaled his quit gooning app to $10k/mo with 1 single AI UGC creator.\\n\\nthere are plenty of examples so let me just list them a few out here:\"}\n{\"text\": \" \"}\n{\"text\": \" \"}\n{\"text\": \" \"}\n{\"text\": \" \"}\n{\"text\": \"\"}\n{\"text\": \" \"}\n{\"text\": \"\\nThese accounts alone together have generated over 300+ million views, but how do you actually build an AI UGC creator\"}\n{\"text\": \"What I learned from talking to a founder making $100k/mo with AI UGC\"}\n{\"text\": \"I wanted to see how the top killers in the AI UGC space were scaling\"}\n{\"text\": \"So I got on a call with a founder making $100k/mo with his app that he is scaling with AI UGC, he has been on starter story with verified metrics.\\n\\nhe gave me a super simple system\\n\\n1.  you find a format that already works. \\n\\nfind videos that already went viral in your niche.\\n\\nFor us, this is easy because our real UGC creators already \\nshowed us what works.\\n\\nbut you can find this by just scrolling on your niche.\"}\n{\"text\": \"so he basically takes the winning viral format, him and his team finds\\nand rebuild them with AI.\"}\n{\"text\": \"Then they break the video down.\\nEvery viral UGC video is basically:\"}\n{\"text\": \"Hook → Script →Face → Delivery .\"}\n{\"text\": \"Once you see it that way, it stops being a video \\nand becomes a recipe  that can be automated.\"}\n{\"text\": \"2. you build your AI UGC creator.\"}\n{\"text\": \" \"}\n{\"text\": \"\"}\n{\"text\": \"you can run the whole thing through Higgsfield Supercomputer.  so you give higgsfield supercomputer the winning format,  the creator and the prompt.\"}\n{\"text\": \"and It handles the rest.\\nScript, Video Editing, Final asset.\\n\\nAnd the best part is once you get the AI video back if it looks good.\\nyou can just tell higgs super computer  to create your 100s of variations \\n\\nAnd then again spread that across 5-10 influencers\\nAnd now you literally have an army.\\n\\nI've already created 4 influencers for our app\"}\n{\"text\": \" \"}\n{\"text\": \"3. Scale with clippers \\n\\nOnce you have your AI ugc creators \"}\n{\"text\": \"you can basically hire US based clippers for $100 a month,literally, to just hit post on the videos that you give them, \\n\\n ideally someone you know like you 14yo cousin with a scrolling addiction. \\n\\nsince Higgsfield already edits the videos for you and makes them for you. \\nyou just give the clippers a google drive folder with the content to post\\n\\nIf you don't wanna fully automate it, it's fine to start just posting yourself. \\n\\nYou can do up to 4 or 8  account in your own phone , and if you run out of space just buy a new iphone 8 for $250 and run up 8 more.\\n\\nShadow bans don't exist. \\nand so now instead of paying $900/mo per creator \\n\\nyou can pay  $30-$100/mo per realistic AI UGC creator that you make.\\n\\nand thats literally all you have to do. \\n\\nI will keep using  this tech and keep you guys posted on how this continues to work for us.\\n\\nbe sure to follow for more daily sauce like this!\\n\"}\n{\"url\": \"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2055117865531908096/vid/avc1/1378x1080/kPyLAUKiJCj1GUAM.mp4?tag=27\"}\n{\"url\": \"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2055117865531908096/pl/xnyDsNVJ0HjE6xBP.m3u8?tag=27&v=cfc\"}\n{\"url\": \"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2055117865531908096/vid/avc1/458x360/DvQRyZueiVmuVW1s.mp4?tag=27\"}\n{\"url\": \"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2055117865531908096/vid/avc1/918x720/ZLgP0seL00LIh5OM.mp4?tag=27\"}\n{\"url\": \"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2055117865531908096/vid/avc1/344x270/3nI3TQ1sUMTKCnYE.mp4?tag=27\"}\n{\"url\": \"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2055117865531908096/vid/avc1/2348x1840/uQOSqzMKyJuHr2gZ.mp4?tag=27\"}\n{\"url\": \"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2055096528679686144/vid/avc1/918x720/g7rgJYPLEa69FJH7.mp4?tag=27\"}\n{\"url\": \"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2055096528679686144/vid/avc1/458x360/JnmAboaIYDFmBwvk.mp4?tag=27\"}\n{\"url\": \"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2055096528679686144/vid/avc1/344x270/qYpm4b_pIg8uHIWu.mp4?tag=27\"}\n{\"url\": \"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/20