してほしい\n⭕️良い例 / 　　↓ / 今の会社を辞めるべきか、 / 冷静に整理できない人に役立てる\nLINEはあくまで出口です。\nそして、入口は / 『視聴者の悩み』です。\n悩みが具体的になるほど、 / 動画の冒頭も作りやすくなります。\n / たとえば、\n「復縁できる人の特徴」 / よりも、\n「別れてから一度も / 　連絡できていない人へ」 /  / の方が、誰向けの動画なのかが / 一瞬で分かりますよね。\n転職系でも、\n「転職した方がいい人の特徴」 / より、\n「仕事を辞めたいけど、 / 　甘えかもしれないと思っている人へ」\nの方が、 / 視聴者が自分事として見やすいです。\nちなみに、ここの悩み出しには / ↓のプロンプトが便利ですよ。\n━━━━━━━━ / あなたはTikTok動画の企画担当者です。\n以下のジャンルについて、 / 視聴者が日常的に感じている悩みを / 30個出してください。\nジャンル： / 【占い・転職などを入力】\n想定視聴者： / 【ここに入力】\n条件： / ・商品名や案件名ではなく悩みから考える / ・本人が使いそうな言葉で書く / ・似た内容を重複させない / ・30秒の動画で気づきを与えやすい / ・無料診断やLINE特典へつなげやすい / ・不安を過度にあおらない\n出力形式： / ・視聴者の悩み / ・悩みが起きる場面 / ・動画の切り口 / ・冒頭フレーズ / ・LINEで渡す特典 / ━━━━━━━━\nこの30個が、最初の投稿ネタになります。\n毎日、\n「今日は何を投稿しよう…」\nと考えるのではなく、 / 先にまとめて作っておく。\nこれだけで、 / 投稿を続ける負担はかなり減ります。\nSTEP3：台本は“最初の2秒”から作る\nTikTokは、最初の数秒で続きを見るか判断されます。\nそのため、 / いきなり長い説明を始めるのではなく、\n♢誰向けなのか？\n♢何に悩んでいるのか？\n♢続きを見る理由は何か？\nを最初に伝えるのがポイント。\n占い系なら、\n〜〜〜〜〜 / 「好きな人からの返信が / 　急に遅くなった人へ」\n「今すぐ追いLINEするのは、 / 　少し待ってください」\n「連絡が減ったからといって、 / 　気持ちが冷めたとは限りません」 / 〜〜〜〜〜\nってイメージです。\n転職系なら、\n〜〜〜〜〜 / 「仕事を辞めたいけど、 / 　転職すべきか迷っている人へ」\n「会社に行きたくないのは、 / 　甘えとは限りません」\n「退職届を出す前に、 / 　この3つだけ確認してください」 / 〜〜〜〜〜\nこんな感じですね。\nそのあとに、\n━━━━━━━━ / 冒頭 / 　↓ / 共感 / 　↓ / 気づき / 　↓ / 具体例 / 　↓ / 解決方法 / 　↓ / 公式LINEへの誘導 / ━━━━━━━━\nと続けます。\nたとえば転職系なら、\n━━━━━━━━ / ●冒頭\n仕事を辞めたいけど、 / 甘えかもしれないと思っている人へ。\n━━━━━━━━ / ●共感\n給料はもらえている。 / 人間関係も最悪ではない。\nだから、辞めたいと思う自分が / 弱い気がしますよね。\n━━━━━━━━ / ●気づき\nでも、\n辞めたい理由を / 言葉にできていないだけかもしれません。\n━━━━━━━━ / ●具体例\n１、会社 / ２、仕事内容 / ３、働き方 / ４、人間関係\n⤴︎この4つに分けると、 / 何がつらいのか整理しやすくなります。\n━━━━━━━━ / ●解決\nまずは、それぞれを / 10点満点で評価してみてください。\n━━━━━━━━ / ●CTA\n転職すべき状態か整理できる / 無料チェックリストは、\nプロフィールから受け取れます。 / ━━━━━━━━\nという感じです。\nそれと、台本作成には / ↓のプロンプトがオススメです\n━━━━━━━━ / あなたはTikTokの構成作家です。\n以下の内容で、 / 30秒のTikTok台本を作ってください。\n発信ジャンル： / 【占い・転職などを入力】\n想定視聴者： / 【ここに入力】\n視聴者の悩み： / 【ここに入力】\n動画で与える気づき： / 【ここに入力】\nLINEで配布する特典： / 【ここに入力】\n条件： / ・最初の2秒で対象者か悩みを明確にする / ・構成は「冒頭→共感→気づき→具体例→解決→CTA」 / ・一文を短くする / ・テロップで読みやすい話し言葉にする / ・不安を過度にあおらない / ・結果や未来を断定しない / ・LINEは動画の続きとして案内する / ・30秒以内に収める\n最後に、 / 冒頭フレーズだけ別案を5つ出してください。 / ━━━━━━━━\n⤴︎そのままコピペで使えます👌\nSTEP4：LINE誘導は“動画の続き”にする\nTikTokからLINEへ誘導するときに、 / よくある失敗が、\n「詳しくはプロフィールへ」\nだけで終わることです。\n視聴者からすると、 /  / ・何があるのか？ / ・どんなメリットがあるのか？ /  / 分からないので、 / わざわざプロフィールへ移動する理由がないんですよめ。\nそのため / LINEへ誘導するときは、 / ↓の3つを明確にしましょう。\n＝＝＝＝＝ / ①何が受け取れるのか？\n②誰に役立つのか？\n③受け取ると何が分かるのか？ / ＝＝＝＝＝\n占い系なら、\n❌悪い例 / 　　↓ / 続きはプロフィールへ！\n⭕️良い例 / 　　↓ / 今の二人の距離感を整理できる / ”恋愛チェックシート”を無料配布しています。\n相手の行動に振り回されてしまう人は、 / プロフィールから受け取ってください！\n転職系なら、\n❌悪い例 / 　　↓ / 転職したい人はLINEへ\n⭕️良い例 / 　　↓ / 今の会社を辞めるべきか整理できる / 20項目のチェックリストを配布しています。\n勢いで退職するのが不安な人は、 / プロフィールから確認してください👌\n⤴︎ / みたいな感覚です。\nここで、大事なのが / 動画の内容と / LINE特典を一致させること。\n動画が、\n「会社を辞める前に / 　確認したい4つの不満」\nなら、特典は、\n『退職判断チェックリスト』\nのように、 / 次に知りたい内容へつなげます。\nそれと、不安を強くあおるより、\n“動画を見た人が次に確認したいもの”\nを用意する方が、 / 自然にLINEへ進んでもらえるので / 意識してみてください。\nデメリット面\nここまで読むと、\n「TikTok × LINE追加アフィリって、 / 　かなり簡単そうじゃね？」\nと思うかもしれません。笑\nただし、メリットもあれば / 当然デメリットもあります。\n１、投稿しても必ず伸びるわけではない\nTikTokは / XやInstagramのような他のSNSと違い / フォロワーが少なくても / 動画が見られる可能性が高いです。\nとはいえ / 当たり前ですが、投稿すれば必ず再生されるわけじゃありません。\n「冒頭」 / 「テーマ」 / 「動画の見せ方」 / 「投稿タイミング」\nなどによって、 / ほとんど再生されないことだってあります。\n最初から1本で当てようとせず、 / 複数投稿して反応を見る前提で / 始めましょう。\n２、LINE追加されても成果になるとは限らない\n案件によっては、\n「新規登録のみ」 / 「年齢条件あり」 / 「重複登録は対象外」 / 「登録後のアクションが必要」\nなど、成果条件が異なる場合もあります。\nそれだけじゃなく、 / LINE追加数と / 承認された成果数が一致しない場合もあります。\nだからこそ、 / 案件を選ぶときは、\n・成果地点 / ・対象条件 / ・否認条件 / ・報酬額\nをしっかり確認しておきましょう！\n３、強い煽りは信用を失いやすい\n占い系なら、\n「このサインがあれば絶対に別れます！」\n転職系なら、\n「今すぐ辞めないと人生が終わります！」\n⤴︎ / こんな表現をしたところで / 一時的に再生されても / 長期的な信頼にはつながりません。\n不安をあおるより、 / ”判断材料や気づきを渡す”。\nこの方が、 / アカウントも長く育ちます。\nつまり、 / TikTok × LINE追加アフィリエイトは、 / 完全放置で簡単に稼げる方法ではありません。\nただ、 /  / ・在庫なし / ・顔出しなし / ・DM営業なし / ・高額商品のセールスなし\nでも取り組めるため、 / 正しく設計できれば / 副業初心者でも / かなり挑戦しやすい手法の一つです。\nバズった投稿は”悩み”を変えて量産\n投稿を作る上で、毎度毎度 / 新しい動画・シナリオを考える必要って / 実は無いんですよね\nというのも / 反応が取れた投稿は、構成は残して / 悩みや状況を変えて横展開します。\nどういうことかと言うと↓\n占い系なら、\n「好きな人から返信が遅くなった人へ」\nという動画を、\n①既読無視された人向け / ②会う回数が減った人向け / ③復縁後に距離を感じる人向け / ④遠距離で不安な人向け\nに横展開できます。\n転職系なら、\n「仕事を辞めたいけど迷っている人へ」\nという動画を、\n①人間関係に悩む人向け / ②給料が上がらない人向け / ③未経験転職が不安な人向け / ④30代で転職に迷う人向け\nに広げられます。\n同じ文章をコピーするのではなく、\n『誰の、どんな悩みを扱うか？』\nを変えるイメージです。\n今日やることは３つだけ\nTikTok × LINE追加アフィリエイトを始めるからといって、\n今日いきなり / 動画を30本作る必要はありません。笑\nまずは、 / ↓の3つだけ進めればOKです。\n①発信ジャンルを決める\n例：\n恋愛占い / 復縁 / 転職判断 / 仕事の悩み\n②悩みを10個出す\n占い系なら、\n好きな人から返信が来ない / 相手の本音が分からない / 復縁したいけど連絡できない\n転職系なら、\n仕事を辞めたい / 向いている仕事が分からない / 未経験転職が不安\n③動画と特典を１本に繋げる\n転職系の例）\n●悩み\n仕事を辞めたいけど、 / 転職すべきか分からない\n●動画\n会社を辞める前に / 分けて考える4つの不満\n●LINE特典\n退職すべき状態か整理する / 20項目のチェックリスト\n / ⤴︎ / この表を作るだけで、\n「動画テーマ」 / 「台本の内容」 / 「LINE特典」 / 「アフィリエイト案件」\nが一本につながります👌\nただ、正直に言うと、 / これは全体の、ほんの入り口です。 / \n「どのジャンルが / 　本当に収益化しやすいのか？」 \n「どの案件を紹介すべきか？」\n 「バズった後、どうやって利益に繋げるのか？」\nこの核心の部分は、体系立てて学ばないと / 独学だと必ずつまずきます。\n実際に「普通の人」が結果を出しています\n👤そうは言っても、 / 実際に収益を出す人ってだけでしょ?\nそう思いますよね。 \nなので、リアルな声を見てください。\nここで見てもらいたいのは、金額だけじゃありません。\n登場するのが全員「普通の人」だということです。\n / 「会社員」 / 「フリーター / 「主育」 / 「育休中のママさん」\n特別なスキルも、\n時間も、\n実績もなかった人たち。\nしかも、 / 〜〜〜 / ・AIが苦手だった人 / ・副業アカウントをBANされた人 / 〜〜〜 / までいる。 / \nそんな人たちが / 正しいやり方を知って  / 行動しただけで、結果を出している。\nこれが「才能じゃない」という / 何よりの証拠ですし、\n👤 自分にも出来るかも！\nと自信をもつ材料にしていただけたら嬉しいです。 \nそして、その / 「正しいやり方」をあなたにも渡すために / 今回、あるものを用意しました。\n読者限定プレゼント🎁\n今回『TikTok × LINE追加アフィリエイト』の\n・ジャンル選び / ・投稿の作り方 / ・台本の型 / ・LINE誘導の導線 / ・収益化までの流れ\nをnoteにまとめました。\nまずはこのnoteから / 全体像を確認してみてください。\nそして、もう一つ↓\n■ 【5,000円 → 0円】最短ルート設計会\nあなただけのオリジナルロードマップを作る / ”最短ルート設計会。\n一人1回限定、昔5,000円で行ってたサービスです。\n「何から始めればいいか分からない」 \n⤴︎あなたのための地図を一緒に作ります。\n正直、ここまで揃っていれば  / 迷う要素はもうないはずです。\n受け取り方法\nこの、プレゼントは / 下記のLINEから、無料で受け取れます。 / \nやり方は下のリンクからLINEを追加でOK\n確認でき次第、プレゼントをお送りします。\n▼ LINEを追加してコンテンツを受け取る\nhttps://lin.ee/YbPgPSJ\n副業の情報を、あれこれ探し回るのはもう終わりにしましょう。\n必要なものは全部、この中に用意しました。\n●最後に\n一番伝えたいことを言います。\nこの記事を読んで、\n👤いつかやってみよう\nと思ったなら、 / その“いつか” / 今日に変えてください。\n情報を集めているだけでは、\n動画は1本も増えないし、 / LINE登録も1件も生まれません。\nでも、\n・ジャンルを一つ決める。 / ・悩みを10個出す。 / ・台本を1本作る。\nここまで進めれば、 / 昨日までの自分とはもう違います。\nTikTokは、\nフォロワーゼロでも始められる。 / 顔出しなしでもできる。 / スマホ1台でも動き出せる。\nなのは、\n完璧な準備ではなく、 / 最初の1本を出すことです。\n今回まとめたnoteには、\nジャンル選びから / 投稿の作り方、 / LINE誘導、 / 収益化までの流れを入れています。\nまずは手に取って、 / 今日中に一つだけ / 手を動かしてみてください\n未来を変えるのは、 / 情報をたくさん知っている人ではありません。\n知ったあとに、 / 小さくても動いた人です。\n応援しています。！\ndescription '20代前半でSNS+サイト売却で4800万→サイドFIRE｜投資歴3年｜元工場リーマン(高卒)｜お金と時間に縛られない生活がモットー'\nfollowers 1119\nlikes 2438\nmedia_count 138\nname 'とら🐯AIマネタイズ'\nscreen_name '3Imzdo3'\nstatuses 2914\nlikes 21\nARTICLE TEXT:\n副業でSNSを始めたい。\nでも、\n毎日SNSに張り付くのはしんどい\n顔出しはしたくない\nDM営業もしたくない\n投稿が一瞬で流れるのは避けたい\nそう考える人と相性がいい選択肢の一つが / 『Pinterest』です。 /  / \nPinterestは、一般的なSNSのように / 「今日の投稿を / 　フォロワーに見てもらう場所」 / というより、 /  / 検索される画像メディアに近いサービス。\n / ユーザーは、\n狭い部屋の収納方法\n在宅ワークに便利な道具\n旅行の持ち物\n時短レシピ\nファッションの組み合わせ\nなど、具体的なアイデアを探すために使う人が多いです。 / \nつまり、 / 何となく投稿を眺めている人だけではなく、 / すでに /  / 「悩みを解決したい」 / 「何かを選びたい」 /  / と考えている人に届けやすい。\n / ⤴︎ここが、 / Pinterestとアフィリエイトの相性がいい理由なんですよ。\nただし、 / 最初に大事なことを伝えます。 / \nPinterest×AIアフィリエイトは、 / 商品リンクを貼って放っておけば / 勝手に収益が発生する仕組みではありません。\n作るべきなのは、\n放置しても見られる可能性が残る / “検索資産”です。 / \nこの記事では、 / Pinterestを使った収益導線の作り方を、\n仕組み\nテーマ選び\nピン作成\nAI活用\n改善方法\nの順番で、 / 初心者向けに具体的に解説していきます。 /  /  / \nPinterest×AIアフィリエイトの仕組み\nまず、全体像はとてもシンプルです↓\n〜〜〜〜〜 / 悩みを検索する / 　↓ / Pinterestのピンを見る / 　↓ / 保存またはクリックする / 　↓ / 記事や商品ページを見る / 　↓ / 商品・サービスを検討する / 　↓ / 条件を満たせば報酬が発生する / 〜〜〜〜〜\n大切なのは、最初から / 「何を売ろうか」と考えないことです。\nまず先に考えるのは、\nユーザーが何に困って検索するか？ /  / 、 / 、 / 、 /  / たとえば、 / 収納ケースを紹介したいからといって、\n「おすすめ収納ケース」\nというピンを作っても、誰に必要なのか分かりません。\n / 一方で、\n「狭い洗面所が片付く浮かせる収納7選」\nなら、\n洗面所が狭い\n物が散らかる\n収納場所を増やしたい\nという悩みが一瞬で伝わります。 /  / \nPinterestでは、商品そのものよりも、\n悩みを解決するアイデア\nとして見せることが重要なんですよね。 /  /  / \n先に仕組みを作ること\nPinterestでいう放置運用は、 / 何もしないことではありません。\n最初に、\n検索されるテーマ\n関連するボード\n保存したくなるピン\nクリック後に迷わない導線\nを整えます。\nそのうえで / 反応のよかったピンを横展開し、 / 毎回ゼロから考えなくても / 投稿できる状態を作る。\nこれが「放置に近づける」仕組み化です。 / \nたとえば、\n「在宅ワークのデスク環境」\nというテーマで反応が取れた場合、 / 次のように広げられます↓\n狭い部屋向けデスク収納\n夜の作業で目が疲れにくいライト\nオンライン会議で顔が暗く見えない照明\n集中力を切らさないデスク配置\nコードが散らからない整理グッズ\n一つの悩みを起点に、 / 検索意図が違うピンを増やしていく。\nこれなら / 同じ投稿を大量複製せず、 / ユーザーごとに違う価値を届けられるってわけです。 /  /  / \nSTEP1：テーマを一つに絞る\n初心者が最初にやるべきことは、 / 投稿を作ることではありません。\nまずは、 / 扱うテーマを一つ決めます。\nおすすめは、 / 画像で変化や便利さを伝えやすいテーマです。\nたとえば、\n一人暮らしの収納\n在宅ワーク環境\n時短家事\n旅行準備\nデスク周りの改善\nキッチン用品\n学習環境\n子育て中の家事効率化\nなどですね。\n / 最初から、\n🙍‍♂️副業も、旅行も、美容も、収納も！！\nと広げてしまうと、何のアカウントなのか分からなくなっちゃいます。\nだからこそ、まずは一つの大テーマを決め / その中でボードを”5〜8個”ほど作るイメージです。\n / たとえば「在宅ワーク環境」なら、\n在宅ワークのデスク環境\n狭い部屋のデスク収納\n集中力を上げる仕事道具\nオンライン会議の見え方改善\n副業作業を時短するツール\nと分けたり、ですね。 /  /  / \nSTEP2：商品ではなく「悩み」を30個出す\nテーマが決まったら、次にユーザーの悩みを出します。\n「デスクライトを売りたい」\nではなく、\n夜の作業で目が疲れる\n手元が暗くて集中できない\nデスクが狭くてライトを置けない\nオンライン会議で顔が暗く見える\nというように / 生活シーンまで具体化しましょう。 / \n悩みが具体的になるほど、 / ピンのタイトルも作りやすくなります。\nただ、自分で悩みを30個出すとなると / かなり重たいので、 / ↓で紹介するプロンプトで / AIで自動化しましょう💪\n━━━━━━━━ / あなたはPinterest運用に詳しい編集者です。 /  / 以下のテーマについて、 / Pinterestで検索されそうな悩みを30個出してください。 /  / テーマ： / 【ここにテーマを入れる】 /  / 条件： / ・商品名ではなく、悩みや生活シーンから考える / ・初心者にも分かる言葉にする / ・似た内容を重複させない / ・商品紹介につなげやすい悩みを優先する /  / 出力形式： / ・悩み / ・検索に使われそうな言葉 / ・紹介できる商品カテゴリ / ━━━━━━━━\nたとえば / 「一人暮らしの収納」で指示すると\n洗面所にタオルを置く場所がない\nクローゼットが狭くて服が収まらない\nキッチンの調味料が散らかる\nデスク周りの小物が片付かない\nといったピンの種を / サクッと出してくれるのでかなり便利です。 /  / ぜひお試しください🤲 /  /  / \nSTEP3：保存したくなるピンを作る\nPinterestでは、 / クリックされることだけでなく / 保存されることも重要です。 /  /  / そして、保存されやすいピンには、\nあとで見返す理由\nがあります。 / \n特に使いやすいのは↓の5種類です。\nチェックリスト\n比較表\n手順解説\nおすすめまとめ\n買う前の注意点 / \nたとえば、\n「旅行に便利なアイテム」\nよりも、\n「2泊3日の荷物を減らす / 　持ち物チェックリスト」\nの方が、思わず保存しちゃいますせんか？ / \n「おすすめデスク用品」\nよりも、\n「在宅ワークで集中できない人が / 　最初に整える5つ」\nの方が、誰に役立つか明確ですよね？ / \nピンタイトルを作るときは、次の型を使ってください。\n【誰向け】＋【具体的な悩み】＋【得られる結果】\n例：\n一人暮らし向け / ＋ / 洗面所が狭くて物が置けない / ＋ / 浮かせる収納7選\n完成形は、\n「一人暮らしの狭い洗面所が片付く、浮かせる収納7選」\nです。\nAIでタイトル案を作る場合はこちらです。\nあなたはPinterestで保存されやすいタイトルを作る編集者です。 /  / 以下の悩みから、ピンタイトルを20個作ってください。 /  / 悩み： / 【ここに悩みを入れる】 /  / 条件： / ・誰向けか一瞬で分かる / ・悩み、場面、結果のどれかを入れる / ・「おすすめ」「便利」だけで終わらせない / ・誇大表現を使わない / ・あとで見返したくなる実用性を出す /  / 各案に、 / ・ピンタイトル / ・保存したくなる理由 / ・合う画像構成 / を付けてください。\nSTEP4：ピンから商品までの導線をつなげる\nピンを作ったら、クリック先との一致を確認します。\nたとえば、\n「狭い洗面所が片付く収納7選」\nというピンなのに、 /  / クリック先が一つの商品だけだったり / 関係のない教材だったりすると / 読者は違和感を持ちます。 / \n導線は↓の順番で考えると / 一番売れやすいです。\n〜〜〜〜〜 / 検索した悩み / ↓ / ピンで得られる情報 / ↓ / クリック先で分かること / ↓ / 紹介する商品 / 〜〜〜〜〜\n例） / ●悩み / →夜のデスク作業で目が疲れる /  / ●ピン / →目が疲れやすい人向けデスクライトの選び方5つ /  / ●クリック先 / →明るさ・色温度・置き場所の比較記事 /  / ●紹介商品 / →条件に合うデスクライト\n / いきなり商品を売るのではなく、\n「どう選べばいいか？」\nを伝えたあとに、条件に合う商品を見せます。\nこの順番なら、売り込み感が弱くなり / お客さんの心理的なハードルも下げれます。 /  /  / \nSTEP5：AIで作業を軽くする\nPinterest運用では、\nキーワード探し\nタイトル作成\n説明文作成\nボード設計\n横展開案\n改善案\nなど、AIで時短できる作業が多くあります。\nただし、AIに任せるのは / 「下書き」と「整理」です。 /  / ここは注意しましょう。 /  / そのため↓の項目は / 必ず自分で確認するように気をつけてください！\n商品情報が正しいか？\n価格や在庫が最新か？\nリンク先と説明が一致しているか？\nアフィリエイト表記があるか？\n実際に使っていない商品を体験談として書いていないか？\n同じ内容を大量複製していないか？\n / ちなみに、説明文の下書きには / ↓のプロンプトが使えます。\n━━━━━━━━ / あなたはPinterest向けの説明文を書く編集者です。 /  / 以下のピンに合う説明文を5パターン作ってください。 /  / ピンタイトル： / 【ここにタイトル】 /  / リンク先の内容： / 【ここに記事や商品ページの内容】 /  / 条件： / ・ピンとリンク先の内容を一致させる / ・読者の悩みに寄り添う / ・検索キーワードを自然に入れる / ・同じ言葉を繰り返さない / ・断定や誇大表現を避ける / ・アフィリエイトを含む場合は隠さない / ━━━━━━━━\n反応が出たピンは「検索意図」を変えて増やす\nPinterestでは、 / 最初から完璧な1枚を作る必要はありません。\n投稿して反応を見ながら、\nどの悩みが表示されたか\nどのタイトルが保存されたか\nどの画像がクリックされたか\nを確認します。 / \n反応があったピンは / そのまま複製するのではなく、 / 検索意図を変えて横展開します。\nたとえば、\n「狭いデスクでも使いやすいライト」\nが反応した場合、\n夜に作業する人向け\n子どもの学習机向け\nオンライン会議向け\n寝室でも使いやすいもの\n目が疲れやすい人向け\nと広げられますよね。\n / また、ここでいう横展開には / ↓のプロンプトで解決できます。\n━━━━━━━━ / 以下のPinterestピンが反応した前提で、 / 検索意図が異なる横展開案を15個作ってください。 /  / 反応したピン： / 【ここにタイトル】 /  / 条件： / ・同じ内容の複製にしない / ・読者の悩みや使用場面を変える / ・保存する理由を作る / ・関連する商品カテゴリも出す /  / 出力形式： / ・新しいピンタイトル / ・想定する悩み / ・元のピンとの違い / ・紹介できる商品カテゴリ / ━━━━━━━━\n初心者が避けたい5つの失敗\n / 1. 商品から投稿を考える\n❌悪い例 / この収納ケースを売りたい /  / ⭕️良い例 / 狭い洗面所で / タオル置き場に困っている人に役立てる\n⤴︎ / 先に悩みを決め、 / その解決策として商品を置くイメージです。\n2. 同じピンを大量に出す\nタイトルだけ変えて、画像も説明もリンク先も同じ。\nこれでは、ユーザーに新しい価値がありません。\n横展開するときは、 / 悩みや利用場面を変えます。\n3. 広告であることを隠す\nアフィリエイトを含む場合は、 / 分かりやすく示します。\n隠すより、透明にしたほうが / 長期的な信頼につながります。\n4. 他人の画像を無断で使う\n自分で作った画像、撮影した写真、利用条件が明確な素材を使います。\n商品画像を使う場合も、利用条件を確認してください。\n5. 収益を断定する\n「投稿するだけで必ず稼げる」 / 「誰でも月30万円」\nといった表現は、当たり前ですが避けましょう。\nちなみに、収益は /  / 『表示回数 × クリック率 × 成約率 × 1件あたりの報酬』\nで決まります。\n売上だけを見るのではなく、 / どの数字を改善するか考えることが大事です。\n最初の30日ロードマップ\n1週目：テーマを決める\n大テーマを一つ決める\n読者の悩みを30個出す\n紹介できる商品カテゴリを整理する / \n2週目：ボードと型を作る\nボードを5〜8個作る\nチェックリスト型\n比較型\nおすすめまとめ型\nこの3つの画像テンプレートを用意します。 / \n3週目：ピンを投稿する\n最初は1日1〜3枚でも構いません。\n同じ商品でも、\n悩み別\n利用場面別\n比較別\n失敗回避別\n初心者向け\nと切り口を変えれば、ネタには困らないです。 /  / \n4週目：反応を見て改善する\n最初に見る数字は、この3つで十分です。\n表示されているか\n保存されているか\nクリックされているか\n反応があるテーマは横展開し、反応が弱い場合は、\nタイトル\n画像\nボード\n検索意図\nリンク先との一致\nを見直します。\n放置運用前のチェックリスト\n投稿前には↓を確認しましょう！\n□ 扱うテーマを一つに絞った / □ 検索されそうな悩みを30個出した / □ ボードを5〜8個に整理した / □ タイトルから誰向けか分かる / □ 保存する理由がある / □ 商品より悩みを先に見せている / □ ピンとリンク先の内容が一致している / □ アフィリエイトであることを隠していない / □ 他人の画像を無断使用していない / □ 同じピンを大量複製していない / □ 誇大な収益表現を使っていない / □ 反応が出たピンを横展開する準備がある\n今日やることは、この3つだけ\nPinterestを始めるからといって、 / 今日いきなり画像を30枚作る必要はありません。\nまずは、↓の3つだけ進めてばOKです。 / \n1. テーマを一つ決める\n例：\n在宅ワーク環境\n一人暮らし収納\n時短家事\n旅行準備 / \n2. 悩みを30個出す\n商品名ではなく、 / 読者の困りごとや生活場面で考えます。\n3. 商品カテゴリをつなげる\n悩み： / 夜の作業で目が疲れる /  / 解決アイデア： / デスクの明るさと色温度を見直す /  / 商品カテゴリ： / デスクライト、モニターライト\nこの表を作るだけで、 / ・投稿テーマ / ・ピンタイトル / ・紹介商品 / が一本につながります。\nまとめ\nPinterest放置アフィリエイトで作るべきものは、 / 商品リンクの山ではありません。\n作るのは、\n検索されるキーワード\n専門性が伝わるボード\n保存したくなるピン\n迷わず進めるリンク導線\nです。\n放置で回る導線は、 / 最初から放置されているわけではありません。\n先に仕組みを作り、 / あとから少ない作業で改善できる状態にしています。\n多くの人は、売りたい商品から考えます。\nでも、Pinterestで長く見られる入口を作るなら、\n━━━━━━━━ / 悩み / ↓ / 役立つアイデア / ↓ / 解決方法 / ↓ / 商品 / ━━━━━━━━\nこの順番です。\nまずは一つのテーマを決め、 / 30個の悩みを出すところから始めてみてください。\nそこまでできれば、 / Pinterest運用の土台はすでに完成しています。\n副業で結果を出すまでの全体像も / 知っておきたい方へ🎁\n現在、公式LINEで / 『とら式SNS副業  / 　完全コンプリートパック』 / を公開しています。\n本来、有料コンテンツとして出す予定の内容のため、定員に達した場合は配布を終了します。\n気になる方は、今のうちに受け取って学んでください\n▼▼▼\n【特典を受け取る】\nhttps://lin.ee/7dHft0k\ndescription '20代前半でSNS+サイト売却で4800万→サイドFIRE｜投資歴3年｜元工場リーマン(高卒)｜お金と時間に縛られない生活がモットー'\nfollowers 1119\nlikes 2438\nmedia_count 138\nname 'とら🐯AIマネタイズ'\nscreen_name '3Imzdo3'\nstatuses 2914\nlikes 174\ndescription '20代前半でSNS+サイト売却で4800万→サイドFIRE｜投資歴3年｜元工場リーマン(高卒)｜お金と時間に縛られない生活がモットー'\nfollowers 1119\nlikes 2438\nmedia_count 138\nname 'とら🐯AIマネタイズ'\nscreen_name '3Imzdo3'\nstatuses 2914\nlikes 12\ndescription '20代前半でSNS+サイト売却で4800万→サイドFIRE｜投資歴3年｜元工場リーマン(高卒)｜お金と時間に縛られない生活がモットー'\nfollowers 1119\nlikes 2438\nmedia_count 138\nname 'とら🐯AIマネタイズ'\nscreen_name '3Imzdo3'\nstatuses 2914\nlikes 63\ndescription '20代前半でSNS+サイト売却で4800万→サイドFIRE｜投資歴3年｜元工場リーマン(高卒)｜お金と時間に縛られない生活がモットー'\nfollowers 1119\nlikes 2438\nmedia_count 138\nname 'とら🐯AIマネタイズ'\nscreen_name '3Imzdo3'\nstatuses 2914\nlikes 144\ndescription '20代前半でSNS+サイト売却で4800万→サイドFIRE｜投資歴3年｜元工場リーマン(高卒)｜お金と時間に縛られない生活がモットー'\nfollowers 1119\nlikes 2438\nmedia_count 138\nname 'とら🐯AIマネタイズ'\nscreen_name '3Imzdo3'\nstatuses 2914\nlikes 21\ndescription '20代前半でSNS+サイト売却で4800万→サイドFIRE｜投資歴3年｜元工場リーマン(高卒)｜お金と時間に縛られない生活がモットー'\nfollowers 1119\nlikes 2438\nmedia_count 138\nname 'とら🐯AIマネタイズ'\nscreen_name '3Imzdo3'\nstatuses 2914\nlikes 174\nsource_id 'x.3imzdo3-articles'\n\n### x.ernesto-software-articles.json\nTOP ['result', 'schema_version', 'source']\ncanonical_url 'https://x.com/ErnestoSOFTWARE'\nitem_ids ['x:2082527284301300023', 'x:2067994710841360596', 'x:2062582178236727320', 'x:2056740238890766383', 'x:2055380685452640538']\nARTICLE TEXT:\nOur app is currently doing $50,000/week.  / This month we will wrap up at $150K MRR.\nand thats just 1 of my businesses, I have have many others  /  / bringing in over $200k/mo in personal income.and all of these businesses are built on the back of claude.\nClaude is literally my COO.\nand yet 99% of people still use Claude like an assistant, / to help them with basic tasks. /  / at this point thats caveman behavior. /  / The reason i'm able to run so many  / 6 figure/mo business at once\nboils down to the precision in which I use Claude.  / and thats exactly what i will break down in this article\nSTEP 1: MCP MAXING\nThe first step to get above average results with Claude / Is to give claude access to useful MCPS: /  / MCP's are like super powers for Claude / For example, recently i tried re creating a very famous game /  / That has over 4 Billion downloads / I sent the same prompt to 2 agents /  / 1 claude agent had access to 2 MCPS    / ( higgsfield MCP for images + meshy AI for 3d models ) /  / The other agent had no access to mcps.\nThe results speak for themselves. /  / the agent with access to MCP delivered exceptional results  / compared to the other agent.\nSO WHICH MCPS SHOULD YOU GET?\nLets say you want to build a  SAAS that turns images into 3D models. / I'll send Claude a prompt like this:\nMy Claude code agent is connected to all of these MCPS by default: /  / →  Dribbble API to research visual direction / → Higgsfield MCP for every image gen and video gen model / → Blender MCP to make 3D assets for games / → Vercel MCP to host the website / → Resend API to send emails (login codes, receipts, everything) / → Supabase MCP to spin up the database / → GoDaddy MCP to manage DNS records\nso now instead of wasting days setting  / everything up myself  /  / Claude handles it all.   /  / but even with all these super powers /  / you would still need to be sending 1 prompt at a time.  / because AI has a cap on how many tokens it can spend per prompt. /  / thats when the loops comes in. /  / CLAUDE LOOPS + MCPS = SUPER EFFICIENCY\nInstead of prompting 1 prompt a time, / You can run this fun little command inside claude code  /  / /loop  /  / basically this makes claude automatically  / prompts itself over and over again for hours. /  / It writes the code, tests it, sees what broke, fixes it, tests again. / until it achieves the goal you set for it.\nThis is how I build all of my websites, apps and businesses: /  / →Claude Code  / →Opus 5 / →Ultra think mode  / →/loop command / → + a text file called TASKS.md  / which sets the goal that claude has to achieve\nrules for a clean loop\n→ Write TASKS.md like you are briefing a junior developer.\nVague goals = vague output.\n→ Give each task one clear outcome.\n“Deploy the app to Vercel” / not “Make the app better.”\nYou have to be extremely specific.\n→ Put spending limits on every API key.\nClaude will burn through your credits / if you let it.\n→ Run the loop inside a sandboxed folder.\nNever point /loop at your main repository.\n→ Add a kill switch using a MAX_RUNTIME variable.\nI usually cap mine at 12 hours.\nIf it still has not shipped by then, / something is probably wrong.\nNow here is where loops and MCPs / get even crazier.\nYou do not have to run just one loop at a time.\nYou can run multiple loops in parallel.\nLoop 1 builds the app.\nLoop 2 generates 50 pieces of UGC / to promote the app.\nFor example:\nI recently built a brand-new app / using a Claude loop.\nAnd this is how it turned out:\nthen in parallel I ran another loop that made a bunch of different ads with Higgsfield MCP and it made me a bunch of professional UGC ads that i can now use to promote the app.\nAnd all of this took 10 minutes of my attention, set the loops off  / And forgot about it, welcome to the future.\nBUILDING SYSTEMS WITH CLAUDE:\nWe covered MCP maxxing / and loop maxxing with Claude.\nBut another way I abuse Claude / is by using it to build systems.\nMost parts of a business can be automated.\nThe more you automate, / the more you can handle / without needing a massive team.\nFor example, I had Claude build a complete content system for my UGC team.\nIt includes:\n→ Daily videos for creators to record / → Scripts for every video / → Step-by-step recording instructions / → Tools that help them create better content / → A full content calendar that keeps everything organized\nBecause of this system,\nwe are able to run a team of 20+ UGC creators / without needing managers or extra hands.\nIt is almost completely automated.\nAnd that is just one of the hundreds of systems / I have integrated across all of my companies.\nSo ask yourself:\nWhat part of my business am I still doing manually / that Claude could turn into a system?\nThen run a /loop / and have Claude build the automation for you.\nTHE $1M OPPORTUNITY\nMost people are still using Claude /  / to write emails, summarize documents, / and complete basic tasks.\nBut that is barely scratching the surface.\nThe real opportunity is using Claude / to build products, create content, automate operations, / and run entire parts of your business.\nMCPs give Claude access to better tools.\nLoops give Claude the ability / to keep working until the job is finished.\nSystems turn that work / into something your business can use every day.\nWhen you combine all three, / Claude stops being an assistant.\nIt becomes an operator.\nThat is how I am able to run multiple businesses / without needing a massive team / or spending every hour managing people.\nAnd we are still extremely early.\nSo stop asking Claude / to help you complete random tasks.\nGive it a real goal.\nConnect it to the right tools.\nPut it inside a loop.\nAnd have it build a system / that continues creating value long after you close your laptop.\nThe people who understand this now / are going to have an unfair advantage\nover everyone who still thinks AI is just a chatbot.\ndescription 'I own a few apps. currently at $200k MRR, sharing daily B2C scaling strategies. founder of @tryviewtrack'\nfollowers 58728\nlikes 13792\nmedia_count 1917\nname 'Ernesto Lopez'\nscreen_name 'ErnestoSOFTWARE'\nstatuses 7090\nlikes 562\nARTICLE TEXT:\nThere is an app called 75HER pulling $200,000 a month right now, Go look at their TikTok videos, Every video looks like a real women sharing their before and after transformation.... yet none of those women are real.\nEvery creator in their UGC program is an AI character.  / This is only the beginning of the future /  / a new form of marketing is here,  / and this app is only proof of how powerful it already is.\nIm this article I am going to break down exactly how 75HER does this,  / and how you copy the whole system for your app  /  / using Arcads MCP Step by step.\nHow the 75HER app makes $200k/mo\n75HER is a women's fitness app built around the 75 Hard challenge. / but targeting only women, which is a great choice  /  / Considering women are some of the most impulsive buyers.  / which is part of the reason they are printing $200k/mo\nTheir whole content strategy is drastic before and afters of the women /  / before being fat  / after being ripped   /  / which is VERY easy to do with AI  / not only is this content strategy genius, but its also very profitable.\nReal human UGC runs $15-25 per video  / AI UGC videos: $0.20 cents per video\nso not only are they at $200k/mo their margins are probably insane.  / Since they don't have to spend that much money on marketing.\nbut enough yapping, let's break down their entire system right now:\nso now that you've seen the system actually works, let me break down exactly how to build it yourself.\nStep 1: Set up the MCP\nWith RCATS, it generates videos.\nHere's how you set up the MCP so Claude can run it for you.\nthe MCP is just what lets Claude actually use RCATS for you. instead of you sitting there clicking through a dashboard, Claude talks to it directly and does the work.\nyou set it up once and you don't really have to touch it again.\nStep 2: Talk to Claude\nonce the MCP is connected, you don't prompt a video tool anymore.\nyou just talk to Claude like you would a creative director.\nyou tell him what you want, he runs Arcads, and the videos comes back. / but before he can make anything, you need to give him a character to work with.\nStep 3: Create your character\nthis is the part most people skip,  / and its exactly why their videos end up looking fake.\nbefore you make any video you first need a reference  / for who your character actually is.\nso you describe them to Claude, and you have to be insanely specific:\n→ Age, ethnicity, hair color, skin tone / → Lighting ( natural, gym lighting, golden hour ) / → Environment ( gym, kitchen, outdoor, bedroom ) / → Accessories ( water bottle, resistance band, airpods ) / → Vibe ( serious athlete, wellness girlie, biohacker, morning routine guy ) /  / the best way is to start from a real human  / and send that to arcads then change it up with nano banana inside of arcads.\nthe before is the problem and the after is the result.  /  / that contrast is basically the whole hook, people stop  / scrolling for the transformation\ngenerate a few and keep the 2-3 that look the most real. / example of before and after below\nnow you have a character thats real enough to build a whole account around.\nStep 4: Make them move\na static image is only where you start.\nnow you need actual moving footage, and this is where most people overcomplicate it. /  /  they spend hours trying to prompt realistic motion, sending the longest prompts trying to get the girl to pose and it just looks un-natural /  / there's a much easier way. / Download a video from pinterest of someone posing  /  / send that video to Gemini and tell it to analyze every body movement / Ask it to give you a prompt to replicate those exact movements /  / then send the prompt to Claude + the start image  / and the arcads mcp will take care of the rest.\nSuper simple.\nStep 5: Edit and add your CTA\nOnce you have both the before and after videos  / you can have claude literally stitch them together /  / What I personally did is I vibe coded myself a web editor  / That Claude can use and that way i can see how it works /  / That way I see what he is working on  / Then make sure to add a call to action to your videos in the caption /  / or in the comments  / similar to how the 75 her app does it\nStep 6: Automate the whole pipeline with Claude\nat this point you have a system thats repeatable,  / so now let's make the whole thing run without you.\nsince the MCP is connected, / Claude doesn't just make one video, he runs the entire pipeline. /  / he can now  / → Make the before and after videos / → Put them together / → And edit elements on top /  / So all you have to do is post those videos and wait to go viral,  / Most of the virality will actually come from your characters /  / And the before and after format you chose to replicate / because there are multiple, just follow whats trending. /  / and to actually distribute the content you can do 1 of 2 things\n1 You can do it manually by creating a few accounts on your phone. You can do up to five per phone and then buy a few phones and constantly be posting yourself.\n2 you can do what we do,  /  / which is pay somebody $50 a week per account to post. /  / Basically, for $200 a month, we have them post 60 videos across Instagram, TikTok, and YouTube.  /  / It saves us a lot of time because, at scale, this can get pretty tedious, but that is what we do.  /  / We don't use any posting service except for YouTube because that can get you shadow banned pretty quickly\nStep 7: Print views and scale your app\nonce your AI influencers start performing, if your CTA is good, you'll start seeing spikes in downloads and sales for your app.\nat that point you take the influencer videos that already worked in organic, and you put them behind paid ads.\nand thats how $200k/mo apps are born.\nexcept now you have full control over the content,  / and you don't need to micro manage any influencers.\nyou are the influencer now, the orchestrator.\nif you found this guide useful feel free to doomscroll my account, I share sauce on how to make money with apps every day.\ndescription 'I own a few apps. currently at $200k MRR, sharing daily B2C scaling strategies. founder of @tryviewtrack'\nfollowers 58728\nlikes 13792\nmedia_count 1917\nname 'Ernesto Lopez'\nscreen_name 'ErnestoSOFTWARE'\nstatuses 7090\nlikes 321\nARTICLE TEXT:\nwe automated an entire AI UGC studio with Claude + Higgsfield AI for context I make $1M+/yr across my apps and businesses. and very recently we scaled one of our apps to $720,000/yr and #22 on the appstore. /  / We did this with a combination of Meta ads, tiktok ads and UGC.  /  / the most effective being UGC, however.. UGC can get quite expensive at scale, think about it  /  / $15 per video  x 2 videos per day / $30 per creator/day * 7 days in the week\nits $210/week or $900/mo  / without counting the virality bonuses. /  / if our team is 30 creators we are looking to spend / $27,000/mo just base on creators.\nand with our campaign generating over many millions of views/mo we  / of course have creators hitting bonuses quite often.\nthis is not unprofitable for us at all.  / we see great margins from our UGC efforts.\nthe only problem is.. that to expand your team from 10  to 20 creators for example it gets complicated. /  / instead of just hiring 10 more people\nyou end up having to hire 30 more, then end up firing about 70% of them / until you are left with the top 10 from that batch that you can keep long term\nthis is just how UGC works, usually most of the results from your UGC campaign will come from the top 20% of creators. /  / the other 20 are basically a waste of money.  / So we built a system to fix this.\nI combined Claude + higgsfield mcp which is now thats generating us 100s of new realisitc UGC videos daily. /  / this allows us to test new formats for pennies on the dollar. / The whole thing runs without us touching it.\nThis is not theory, AI really is there now. /  / we have seen some  AI videos get as high as  / 10k-50k+ views and have many comments asking whats the app. /  / Which proves that this converts. /  / ( DISCLAIMER: always disclose that your videos are AI generated with a tag or somewhere on your post ) 99% won't notice the tag, but it's important to disclose to avoid any legal issues. /  / we have also spoken to multiple founders running this AI ugc playbook / with apps making over $100k/mo purely from AI content. /  / and the cost per video is basically < $0 for us, because we are sponsored by higgsfield haha, but for you it would be around a $29 or $39 subscription  /  / in this article ill break down our exact system to make Realistic AI UGC at scale.\n#1 connect higgsfield MCP ( super easy )\nThis part is super simlple just go to higgsfield.ai/cli / send the command on your terminal or just send it to claude /  / and just like that you gave Claude a weapon of mass generation. / Claude can now generate world-class images and videos at scale.\n#2 Research viral scripts\nYou cannot prompt your way to virality.  / You need data aka Viral formats in your niche that are proven to work. /  / Then and only then you can use claude + higgs to recreate them. /  / you can find plenty of viral formats by doom scrolling on your niche  /  / or inside of viewtrack.app we have a collection of over 4000+  / viral formats you can take inspiration from.\n#3 GENERATE THE CHARACTER ( Nano Banana Pro )\nYou can use the MCP for this but i prefer to do this in higgsfield UI first  / Then delegating video creation to the MCP  /  / To make your character its super simple / get clear on how you want your character to look /  / make sure to go for what works best in your niche / these things matter a lot to go viral\n-> Age, ethnicity, hair, skin / -> Lighting (gym, golden hour, natural) / -> Environment (kitchen, gym, bedroom) / -> Accessories (resistance band, AirPods, water bottle) / -> Vibe (biohacker, wellness girlie, morning routine guy)\nonce you are clear on those variables / go to pinterest and literally look for someone who matches those characteristics\nin this case let's say I want to use a guy that is in his car talking to the camera / I will use a pinterest image as a reference point\nthen get that picture and send it to higgsfield /  and make some edits to the character by prompting it. /  / to end up with a completely different look but in a realistic enviroment. /  / but having a starting image of a real person will ensure your final result also looks real which is the goal here.  /  / please be ethical and don't steal anyones identity. ( it's ilegal ) / once you have that character down you are ready to mass produce videos\n#4 THE CONTENT FACTORY\nWe are in the ERA of 24 hour software. With a claude max plan of $200/mo you are virtually unstoppable in what you can create. /  / Which is why I recommend to create your own website with your own workflow / and have claude + higgs MCP drop videos in there.  /  / think about it like this /  / > Claude is your executioner  / > Higgsfield is your artist  / > your workflow is what ties everything together. /  / In our case we made a custom website that stiches everthing togehter / higgs can also do this using their new feature Super computer. /  / but for our use case its a little different.\nhiggsfield generates four 15 second seedance videos which is the max length a seedance video can be. /  / then we have claude drop that video into our custom website and  /  / then the website stitches them together and automatically / edits them.\nIn summarythe complexity of automating this can vary depending on what format you are trying to replicate. /  / But ultimately everything can be done with enough prompting. /  / Then you can use @postbridge to schedule out the content to Tiktok, Youtube and Instagram right from the custom platform. /  / and thats literally it, now you have a content factory that can generate unlimited videos for unlimited characters /  / And post them across dozens of accounts.\nIN SUMARRY\n> connect your higgsfield MCP / > find a viral format to replicate / > create your character using nano banana in higgs / > have the MCP generate the video using your start image / > create your own custom website to scheduele out content and auto edit it / > generate 100s of new creatives per day and post them out\ntry this for your app and thank me later.\ndescription 'I own a few apps. currently at $200k MRR, sharing daily B2C scaling strategies. founder of @tryviewtrack'\nfollowers 58728\nlikes 13792\nmedia_count 1917\nname 'Ernesto Lopez'\nscreen_name 'ErnestoSOFTWARE'\nstatuses 7090\nlikes 482\nARTICLE TEXT:\nWe have scaled our business to over $1M/yr with  projects across every space, B2C apps, SaaS and services.\nAnd so far SaaS has been the hardest to crack by a mile.\nWith B2C apps the formula is pretty simple. / → You get attention, / → build a good onboarding, / → add a strong paywall / → and scale with creators or paid ads.\nServices are also pretty straight forward. / → You find a painful problem, / → find the people with the proble / → sell the outcome,  / →and fulfill the service.\nBut SaaS is different, because mostly you are selling to other founders / specially if your SAAS is X based\nbut we found a clear blueprint on how anyone can take their SaaS / from $0 to $10k MRR from doing it ourselves\n1. Build software from your own pain\nviewtrack.app came from a problem inside our own business / Most people start SaaS by asking the wrong question.\nThey ask “what SaaS should I build?”  /  / when the better question is what problem am I already dealing with every day that could be turned into software.\nThat is exactly how Viewtrack started.\nWe were scaling multiple apps with creators.  /  / UGC creators, influencers, faceless pages, organic content. / At first, it was manageable because we only had a few creators.\nBut once you start working with 10, 20, 30+ creators, /  the whole thing starts breaking. /  / so we said why don't we simply creator tracking from this: \nto this: \nAnd when you are running creator campaigns for apps,  / this is not a small problem.\nThis is directly tied to revenue. /  If they use the wrong CTA, you lose downloads. /  / If you don’t know which videos are working, you can’t scale. / So Viewtrack was not some random idea we pulled out of nowhere.\nIt was software we needed for ourselves. /  / The best SaaS ideas usually come from a problem  / you already understand deeply. /  / when you understand the pain,  /  / you know exactly what needs to be built.\n2. Validate the pain before building too much\nOnce you find a problem,  / don’t disappear for 6 months building a giant product nobody will use.\nThat is how founders waste their life.\nThe goal is to find out if other people have the same problem / before you overbuild.\nFor Viewtrack, the validation was pretty obvious because we were already talking to founders, agencies and creators every day.\nEveryone running UGC had some version of the same mess. / That is usually a good sign. /  / but for your SAAS you can validate on reddit or looking for the top people in your space and dming people in their comments.\nYour job is to build a version that saves time and ultimately helps them make more money..\n3. Build the smallest useful version\nYour first version should not be huge.  / It should be useful. /  / most founders overbuild  / Which is literally why most of them make $0\nFor Viewtrack, the first version only needed to answer a few questions.\nWho are the creators?  / What are they supposed to post? / When are they supposed to post?  / Did they post?  / How many views did they get?  / Which creators are actually worth keeping?\nThat’s the all we needed to solve for mvp 1. /  / Version 1 should be simple enough that you can send it out to a few people / and use it for it's core purpose. /  / for example this is viewtrack MVP1 vs how it looks now\n / 4. HOW TO ACTUALLY GET SALES THROUGH X MARKETING\nThe most important part here is to not be a bot. / Most founders post on X like clankers. /  /  They say stuff like “just launched my new SaaS”  / or “excited to announce” literally nobody cares g.\nYou need a format that actually gets attention.\nI’ve been doing X for about a year now, and the main reason it worked is because I shared my own experiences and real valuable information in my niche.\nSo now when I launched something like Viewtrack,  / people already know I’m not just saying random stuff.\nThey have seen me scale apps with creators before.\nThat’s why I think it’s ideal to build a SaaS around something you have already done yourself, which will help your X strategy\nFor Viewtrack, I started making posts that i knew would go super viral. / X loves free sauce.  /  / So instead of saying \" go try viewtrack \" /  / I gave away valuable information while displaying Viewtrack in action  / And that got me 500k views with just 1 post /  / then to convert i simply added a small CTA in the visual + in the text copy.\nPeople click because the information is good, / and then they realize theres a product they can use behind it. /  / That is how you should market on X. / don't talk about your SAAS show your SAAS in action. /  / it may take some time, but consistency is key. / big accounts like mine with 50k+ followers  /  / also  started with 0 followers at some point \n5. Prevent churn \nOnce you have a banger product and actually start getting sales, the most important part is preventing churn.\nThis is where SaaS gets annoying.\nBecause most users don’t churn because your product is trash.\nA lot of the time they churn because they literally don’t understand how to use it.\nEspecially with a product like Viewtrack.\nThe product has a ton of different capabilities, so if someone signs up and gets overwhelmed, the easiest thing for them to do is just leave.\nThat is what we are trying to prevent.\nThis is where Poly is insane.\nWe use Poly to have a voice agent inside the product that users can talk to whenever they get confused.\nThe agent talks super clearly, just like a human, and it is trained on the whole platform.\nSo when a user clicks the little button, the agent can see their dashboard, understand what they are trying to do, and guide them through the exact question they have.\nIt’s literally like being on a call with a specialist. /  / \nExcept you don’t need to hire a whole support team.\nAnd hiring a support team for every confused user gets expensive fast.\nWith Poly, you can basically give every user instant help without adding a ton of overhead.\nand thats an easy way to reduce churn by 30% to 50%\nThe $0 to $10k MRR blueprint\nthose are the 5 steps i would follow to build a world class $10k/mrr SAAS from scratch all over again.  /  / if you found this article useful!  feel free to follow me for more value.\ndescription 'I own a few apps. currently at $200k MRR, sharing daily B2C scaling strategies. founder of @tryviewtrack'\nfollowers 58728\nlikes 13792\nmedia_count 1917\nname 'Ernesto Lopez'\nscreen_name 'ErnestoSOFTWARE'\nstatuses 7090\nlikes 194\nARTICLE TEXT:\nLast 2 weeks we generated 17M views with an army of 30 UGC creators / which is great, yet this posed a problem we had not thought about before. /  / running a team at this scale  is costing us over $6,000/week base,  but its working... our revenue nearly tripled in the last 2 weeks and our app is ranking #30 in the appstore. /  / last week it was more like $10,000 in spend between ads and our UGC team / which is normal when you mass hire.  /  / because 90% of our UGC campaigns success comes from the top 5-6 creators the rest are mostly noise.\nThese cost will obviously decrease as we fire the creators that are not performing and keep the killers. /  / but i encourage you to watch $10,000 leaving your bank account every week  / it really makes you ask yourself some questions.  /  / and for us that question was, how do we take our margins from 30% to 70% / and become extremely profitable? \nand the answer to that question is the reason i'm writing this article. \nWe paid a guy $3.5k last week in bonuses  /  / and he told us that he was surprised we wanted to continue  / working with him. /  / He explained that most brands he works with fire him after he goes viral. /  / In my opinion thats either because their product sucks or because they have no money to sustain the cost.  /  / Thankfully we have a great app all around that helps us stay profitable nonetheless. /  / so while the average NGMI founder is stopping their UGC campaing / we are thinking how do we go beyond 30 creators  /  / How do we get 60 creators without having to double our weekly spend which would be $12,000/week  /  / and thats when we turned our eyes toward AI UGC /  / viral content is no more than  / Hook, script, face, delivery, post.   /  / its a system, a system that can skillfully be replicated with AI.  / and distributed at mass scale to create the same effect of Real UGC /  / at 1/10th of the cost, this is why I deeply believe AI ugc is the future. /  / we have already started to test AI ugc and it works  / with some of our videos getting up to 18k views. /  / and while thats not a lot, we literally just started, and nobody knows it's AI\nAI ugc is not a theory, its all around us already.   / I've talked to the team from a looks maxing app   /  / they're doing over $30k/mo  running only AI UGC content. /  / I also talked to another 18yo kid who scaled his quit gooning app to $10k/mo with 1 single AI UGC creator. /  / there are plenty of examples so let me just list them a few out here:\n / These accounts alone together have generated over 300+ million views, but how do you actually build an AI UGC creator\nWhat I learned from talking to a founder making $100k/mo with AI UGC\nI wanted to see how the top killers in the AI UGC space were scaling\nSo I got on a call with a founder making $100k/mo with his app that he is scaling with AI UGC, he has been on starter story with verified metrics. /  / he gave me a super simple system /  / 1.  you find a format that already works.  /  / find videos that already went viral in your niche. /  / For us, this is easy because our real UGC creators already  / showed us what works. /  / but you can find this by just scrolling on your niche.\nso he basically takes the winning viral format, him and his team finds / and rebuild them with AI.\nThen they break the video down. / Every viral UGC video is basically:\nHook → Script →Face → Delivery .\nOnce you see it that way, it stops being a video  / and becomes a recipe  that can be automated.\n2. you build your AI UGC creator.\nyou can run the whole thing through Higgsfield Supercomputer.  so you give higgsfield supercomputer the winning format,  the creator and the prompt.\nand It handles the rest. / Script, Video Editing, Final asset. /  / And the best part is once you get the AI video back if it looks good. / you can just tell higgs super computer  to create your 100s of variations  /  / And then again spread that across 5-10 influencers / And now you literally have an army. /  / I've already created 4 influencers for our app\n3. Scale with clippers  /  / Once you have your AI ugc creators \nyou can basically hire US based clippers for $100 a month,literally, to just hit post on the videos that you give them,  /  /  ideally someone you know like you 14yo cousin with a scrolling addiction.  /  / since Higgsfield already edits the videos for you and makes them for you.  / you just give the clippers a google drive folder with the content to post /  / If you don't wanna fully automate it, it's fine to start just posting yourself.  /  / You can do up to 4 or 8  account in your own phone , and if you run out of space just buy a new iphone 8 for $250 and run up 8 more. /  / Shadow bans don't exist.  / and so now instead of paying $900/mo per creator  /  / you can pay  $30-$100/mo per realistic AI UGC creator that you make. /  / and thats literally all you have to do.  /  / I will keep using  this tech and keep you guys posted on how this continues to work for us. /  / be sure to follow for more daily sauce like this! / \ndescription 'I own a few apps. currently at $200k MRR, sharing daily B2C scaling strategies. founder of @tryviewtrack'\nfollowers 58728\nlikes 13792\nmedia_count 1917\nname 'Ernesto Lopez'\nscreen_name 'ErnestoSOFTWARE'\nstatuses 7090\nlikes 299\ndescription 'I own a few apps. currently at $200k MRR, sharing daily B2C scaling strategies. founder of @tryviewtrack'\nfollowers 58728\nlikes 13792\nmedia_count 1917\nname 'Ernesto Lopez'\nscreen_name 'ErnestoSOFTWARE'\nstatuses 7090\nlikes 562\ndescription 'I own a few apps. currently at $200k MRR, sharing daily B2C scaling strategies. founder of @tryviewtrack'\nfollowers 58728\nlikes 13792\nmedia_count 1917\nname 'Ernesto Lopez'\nscreen_name 'ErnestoSOFTWARE'\nstatuses 7090\nlikes 321\ndescription 'I own a few apps. currently at $200k MRR, sharing daily B2C scaling strategies. founder of @tryviewtrack'\nfollowers 58728\nlikes 13792\nmedia_count 1917\nname 'Ernesto Lopez'\nscreen_name 'ErnestoSOFTWARE'\nstatuses 7090\nlikes 482\ndescription 'I own a few apps. currently at $200k MRR, sharing daily B2C scaling strategies. founder of @tryviewtrack'\nfollowers 58728\nlikes 13792\nmedia_count 1917\nname 'Ernesto Lopez'\nscreen_name 'ErnestoSOFTWARE'\nstatuses 7090\nlikes 194\ndescription 'I own a few apps. currently at $200k MRR, sharing daily B2C scaling strategies. founder of @tryviewtrack'\nfollowers 58728\nlikes 13792\nmedia_count 1917\nname 'Ernesto Lopez'\nscreen_name 'ErnestoSOFTWARE'\nstatuses 7090\nlikes 299\ndescription 'I own a few apps. currently at $200k MRR, sharing daily B2C scaling strategies. founder of @tryviewtrack'\nfollowers 58728\nlikes 13792\nmedia_count 1917\nname 'Ernesto Lopez'\nscreen_name 'ErnestoSOFTWARE'\nstatuses 7090\nlikes 870\ndescription 'I own a few apps. currently at $200k MRR, sharing daily B2C scaling strategies. founder of @tryviewtrack'\nfollowers 58728\nlikes 13792\nmedia_count 1917\nname 'Ernesto Lopez'\nscreen_name 'ErnestoSOFTWARE'\nstatuses 7090\nlikes 750\ndescription 'I own a few apps. currently at $200k MRR, sharing daily B2C scaling strategies. founder of @tryviewtrack'\nfollowers 58728\nlikes 13792\nmedia_count 1917\nname 'Ernesto Lopez'\nscreen_name 'ErnestoSOFTWARE'\nstatuses 7090\nlikes 683\ndescription 'I own a few apps. currently at $200k MRR, sharing daily B2C scaling strategies. founder of @tryviewtrack'\nfollowers 58728\nlikes 13792\nmedia_count 1917\nname 'Ernesto Lopez'\nscreen_name 'ErnestoSOFTWARE'\nstatuses 7090\nlikes 1701\ndescription 'I own a few apps. currently at $200k MRR, sharing daily B2C scaling strategies. founder of @tryviewtrack'\nfollowers 58728\nlikes 13792\nmedia_count 1917\nname 'Ernesto Lopez'\nscreen_name 'ErnestoSOFTWARE'\nstatuses 7090\nlikes 784\ndescription 'I own a few apps. currently at $200k MRR, sharing daily B2C scaling strategies. founder of @tryviewtrack'\nfollowers 58728\nlikes 13792\nmedia_count 1917\nname 'Ernesto Lopez'\nscreen_name 'ErnestoSOFTWARE'\nstatuses 7090\nlikes 1658\ndescription 'I own a few apps. currently at $200k MRR, sharing daily B2C scaling strategies. founder of @tryviewtrack'\nfollowers 58728\nlikes 13792\nmedia_count 1917\nname 'Ernesto Lopez'\nscreen_name 'ErnestoSOFTWARE'\nstatuses 7090\nlikes 21\nsource_id 'x.ernesto-software-articles'\n\n### x.woody-research-articles.json\nTOP ['result', 'schema_version', 'source']\ncanonical_url 'https://x.com/woody_research'\nitem_ids ['x:2071981134896849206', 'x:2061700552422195234', 'x:2021358286705192975']\nARTICLE TEXT:\nShopify + Claude is not about product descriptions.\nThat is the part everyone sees first, so that is the part everyone copies.\nOne store went from $16K in month 2 to $41K in month 3 and $91,340 in month 4. Net profit after product costs, fees and ads was $53,180.\nThe product did not suddenly become magical. The homepage did not win because it looked expensive. The store worked because Claude stopped being used as a writing tool and became the operating layer behind the business.\nThe mistake\nMost people open Claude from scratch every time. One chat for product copy. One chat for ad hooks. One chat for customer emails. One chat for analytics.\nNothing connects, so nothing compounds.\nThat is the mistake.\nA Shopify store is not a pile of outputs. It is the same decisions repeated every week: what to test, what to kill, what to fix, what to scale and what to stop trusting.\nRandom chats give you random answers. Saved loops give the store memory.\nThe new model runs on saved decisions\nThe store was not built around one magic prompt. It was built around six repeatable loops.\nmarket_gap.prompt found the angle competitors were missing.\nsupplier_kill.prompt caught logistics problems before customers did.\npage_truth.prompt turned the product page into objection handling instead of catalog copy.\ncreative_testing.prompt created ad angles before money was wasted on traffic.\nretention_engine.prompt made the second order cheaper than the first.\nsunday_operator.prompt read the store data every week and told the owner what to fix next.\nThat is the difference between using Claude as a writer and using Claude as the operator. A writer gives you copy. An operator keeps asking the same hard questions until the store stops leaking money.\nFind pain before products\nMost beginners start with the product.\nThat is already too late.\nThey find something trending, look at the top seller, copy the same page, use the same angle and launch a weaker version of a store that already exists.\nClaude should not be used to copy the winner. It should be used to find the part of the market the winner is ignoring.\nThe input is simple: three competitor product pages, twenty bad reviews and the product you want to sell.\nThe output is not a description. The output is the gap.\nThe point is not to make Claude sound smart. The point is to make it kill weak ideas before Shopify takes your first dollar.\nMost people only use AI after they already decided to build. This loop uses AI before the decision. That is why it saves money.\nKill bad suppliers before launch\nOnce the gap is clear, the next question is simple:\ndoes this product actually deserve a store?\nThat is where most beginners get the order wrong.\nThey build the page, launch the ads, wait for sales, then discover the supplier is slow, the product page does not answer the real objection, the ad angle is weak, support is messy, and nobody knows what to fix next week.\nClaude should catch those problems before they become expensive.\nThe first decision finds the market gap.\nThe next five decisions decide whether the store deserves more money.\nMost Shopify stores do not die because the product is impossible to sell. They die because the supplier destroys trust after the sale.\nLate delivery. Fake tracking. Bad packaging. Product quality that looked fine in the listing and terrible in the customer’s hand. By the time the owner sees the pattern, refunds are already open and Stripe is already nervous.\nThe supplier loop is simple: make Claude audit the supplier before the first order.\nThat prompt does not make the business more exciting. It makes the business harder to destroy.\nTurn product pages into sales calls\nAfter the supplier survives, the next leak is the product page.\nMost pages sound like AliExpress rewritten in better English. “Premium quality.” “Perfect for everyone.” “Designed for comfort.” None of that answers the buyer’s real question.\nThe buyer wants to know: will this work for me, what could go wrong, why should I trust this store, and what am I not being told?\nThat is why page_truth.prompt does not write a normal product description. It turns the page into objection handling.\nThe best section is usually not what the product does. It is what the product does not do.\nThat line makes the page feel honest, and honest pages convert better than pages trying too hard.\nTest creatives before buying attention\nOnce the page has an angle, the ad should not be one perfect script. That is another beginner mistake.\nA good store does not test “an ad.” It tests angles.\nOne angle shows the pain. One shows the failed alternative. One shows the product in use. One answers the objection. One shows the result.\nClaude’s job is to create those angles before ad spend starts.\nThis changes how ads are tested. The question stops being “is this product good?” The question becomes “which angle makes the buyer recognize their own problem fastest?”\nThat is a much better test.\nMake support part of retention\nThe first sale is expensive because traffic costs money. The second sale is where the store starts breathing.\nMost beginners ignore this. They spend all their energy getting the first order, then send the same default Shopify emails everyone else sends. That leaves money on the table.\nretention_engine.prompt turns the customer journey into a simple sequence: confirm the order, set expectations, teach one useful thing, check in after delivery, ask for a review and introduce the next product only when it makes sense.\nThis is not the exciting part of Shopify. That is why it works.\nMost competitors are still chasing the next click while the better store is quietly increasing the value of the buyers it already paid for.\nAudit the store every Sunday\nThe final loop is the one that makes the system compound.\nEvery Sunday, the owner exports Shopify analytics and gives Claude the numbers. Not for motivation. For diagnosis.\nSessions. Conversion rate. Average order value. Cart abandonment. Returning visitors. Top products. Return rate. Ad spend. Revenue from paid traffic. ROAS.\nThen Claude answers the same questions every week: where is the leak, what should scale, what should stop, is paid traffic finding buyers or just curious people, and what breaks first if nothing changes?\nThis is the loop most people skip because it feels boring. But this is where the compounding happens.\nThe store does not improve because the owner has a new idea every morning. It improves because the same five or six decisions get reviewed every week with better context.\nThat is the real Shopify + Claude system. Not a chatbot. Not a product description generator. A store operator made out of saved loops.\nThe math only works when the system repeats\nBy month 2, the store was doing $16K in revenue. By month 3, it reached $41K. By month 4, the dashboard showed $91,340, with $53,180 left after product costs, Shopify fees and ad spend.\nThat kind of jump makes people ask the wrong question.\nThey ask, “What product was it?”\nThe better question is, “What system kept improving the store every week?”\nBecause the product did not go from average to magical between month 2 and month 4. The operating layer got sharper. The supplier risk got lower. The page answered better objections. The ads tested clearer angles. The emails recovered more value from buyers who already paid. The Sunday audit stopped the owner from guessing what to fix next.\nNone of those changes looks dramatic alone. Together, they change the economics of the store.\nA 1% better product page, a better opening shot, fewer refund issues, cleaner support replies and one useful weekly fix do not look like a $91K/month system when you see them separately.\nBut inside a Shopify store, small leaks are where the profit disappears.\nThe loops did not create the revenue by magic. They stopped the store from bleeding it out.\nWhat Claude still cannot fix\nThe wrong lesson is that Claude makes Shopify easy.\nIt does not.\nYou still need a product people want, a supplier that can deliver, traffic that is not junk and margins that survive refunds, fees and ad spend.\nClaude can help you see those things faster. It cannot make them true.\nThat is the difference between using AI as a shortcut and using it as an operating system.\nA shortcut says: “write my page so this sells.”\nAn operating system says: “tell me if this should exist, where it will break, what buyers will doubt, what angle to test and what the numbers say after one week.”\nThe first one gives you a cleaner guess. The second one gives you a store that learns.\nThe next Shopify team will look like a folder of prompts\nThe old Shopify playbook was find a product, build a page, run ads and hope the numbers worked.\nThe new playbook is turning the store into repeatable decisions: what to test, what to kill, what to fix, what to scale and what to stop trusting.\nClaude is useful when those decisions stop living in the owner’s head and start living in the system.\nShopify gives you the shelf. Claude gives you the operator. The store wins when the loop keeps improving.\ndescription '𝐫𝐞𝐬𝐞𝐚𝐫𝐜𝐡𝐞𝐬 | 𝐠𝐮𝐢𝐝𝐞𝐬 | 𝐢𝐧𝐯𝐞𝐬𝐭𝐦𝐞𝐧𝐭𝐬'\nfollowers 19382\nlikes 10058\nmedia_count 2258\nname 'Woody'\nscreen_name 'woody_research'\nstatuses 7140\nlikes 109\nARTICLE TEXT:\nHow I Built a Faceless YouTube Channel to $41k a Month With Claude\nEight months ago I had a laptop, a $20 Claude subscription, and no idea what I was doing. /  / No camera, no editor, no team. Last month the channel did $9,400 and I've never shown my face once. /  / The whole thing is six steps. Claude does the heavy lifting on four of them. Here's the exact build, with the prompts I actually paste.\nFirst, the money\nEveryone asks what YouTube pays per view. Wrong question. The niche decides everything:\nFinance and investing: $15-50 RPM / Technology and AI: $12-30 / Health and longevity: $10-25 / General and entertainment: $3-8\n / My channel is finance. Around 480,000 views last month at an $18 RPM is about $8,600 from AdSense alone, before one affiliate link. A cooking channel at $3 RPM needs five million views for the same check. /  / Views are the engine. The niche is the fuel.\nStep 1: Pick the niche by RPM, not by what you like\nI picked a cooking idea first because I liked it. That mistake cost me three weeks. Now I make Claude run the math before I commit: / \n / It handed me \"debt payoff for people on a normal salary\" inside finance, plus a year of titles. That's a $300 consultant call for free.\nStep 2: Write the script. This is the actual business\nMy first 5 videos flopped. Clean voice, fine footage, 200 views each. The problem was the writing. /  / YouTube only really measures one thing, do people keep watching. A script that holds 70% gets pushed to new viewers, one that holds 30% gets buried. That gap is the script, not the production. /  / This is the prompt I paste for every video:\n / Once I fixed the script, the same channel that did 200 views started doing 40,000. Nothing else has changed.\nStep 3: Voice it once, keep that voice forever\nElevenLabs reads the script. I picked one voice and never change it, so the channel keeps an identity viewers recognize. Set the speed to 0.9x for finance, it reads with more authority. Drop [pause] markers into the script where it should breathe, that's what makes it stop sounding like a robot /  / $22 a month. This step is not where you win or lose, so don't overthink it. / \nStep 4: Assemble it in CapCut\nNo camera means no editing, just matching footage to the voiceover. The rule: the visual changes every 3 to 5 seconds. Pexels and Pixabay cover most of the B-roll for free. /  / Turn on CapCut's auto-captions. They lifted my watch time about 15% because most people scroll with the sound off.\nStep 5: Let Claude write the metadata\nI had one video that deserved 80,000 views sitting at 800. Great script, clean voice, decent thumbnail. The title was terrible. /  / Now Claude writes the whole metadata layer in one shot:\nThat one prompt is worth $50 a video if you hire it out. I run it in 20 seconds.\nStep 6: Post 20 to 30 videos before you judge anything\nI almost quit at video 8. Nothing was moving. The channel didn't start climbing until video 24. /  / The algorithm needs 20 to 30 videos before it learns who to show you to. Most people post 8, see flat numbers, and walk away one month before the curve turns. Same day, same time, every week, no exceptions for the first six months.\nWhat it costs\nClaude: $20/mo / ElevenLabs: $22/mo / CapCut, Canva, Pexels: free / Total: ~$57/mo\nAgainst what this replaces, a scriptwriter at $150-400 a video, a voice actor, an editor, an SEO person. I'm running all of it on the price of two coffees a month.\nThe part nobody tells you\nFor fifteen years the barrier to YouTube was the camera. You needed a face, a voice, presence, gear, years of reps on camera. /  / That barrier is gone, and losing it showed me something that was always true. The camera was a distraction from the actual job, which is writing things people don't want to stop watching. /  / The faceless channel didn't remove the hard part. It removed everything that was hiding it. I stopped competing on being watchable and started competing on being un-skippable. /  / That one's a writing problem, and Claude already solved it.\ndescription '𝐫𝐞𝐬𝐞𝐚𝐫𝐜𝐡𝐞𝐬 | 𝐠𝐮𝐢𝐝𝐞𝐬 | 𝐢𝐧𝐯𝐞𝐬𝐭𝐦𝐞𝐧𝐭𝐬'\nfollowers 19382\nlikes 10058\nmedia_count 2258\nname 'Woody'\nscreen_name 'woody_research'\nstatuses 7140\nlikes 1212\nARTICLE TEXT:\nStumbled on a Polymarket wallet pulling / $700k+ in a month.\nNo noise. / No bot promo. / No “AI made me rich” crap.\nBut the way this wallet trades? / Yeah… it smells like Clawbot logic all over it.\nHere’s what’s wild:\n• $23.7M traded / • 259 preds / • Biggest hit: $274k / • PnL just goes up — no cliffs, no nukes\nNot degen gambling. / This is someone treating Polymarket like infra. /  / Most people trade opinions. / This guy trades conditions.\nBig single entries. / No DCA. / No tilt. / Waits forever… then hits size.\nSports markets (NHL heavy). / Odds lag → money moves.\nHonestly, if Clawbot had a “manual mode”, it’d look like this:\nThat’s it. / No fancy indicators. / No 5k trades/day.\nJust letting Polymarket be slow.\nThat’s the edge nobody talks about.\nPolymarket doesn’t punish you for being right. / It punishes you for being late.\nThis wallet wasn’t early by seconds. / It was early by thinking. /  / Everyone’s chasing bots, copytrade links, AI buzzwords.\nMeanwhile, setups like this quietly print / six figures at a time.\nClawdbot isn’t the secret. / Polymarket isn’t the secret.\nKnowing when the odds are wrong is.\nI watch wallets like this. / Not hype. / Not noise. / Real money behavior.\nFollow if you’re tired of fake alpha. /  / CopyTradeBot: https://t.me/PolyCop_BOT?start=ref_woodyonx /  /  / Profile on that trader: https://polymarket.com/@weflyhigh?via=woody\ndescription '𝐫𝐞𝐬𝐞𝐚𝐫𝐜𝐡𝐞𝐬 | 𝐠𝐮𝐢𝐝𝐞𝐬 | 𝐢𝐧𝐯𝐞𝐬𝐭𝐦𝐞𝐧𝐭𝐬'\nfollowers 19382\nlikes 10058\nmedia_count 2258\nname 'Woody'\nscreen_name 'woody_research'\nstatuses 7140\nlikes 10\ndescription '𝐫𝐞𝐬𝐞𝐚𝐫𝐜𝐡𝐞𝐬 | 𝐠𝐮𝐢𝐝𝐞𝐬 | 𝐢𝐧𝐯𝐞𝐬𝐭𝐦𝐞𝐧𝐭𝐬'\nfollowers 19382\nlikes 10058\nmedia_count 2258\nname 'Woody'\nscreen_name 'woody_research'\nstatuses 7140\nlikes 109\ndescription '𝐫𝐞𝐬𝐞𝐚𝐫𝐜𝐡𝐞𝐬 | 𝐠𝐮𝐢𝐝𝐞𝐬 | 𝐢𝐧𝐯𝐞𝐬𝐭𝐦𝐞𝐧𝐭𝐬'\nfollowers 19382\nlikes 10058\nmedia_count 2258\nname 'Woody'\nscreen_name 'woody_research'\nstatuses 7140\nlikes 1212\ndescription '𝐫𝐞𝐬𝐞𝐚𝐫𝐜𝐡𝐞𝐬 | 𝐠𝐮𝐢𝐝𝐞𝐬 | 𝐢𝐧𝐯𝐞𝐬𝐭𝐦𝐞𝐧𝐭𝐬'\nfollowers 19382\nlikes 10058\nmedia_count 2258\nname 'Woody'\nscreen_name 'woody_research'\nstatuses 7140\nlikes 10\nsource_id 'x.woody-research-articles'\n\n### apple.owned-apps-jp.json\nTOP ['result', 'schema_version', 'source']\ncanonical_url 'https://itunes.apple.com/lookup'\nitem_ids ['apple:6755129214@1.9.4:r46', 'apple:6759667221@1.0.3:r2']\naverageUserRating 4.5\ndescription 'あなたが本当に必要な瞬間に、優しい言葉が届くアファメーション。\\n\\nアニッチャ（Anicca）は、AIによるセルフケア・コンパニオン。自己肯定、引き寄せ（マニフェステーション）、心の平和の言葉を、美しいカードと通知で、心が揺れ始める\"その瞬間\"に届けます。\\n\\n多くのアファメーション・アプリは、自分でアプリを開いて読まなければなりません。アニッチャは違います。あなたの一日を学び — 夜更かししそうな時、自己否定が始まりそうな時、不安が忍び寄る時 — その瞬間にひとつの優しい言葉を届けます。タップすればカード全文。読むだけで、少し心が軽くなる。\\n\\n## アニッチャが違う理由\\n\\n- アファメーションは「思い出した時」ではなく「必要な時」に届く\\n- AIがあなたの心に響く言葉を学習する\\n- 仏教の「無常（アニッチャ）」に根ざした設計 — どんな嵐もいつか過ぎ去る\\n- ストリーク・罪悪感・生産性プレッシャーは一切なし\\n- すでに自分を責めすぎている人のために作られた\\n\\n## 主な機能\\n\\n### ◆ 毎日のアファメーション・カード\\n美しくデザインされたカードに、自己肯定の言葉、引き寄せのプロンプト、セルフラブのリマインダー — 今日のあなたに合わせて選ばれます。\\n\\n### ◆ スマート・タイミング\\nアニッチャはあなたのパターンを学習。夜中のスクロール？23:47にカードが届きます。自己批判のループ？内なる批判者が動き出した瞬間にカードが現れます。\\n\\n### ◆ 13のセルフケア・テーマ\\n自己愛・不安の緩和・考えすぎを手放す・怒りを鎮める・自信のマニフェステーション・自己疑念の解放・赦し・過去を手放す・孤独・先延ばし・誠実な言葉・健全な境界線・眠りの平和。\\n\\n### ◆ ボイス・セッション\\n話したい時に話せる。穏やかなAIの声があなたの言葉を受け止め、自己慈悲に根ざした視点を返します — アドバイスでも治療でもなく、ただ\"そばに居る\"。\\n\\n### ◆ 適応学習\\n心に響いたカードは優先され、響かなかったものは自然に消えていきます。日々、あなたの\"フィード\"はあなた自身に近づきます。\\n\\n### ◆ 優しい、決して責めない\\n途切れたら罪悪感、というストリークはありません。「昨日サボったね」も言いません。コーチではなく、優し\nreleaseNotes '不具合の修正とパフォーマンスの改善。'\ntrackName '毎日のアファメーション - アニッチャ'\ntrackViewUrl 'https://apps.apple.com/jp/app/%E6%AF%8E%E6%97%A5%E3%81%AE%E3%82%A2%E3%83%95%E3%82%A1%E3%83%A1%E3%83%BC%E3%82%B7%E3%83%A7%E3%83%B3-%E3%82%A2%E3%83%8B%E3%83%83%E3%83%81%E3%83%A3/id6755129214?uo=4'\nuserRatingCount 46\nversion '1.9.4'\naverageUserRating 5\ndescription 'LINEや会話文を貼り付けるだけで、相手の本当の気持ちをAIが即分析。\\n\\n怒り・不安・寂しさ・期待…隠された感情を読み解き、関係を壊さない最適な返答まで具体的に提案します。\\n\\n- 無料: 1日3回まで\\n- プレミアム: 翻訳無制限 + 全履歴 + 優先高速分析 + 詳細な心理分析\\n\\n対応する関係性:\\n* 恋人・カップル\\n* 友人\\n* 家族\\n* 同僚・上司\\n\\n利用規約: https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/'\nreleaseNotes 'edited the ai url so honne ai can properly analyze honne!'\ntrackName '本音翻訳'\ntrackViewUrl 'https://apps.apple.com/jp/app/%E6%9C%AC%E9%9F%B3%E7%BF%BB%E8%A8%B3/id6759667221?uo=4'\nuserRatingCount 2\nversion '1.0.3'\nsource_id 'apple.owned-apps-jp'\n\n### apple.competitors-affirmation-us.json\nTOP ['result', 'schema_version', 'source']\ncanonical_url 'https://itunes.apple.com/search'\nitem_ids ['apple:874656917@6.47.0:r724857', 'apple:876080126@6.46.0:r1063045', 'apple:1202851636@5.9.5:r33984', 'apple:1585586331@3.3.5:r2989', 'apple:1372575227@5.7.6:r44897', 'apple:1591901241@6.2:r1985', 'apple:1671846678@2.004:r841', 'apple:586028606@17.5.0:r66280', 'apple:418693319@6.0.8:r19765']\naverageUserRating 4.83804\ndescription 'How many negative thoughts have been endlessly repeating in your mind? Daily affirmations help rewire our brains, build self-esteem, and change negative thought patterns. Empower yourself by verbally affirming your dreams and ambitions. Choose from many daily intentions and set reminders to be delivered throughout the day.\\n\\nPositive affirmations help make major shifts in your mindset, and they also serve as prompts and daily reminders about what you’re truly capable of, ensuring every day is an amazing day\\n\\nAn affirmation is a simple but powerful statement that helps to strengthen the connection between your conscious and unconscious mind. The more you strengthen this connection, the more resilient you’ll be when you experience difficult or challenging circumstances.\\n\\nAs Buddha wisely said: you become what you believe. And the best way to strengthen your resilience is to practice affirmations every single day.\\n\\n\\nThere are many benefits to using affirmations as part of your da\nreleaseNotes '- New themes and tons of new affirmations!\\n- Other fixes and improvements\\n\\nFind tons of inspiring content on our blog: https://blog.theiam.app/\\n\\nLove the app? Tell us in the reviews section! We read all of them. Have a happy day!'\ntrackName 'I am - Daily Affirmations'\ntrackViewUrl 'https://apps.apple.com/us/app/i-am-daily-affirmations/id874656917?uo=4'\nuserRatingCount 724857\nversion '6.47.0'\naverageUserRating 4.82826\ndescription \"Whether you're going through hard times, need an extra push to get stuff done, or like sharing inspirational quotes on social media, Motivation has you covered.\\n\\nPositive reminders are one of the simplest and most powerful tools for mental growth. It’s all about keeping the right thoughts top of mind from the get-go every day, so they’re readily available on those hard days when you need them most.\\n\\nNow, from iOS 14, you can think positive thoughts without even trying with the Motivation widget! Simply install the widget in your home screen and customize it from the app. You can have as many widgets as you want!\\n\\nCustomize the design of the quotes and share the uplifting message of the day with your friends, or use the image for Instagram or as a wallpaper.\\n\\nThe app includes a wide range of topics such as self-esteem, relationships, and dealing with stress, as well as a selection of carefully designed themes to choose from - updated frequently.\\n\\n+ Read through Hundreds of Qu\nreleaseNotes '- New themes and tons of new quotes!\\n- Other fixes and improvements\\n\\nFind tons of inspiring content on our blog: https://blog.motivation.app/\\n\\nLove the app? Tell us in the reviews section! We read all of them. Have a happy day!'\ntrackName 'Motivation - Daily quotes'\ntrackViewUrl 'https://apps.apple.com/us/app/motivation-daily-quotes/id876080126?uo=4'\nuserRatingCount 1063045\nversion '6.46.0'\naverageUserRating 4.8381\ndescription 'Our brains are wired to repeat negative feelings if fed with negative thoughts. Luckily the same goes for the positive side. Daily affirmations help us rewire our brains and fix these negative patterns.\\u2028\\n\\n“If you practice saying positive things in non-stressful situations, it has been found that you can change your brain’s reactions” - Caroline Miller \\n\\nAffirmations are simple yet powerful statements that help us validate our core values. The latest researches indicate that practicing positive mantras and daily affirmations decreases stress, improves performance on challenging duties, builds self-esteem, and overall, makes us happier. As a result; we feel better, make healthier decisions, and live a happier life. Now, unleash your subconscious mind’s power and take your first step in the world of affirmations with Mantra.\\n\\nAll the affirmations inside our app are constantly updated. Instructions are clear: Think positive and hold down the button! Your affirmation will glow a\nreleaseNotes \"Keep nurturing your positive mindset with Mantra! \\n\\nIn this update, we’ve added many new affirmations and made some improvements to enhance your experience.\\n\\nIf you're enjoying the app, consider leaving a review for other people! Your reviews mean the world to us, and we read every single one.\\n\\nIf you encounter any issues, please email us at mantra@broftware.com. Your feedback is essential in helping us improve!\\n\\nThank you for making Mantra a part of your day.\"\ntrackName 'Mantra - Daily Affirmations'\ntrackViewUrl 'https://apps.apple.com/us/app/mantra-daily-affirmations/id1202851636?uo=4'\nuserRatingCount 33984\nversion '5.9.5'\naverageUserRating 4.78521\ndescription 'Unlock the Power of Affirmations with Our App!\\n\\nTransform your life one positive thought at a time. The Affirmations App helps you harness your inner strength, align with your desires, and create the life you’ve always dreamed of. Whether you’re looking to attract MONEY, improve your SLEEP, or foster a deeper SPIRITUAL connection, this app is your ultimate guide to manifesting positivity and success.\\n\\nWhy Use Affirmations?\\nAffirmations are more than just words—they are powerful declarations of what you want to create in life. By practicing daily affirmations, you can reprogram your mind, overcome negativity, and achieve your goals. Whether you’re seeking financial abundance, a BIBLICAL perspective, or a more POSITIVE mindset, affirmations offer a proven way to transform your thoughts into actions.\\n\\nHow It Works:\\n- Discover Daily Affirmations: Choose from expertly curated categories like success, relationships, gratitude, and JOURNAL prompts for deeper reflection.\\n- Create You\nreleaseNotes \"- Brand new redesigned experience\\n- New iOS glass design for a modern look\\n- Improved widgets for your home screen\\n- Apple Watch experience upgraded\\n- Faster performance across the app\\n- Bug fixes and stability improvements\\n\\nThank you to everyone for all the great support! We are working very hard to get stuff done. In this update you'll find bug fixes, small improvements and performance enhancements. If you love Affirmations App, please rate us, it would really help! :)\"\ntrackName 'Affirmations for You'\ntrackViewUrl 'https://apps.apple.com/us/app/affirmations-for-you/id1585586331?uo=4'\nuserRatingCount 2989\nversion '3.3.5'\naverageUserRating 4.88145\ndescription \"The Gratitude app is a carefully-designed self-care tool to help you focus on your mental health.\\n\\nWith a gratitude journal, affirmations, vision board, and daily motivation content, Gratitude provides you with all the tools and reminders you need to gain motivation and develop a healthy self-love routine in your life. \\n \\nTo live a happy and fulfilling life, it is important for us to have good mental health and a strong sense of self-love.\\n\\nAnd, as the app is completely private, you can always be assured that your precious journal entries, affirmations, and vision board are for your eyes only.\\n\\nHere are the tools that you will find in the Gratitude app:\\n\\n1. GRATITUDE JOURNAL\\n\\nA gratitude journal or diary opens up your eyes to reflect on all the little blessings in your life.\\n\\nIn daily life, we can lose sight of what we are fortunate to have and by keeping a journal you can slowly and steadily shift your perspective to focus on what is good in your life.\\n\\nThe Gratitude \nreleaseNotes 'Thank you for being part of the Gratitude community!\\nIn this update, we’ve focused on helping you stay consistent and improving overall stability:\\n\\n- Addressed an issue where Daily Zen posts could not be shared on Instagram\\n\\nLoving the app? Please consider leaving us a review - it helps more people discover Gratitude.'\ntrackName 'Gratitude: Self-Care Journal'\ntrackViewUrl 'https://apps.apple.com/us/app/gratitude-self-care-journal/id1372575227?uo=4'\nuserRatingCount 44897\nversion '5.7.6'\naverageUserRating 4.77431\ndescription 'Stuck in negative thought loops? Self Love delivers daily affirmations, powerful I am statements, and gentle reminders exactly when you need them—so positivity is never out of reach.\\n\\nTransform your mindset with uplifting quotes on your lock screen, beautiful home-screen widgets, and themed backgrounds that make every affirmation feel personal. \\n\\nRead it. Speak it. Believe it.\\n\\nWHY SELF LOVE WORKS?\\n\\nDaily affirmations are more than quotes—they are small habits that reshape how you see yourself. With Self Love, you replace self-doubt with confidence, calm, and clarity one message at a time.\\n\\nDAILY AFFIRMATIONS & I AM STATEMENTS\\n\\n• Hundreds of affirmations for confidence, self-esteem, gratitude, and growth\\n• I am statements that strengthen a positive mindset\\n• New categories and quotes added regularly\\n• Save favorites and revisit the messages that resonate most\\n\\nREMINDERS THAT MEET YOU WHERE YOU ARE\\n\\n• Smart reminders deliver affirmations throughout your day\\n• Choose\nreleaseNotes 'Make every glance more uplifting with Affirmation Wallpapers!\\n\\n• Create personalized wallpapers with your favorite themes and affirmation categories.\\n• Automatically change your wallpaper using Apple Shortcuts.\\n• Discover hundreds of new affirmations across more self-growth categories.\\n• Enjoy beautiful new themes and additional customization options.\\n• Performance improvements, bug fixes, and overall app enhancements.\\n\\nEnjoying Self Love? Please leave a review on the App Store. We read every review and truly appreciate your support.\\n\\nThank you for growing with us.'\ntrackName 'Self Love - Daily Affirmations'\ntrackViewUrl 'https://apps.apple.com/us/app/self-love-daily-affirmations/id1591901241?uo=4'\nuserRatingCount 1985\nversion '6.2'\naverageUserRating 4.80975\ndescription 'Daily affirmations app Miracle is one of the best affirmations apps for iPhone with widgets. Build motivation, shift your mindset, and bring more positivity into your day.\\n\\nUse daily affirmations and motivational quotes to push through challenges and stay focused on what you want. Miracle is an affirmations app for women built around daily affirmations for positivity and self-belief, designed to actually fit into your routine instead of just sitting on your home screen.\\n\\nKey Features:\\n• Daily Affirmations\\nStart each day with an affirmation matched to your goals. Whether you want daily affirmations for women, morning affirmations, or powerful daily affirmations, Miracle gives you words that support self-belief and a positive mindset from the moment you wake up.\\n\\n• Affirmation Practice, Your Voice and Your Pace\\nRun guided affirmation sessions the way you want. Choose the voice that reads your affirmations out loud, and set how long each step of the practice lasts. Slow and grou\nreleaseNotes '- Practice reminder bug fix'\ntrackName 'Daily Affirmations & Widgets'\ntrackViewUrl 'https://apps.apple.com/us/app/daily-affirmations-widgets/id1671846678?uo=4'\nuserRatingCount 841\nversion '2.004'\naverageUserRating 4.75122\ndescription 'Inspirational and motivational quotes. Daily reminders to help you overcome adversity, persevere, achieve your goals, succeed. Start your day with a quote from our thoughtfully curated collection.\\n\\nDAILY QUOTE WALLPAPERS\\nMeaningful photography and typography, hand-picked, and carefully combined to make quotes more impactful.\\n\\nIMPORTANT: iPhone wallpapers are optimized for iPhone XS, iPhone XS Max, iPhone XR, iPhone X, iPhone 8 & iPhone 8 Plus, iPhone 7 & 7 Plus, iPhone 6s & 6s Plus!\\n\\nAUDIO QUOTES \\nHave quotes read aloud by Siri! From your lock screen! Get a “pick me up” whenever you need it with Audio Quotes.\\n\\nUse a phrase, such as “Motivate me”, “Inspire me”, “Activate positivity”. Choose from different categories:\\n\\n• The Quote of the Day\\n• Our Most Popular Quotes\\n• Inspirational Quotes\\n• Motivational Quotes\\n• Positive Mindset Quotes\\n• Success Quotes\\n\\nAudio Quotes require an in-app purchase. See below for more details.\\n\\nSIRI SHORTCUTS\\nIn addition to Audio Quotes\nreleaseNotes 'Stability improvements and bug fixes. Fixed bug where notification is not sent at set time.\\n\\nThoughts or feedback? Please leave a review here on the App Store or contact me at http://dailyquoteapp.com/feedback'\ntrackName 'Daily Quote - Positive quotes'\ntrackViewUrl 'https://apps.apple.com/us/app/daily-quote-positive-quotes/id586028606?uo=4'\nuserRatingCount 66280\nversion '17.5.0'\naverageUserRating 4.76656\ndescription 'Unique Daily Affirmations is a free creative affirmation tool that helps you succeed in your endeavors, bring you out from under the clouds, and make positive changes in your life. Through uplifting statements and quotes, you\\'ll believe in yourself with these one-a-day affirmations for daily motivation.\\n\\nHold down the large gray button to reveal your daily affirmation and effectively use the app by repeating the statement out loud.  Saying the affirmation in front of a mirror is even better. It\\'s been scientifically proven that the more stimuli your mind has, the more your mind will retain the information.  By vocalizing in front of a mirror, you stimulate sight and sound.  Envision your personal success.\\n\\nLet these positive declarations become truth in your subconscious mind as you think about it throughout the day.\\n\\nGive us some feedback in the app if you have suggestions or problems.  We really doubt you\\'ll need this though;  just look at all the raving reviews:\\n\\n\"Missin\nreleaseNotes '• Improved automatic text color on background photos — light and dark text is now chosen from the area directly behind your quote, so affirmations stay readable on tricky images.\\n• Widget backgrounds now get the same automatic text color treatment.\\n• Fixed favorites and custom quote lists not refreshing after deleting or clearing quotes.\\n• Cleaned up the Unsplash photo picker layout.'\ntrackName 'Unique Daily Affirmations'\ntrackViewUrl 'https://apps.apple.com/us/app/unique-daily-affirmations/id418693319?uo=4'\nuserRatingCount 19765\nversion '6.0.8'\nsource_id 'apple.competitors-affirmation-us'\n\n### apple.competitors-relationship-jp.json\nTOP ['result', 'schema_version', 'source']\ncanonical_url 'https://itunes.apple.com/search'\nitem_ids ['apple:1494428618@2.0.53:r71352', 'apple:6784031888@1.1.8:r509', 'apple:1247701802@2.50.0:r1038', 'apple:6473902336@1.0.8:r136', 'apple:1517761308@7.2:r1032', 'apple:6467590967@6.0:r191']\naverageUserRating 4.43444\ndescription '個性豊かなアイドルたちのライブを楽しむリズムゲーム\\n『あんさんぶるスターズ！！Music』\\n\\n初心者から上級者まで楽しめる本格派リズムゲームで、豪華3D演出のMVを心ゆくまで楽しめます。\\n収録楽曲は200曲以上！\\nアイドルや衣装を入れ替えて、あなただけのライブを自由自在に創り上げよう！\\n\\n◆◇ストーリー◇◆\\n新たなアイドル時代の幕開け！\\n全世界の人々に〝アイドルのすべて〟を発信しよう！\\n\\n突如『アンサンブルスクエア』（通称：『ＥＳ』）上空に飛来した天空のワンダーランド・メガスフィア！\\nあなたは四つの芸能事務所に所属する個性弾けるアイドルたちをプロデュースし、\\u3000前代未聞の新配信番組『メガストリーム』を手掛けていくことに――\\n\\n胸踊るエンターテイメント、ノンストップのサプライズ\\nアイドル界の新時代は〝ここ〟から始まる！！\\n\\n◆◇クレジット◇◆\\n【タイトル】あんさんぶるスターズ！！Music\\n【ジャンル】男子アイドル育成リズムゲーム\\n【公式サイト】：https://ensemble-stars.jp\\n【公式X】：https://x.com/enstars_music\\n【キャスト】阿座上洋平/浅沼晋太郎/天﨑滉平/石川界人/伊藤マサミ/今井文也/岩崎諒太/内田雄馬/梅原裕一郎/江口拓也/逢坂良太/大須賀純/小野友樹/海渡翼/柿原徹也/笠間淳/梶裕貴/梶原岳人/神尾晋一郎/神永圭佑/北村諒/草野太一/高坂知也/小林大紀/小林千晃/駒田航/斉藤壮馬/榊原優希/重松千晴/鈴木崚汰/諏訪部順一/高橋広樹/武内駿輔/辻史人/土田玲央/照井悠希/豊島修平/鳥海浩輔/中澤まさとも/中島ヨシキ/永塚拓馬/西山宏太朗/新田杏樹/野島健児/橋本晃太朗/羽多野渉/服部想之介/花江夏樹/樋柴智康/比留間俊哉/帆世雄一/細貝圭/前野智昭/増田俊樹/三木眞一郎/緑川光/村瀬歩/森久保祥太郎/山口智広/山下大輝/山本和臣/米内佑希/渡辺拓海\\n\\n◆◇対応環境◇◆\\n【対応機種】iPhone 11 以降（iOS 13 以降）\\n【推奨端末】iPhone 12 以降\\n※対応機種・推奨端末にはApple A13以降搭載のiPad、iPad Pro、iPad Air、iPad miniも含まれます。\\n※ご利用状況によっては正常な挙動とならない場合や、\nreleaseNotes '- 細かな改善'\ntrackName 'あんさんぶるスターズ！！Music'\ntrackViewUrl 'https://apps.apple.com/jp/app/%E3%81%82%E3%82%93%E3%81%95%E3%82%93%E3%81%B6%E3%82%8B%E3%82%B9%E3%82%BF%E3%83%BC%E3%82%BA-music/id1494428618?uo=4'\nuserRatingCount 71352\nversion '2.0.53'\naverageUserRating 4.52259\ndescription '気になるあの人とのトーク、本当はどう思われてる？\\n恋愛温度計は、ふたりのトーク履歴を取り込むだけで“関係の温度”が見えてくる恋愛分析アプリ。\\nさらに「もしも」では、送り方を変えたら相手がどう返すかをAIが予測。今のトークへの返し方の提案や、ふたりの週間レポートも読めます。\\n\\n■ 取り込むだけ、あとは自動で分析\\n・やりとりの量やテンポ、返信の速さ、盛り上がった日をグラフで可視化\\n・ふたりの“関係の温度”をスコアで表示\\n・毎日の小さな変化をやさしくまとめてお知らせ\\n※分析はすべて端末の中だけで完結。相手に通知が届いたり、バレることは一切ありません。\\n\\n■ 「もしも」——あの送信、変えていたら？\\n過去の自分のメッセージを書き換えると、「相手だったらどう返すか」をAIが“もしも”の続きとして予測。\\nさらに「返信を考える」では、今のトークにどう返すかを、あなたの話し方でAIが3案提案します。\\n※実在の相手の発言ではなく、AIによる予測シミュレーションです。\\n\\n■ 週間レポート\\n今週のふたりの温度の変化や気づき、盛り上がった日をまとめて振り返り。\\n相手の好意のサインや“次の一手”は、AIの考察としてプレミアムで読めます。\\n\\n■ こんな人に\\n・好きな人との距離をもう一歩縮めたい\\n・脈ありかどうか、それとなく確かめたい\\n・自分の送り方・返し方を見直したい\\n・恋の駆け引きのヒントがほしい\\n\\n■ プライバシーへの配慮\\n・トーク履歴の分析は端末内で処理します\\n・あなたのトークを第三者に公開することはありません\\n（AIを使う機能〔「もしも」「いまの返事」「週間レポート」〕の利用時のみ、予測・生成のために会話の一部をAIへ送信します。詳しくはプライバシーポリシーをご覧ください）\\n\\n■ 料金について\\n基本機能は無料でご利用いただけます。「もしも」など一部機能は、プレミアム（自動更新サブスクリプション）または単発のチケットでご利用いただけます。\\n・プレミアムでできること：毎日チケットが届く／「いまの返事」を1日にたっぷり使える（無料は1日1回）／週間レポートのAI考察が読める\\n・プレミアム：週額 ¥600 ／ 年額 ¥12,800（自動更新）\\n・お支払いは購入確定時にApple IDへ請求されます。\\n・期間終了の24時間前ま\nreleaseNotes 'トーク履歴の共有時・取り込み時の問題を修正しました。'\ntrackName '恋愛温度計 - もしもの恋愛シミュレーター'\ntrackViewUrl 'https://apps.apple.com/jp/app/%E6%81%8B%E6%84%9B%E6%B8%A9%E5%BA%A6%E8%A8%88-%E3%82%82%E3%81%97%E3%82%82%E3%81%AE%E6%81%8B%E6%84%9B%E3%82%B7%E3%83%9F%E3%83%A5%E3%83%AC%E3%83%BC%E3%82%BF%E3%83%BC/id6784031888?uo=4'\nuserRatingCount 509\nversion '1.1.8'\naverageUserRating 4.23025\ndescription '片想い、叶わぬ恋、人生の行き詰まり…1人で抱えきれず苦しんでいませんか？\\n「彼の本当の気持ち」や「あなたの人生の転機」など、誰にも言えない悩みをタロットが解決へ導きます。\\n数々のメディアで活躍する超実力派占い師の本格鑑定を、まずは無料でお試しください。\\n\\n◆あなたに贈る「今日の一枚」（無料）\\n人気占い師が日替わりで登場し、今日のあなたに必要なメッセージを届けます！\\n\\n◆毎日占える！無料鑑定\\n40以上の占いを完全無料でお楽しみいただけます！\\n\\n・あの人は今、この瞬間どうしてる？私のこと想ってる？\\n・今のあなたの恋愛運＋直近の恋のチャンス\\n・今あなたを一番想っている人\\n・大切なあの人が、今抱えている「悩み・望み」とは？\\n・今日、彼があなたを想った瞬間＋妄想したこと\\n・今日のあなたがやってはいけないこと\\n・【毎日の運勢】幸せを呼ぶ９つのメッセージ\\nその他\\u3000続々追加予定！\\n\\n◆占いメニュー数1,800以上！\\n恋愛総合運をはじめ、あの人のこと、恋の行方、復活愛、出会い、結婚運、人生運、仕事運など、たくさんの種類の占いメニューがあり、お楽しみいただけます！占いメニューは毎日更新しています。\\n運命の出会いを探している方、転職や仕事で悩んでいる方、人生で悩んでいる方もぜひお試しください！\\n\\n+++【価格】+++\\nアプリダウンロード：無料\\n※一部有料メニューがございます。\\n最安価格：240円\\u3000/\\u3000最高価格：2500円\\n\\n◆人気の占い師が大集結！\\n「Yahoo!占い」で年間MVP＆売上1位を獲得した、国内屈指の人気占い師から、様々な種類のタロットリーディングを得意とする本格派タロティストがあなたの恋愛、結婚、出会い、人生、仕事などあらゆる悩みを読み解きます！\\n\\n◇Yahoo!占い年間MVP獲得！【林エリヤ】フォルトゥーナタロット\\n◇Yahoo!占い年間売上No.1！大阪心斎橋の凄腕タロット占い師【守田のり子】\\n◇癒されるタロティストと話題！【ジューン澁澤】オーロラタロット\\n◇タロット界の第一人者【伊泉龍一】ラブ・カバラタロット\\n◇陰陽師の式神呪法【高橋圭也】六壬式占タロット\\n◇千里眼が見通す運命【近藤千歳】三摩耶オラクル\\n◇度肝を抜く的中力【hanako】万花易占タロット\\n◇聖母\nreleaseNotes '■新タロット登場！\\n「運命が色づく万華鏡◆幻彩カレイドスコープタロット 妃彩」をリリースしました！'\ntrackName '神秘のタロットワールド 恋愛・復縁・不倫・人生の当たる占い'\ntrackViewUrl 'https://apps.apple.com/jp/app/%E7%A5%9E%E7%A7%98%E3%81%AE%E3%82%BF%E3%83%AD%E3%83%83%E3%83%88%E3%83%AF%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB%E3%83%89-%E6%81%8B%E6%84%9B-%E5%BE%A9%E7%B8%81-%E4%B8%8D%E5%80%AB-%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%9F%E3%81%AE%E5%BD%93%E3%81%9F%E3%82%8B%E5%8D%A0%E3%81%84/id1247701802?uo=4'\nuserRatingCount 1038\nversion '2.50.0'\naverageUserRating 4.40441\ndescription 'ときめきの恋愛は情熱とロマンスに満ちた恋愛シミュレーションアプリです。ここでは、ユーザーはAIキャラクターと深くて楽しい対話ができ、リアルで夢中になるような恋愛交流を体験できます。\\n\\n主な機能：\\n\\nAIキャラクターとの対話： アプリ内のAIキャラクターは高度なインテリジェンスを備えた対話システムを持ち、ユーザーの言葉や感情に理解を示し、まるで実際の相手との対話のような体験を提供します。\\n\\n恋愛チャット： ユーザーはさまざまなタイプのAIキャラクターと恋愛対話を展開でき、甘く、情熱的で温かい恋愛の場面を体験できます。AIキャラクターはユーザーの好みや対話に応じて対話内容を調整し、個性的な恋愛シーンを演出します。\\n\\n感情の親密度： ユーザーは持続的な対話を通じてAIキャラクターとの感情の親密度を高め、より深い交流をもたらし、よりリアルな感情を体験できます。\\n\\n個性化体験： アプリはユーザーの個性的な設定をサポートし、外見や性格特徴、好みなどの要素を選択でき、独自の恋愛体験を構築できます。\\n\\n利用規約：https://xindong.funlovemore.top/#/agreementInfo?id=1\\nプライバシーポリシー：https://xindong.funlovemore.top/#/agreementInfo?id=2'\nreleaseNotes 'Version 1.0.8 では会話例外エラーを修正しました'\ntrackName 'ときめきの恋愛-AIキャラクターとの仮想的な恋愛チャット'\ntrackViewUrl 'https://apps.apple.com/jp/app/%E3%81%A8%E3%81%8D%E3%82%81%E3%81%8D%E3%81%AE%E6%81%8B%E6%84%9B-ai%E3%82%AD%E3%83%A3%E3%83%A9%E3%82%AF%E3%82%BF%E3%83%BC%E3%81%A8%E3%81%AE%E4%BB%AE%E6%83%B3%E7%9A%84%E3%81%AA%E6%81%8B%E6%84%9B%E3%83%81%E3%83%A3%E3%83%83%E3%83%88/id6473902336?uo=4'\nuserRatingCount 136\nversion '1.0.8'\naverageUserRating 3.95155\ndescription '【Gift（ギフト）ってどんなアプリ？】\\n・メンタルが辛い時、オンライン相談ができる\\n・ストレスや鬱、怒りを本音で話すことで悩みを解消できる\\n・質問箱のようなお悩みBOXでストレス発散\\n・うつ病からなどの悩みで死にたい、消えてしまいたいと思ってしまった方の心のカルテに\\n\\nGiftは大人の発達障害、大人のADHDやASD、HSP、繊細さんと呼ばれる方々がチャットや電話で相談できるアプリです。\\n医療機関ではないので、カルテなどの作成はありません。\\n\\n日常生活や仕事、恋愛、家族、パートナー、子供、その他片付けや時間管理、自律神経の不調で生きづらさを感じていたり悩まれている方が、登録されている先生やカウンセラーに本音で相談できるアプリです。\\nまた鬱（うつ病）病やひきこもりでお悩みの方やその保護者様も対象としています。\\n\\nカウンセラー、臨床心理士、就労支援アドバイザー、セラピストその他沢山の先生が登録していますので、日常のストレスやメンタルの悩みをチャットや通話で自分に合う先生に相談をすることができます。\\n\\n\\n【なぜGift（ギフト）が生まれたの？】\\n・自宅から相談、先生を選びたい\\n・どこでもいつでもストレス発散したい\\n・通話だけでなく、チャットでも相談したい\\nこんなご要望から生まれました。\\n\\n現在、日本では、大人の発達障がいと診断される方が増えています。\\nただ、クリニックに通うためには、予約や、移動時間、待ち時間もあり、先生との相性もあります。\\n\\nそこで、「リアル相談からオンライン相談」のご提案です。\\nGIFTのオンライン相談では、自宅から相談できる、先生を選べる、チャットで相談できる、現金不要といったメリットがあります。\\n\\n「いきなりチャットや通話はちょっと、、、」に抵抗のある方は質問箱でお気軽に質問もできます。\\n\\nリアル相談とオンライン相談をバランスよく活用して、鬱病（うつ病）、言いづらい怒り、生きづらさをより緩和、解消して頂けるプラットフォームを提供したいと思い、誕生しました。\\n\\n\\n【Gift（ギフト）はこんな方にオススメ】\\n・アプリだから、カウンセリングやクリニックへの通院の必要なし\\n・寄り添って聞いてもらえる。だからストレスが発散できる\\n・自律神経に不調があるなど、メンタルの悩みから心身が辛い\nreleaseNotes '軽微な不具合を修正しました'\ntrackName 'こころの悩みや不安を本音で相談できる！-Gift(ギフト)'\ntrackViewUrl 'https://apps.apple.com/jp/app/%E3%81%93%E3%81%93%E3%82%8D%E3%81%AE%E6%82%A9%E3%81%BF%E3%82%84%E4%B8%8D%E5%AE%89%E3%82%92%E6%9C%AC%E9%9F%B3%E3%81%A7%E7%9B%B8%E8%AB%87%E3%81%A7%E3%81%8D%E3%82%8B-gift-%E3%82%AE%E3%83%95%E3%83%88/id1517761308?uo=4'\nuserRatingCount 1032\nversion '7.2'\naverageUserRating 4.22513\ndescription '＼初回無料ポイント付き（まずは気軽にはじめよう）／\\n元恋人との復縁・不倫・片思いはClearクリアに相談\\n寄り添い鑑定で貴方の悩みをクリアにします\\n\\n\\n＜24時間匿名OK＞\\n【こんな方にオススメ】\\n◯元カレとヨリを戻したくて悩んでる…\\n◯大好きな恋人と喧嘩した…\\n◯夫が不倫していてどうすればいいかわからない…\\n◯悩みを話せる友達がいない…\\nなど、お悩みを抱えてる方は是非クリアのカウンセラーさんにご相談ください！\\n\\n\\n【クリアは安心安全】\\n◯料金前払い制なので使いすぎることはありません！\\n◯鑑定師さんは全員本人確認済み！\\n◯クチコミとレビューを見てから鑑定師さんを選べる！\\n◯個人情報の入力は任意。相談時だけでもOK！\\n◯お問い合わせ窓口から経験豊富な運営スタッフがサポート！\\n\\n\\n【クリアの使い方3ステップ】\\n◯ステップ1\\n鑑定師さんのプロフィール・メッセージ・クチコミから、あなたの相談内容が得意な鑑定師さんを探そう！\\n◯ステップ2\\n気になる鑑定師さんがいたらメッセージを送って送ってみよう！\\n「相談お願いします」やスタンプだけでもOK！\\n◯ステップ3\\n具体的に相談してみよう！\\n相手は話を聞くプロなので胸を借りるつもりで相談してください！\\n\\n\\n【ご利用にあたって】\\nクリアをご利用いただくにあたって、アプリ内に設置している利用規約に同意いただいた上、アプリをご利用ください。\\nクリアで活動されている鑑定師さんの回答は将来の予測やユーザー様の意志決定を縛ったり強制するものではございません。\\n公序良俗に反する書き込みは、発見次第投稿内容の削除および会員資格の停止措置等をとらせて頂く場合がございます。\\nクリアに関するお問い合わせは、アプリ内のお問い合わせフォームよりご連絡ください。\\n\\n\\n＜運営者＞\\n運営会社：ユーリマインド株式会社\\n住所：大阪府大阪市中央区瓦屋町1丁目-5-15 5F'\nreleaseNotes '軽微な不具合を修正しました'\ntrackName 'チャット占い Clear(クリア) 恋愛・復縁相談アプリ'\ntrackViewUrl 'https://apps.apple.com/jp/app/%E3%83%81%E3%83%A3%E3%83%83%E3%83%88%E5%8D%A0%E3%81%84-clear-%E3%82%AF%E3%83%AA%E3%82%A2-%E6%81%8B%E6%84%9B-%E5%BE%A9%E7%B8%81%E7%9B%B8%E8%AB%87%E3%82%A2%E3%83%97%E3%83%AA/id6467590967?uo=4'\nuserRatingCount 191\nversion '6.0'\nsource_id 'apple.competitors-relationship-jp'\n\n### github.hook-rubric.json\nTOP ['result', 'schema_version', 'source']\ncanonical_url 'https://github.com/Anil-matcha/AI-Youtube-Shorts-Generator'\nitem_ids ['github:Anil-matcha/AI-Youtube-Shorts-Generator@c30376e94326f8674793c960b482eb532ffbf1f6']\nhtml_url 'https://github.com/Anil-matcha'\nname 'Anil Matcha'\nname 'Anil Matcha'\nCOMMIT: Add demo video embed to README\nhtml_url 'https://github.com/Anil-matcha'\