iral\nBLOCK -> Age, ethnicity, hair, skin / -> Lighting (gym, golden hour, natural) / -> Environment (kitchen, gym, bedroom) / -> Accessories (resistance band, AirPods, water bottle) / -> Vibe (biohacker, wellness girlie, morning routine guy)\nBLOCK once you are clear on those variables / go to pinterest and literally look for someone who matches those characteristics\nBLOCK in this case let's say I want to use a guy that is in his car talking to the camera / I will use a pinterest image as a reference point\nBLOCK then get that picture and send it to higgsfield /  and make some edits to the character by prompting it. /  / to end up with a completely different look but in a realistic enviroment. /  / but having a starting image of a real person will ensure your final result also looks real which is the goal here.  /  / please be ethical and don't steal anyones identity. ( it's ilegal ) / once you have that character down you are ready to mass produce videos\nBLOCK #4 THE CONTENT FACTORY\nBLOCK We are in the ERA of 24 hour software. With a claude max plan of $200/mo you are virtually unstoppable in what you can create. /  / Which is why I recommend to create your own website with your own workflow / and have claude + higgs MCP drop videos in there.  /  / think about it like this /  / > Claude is your executioner  / > Higgsfield is your artist  / > your workflow is what ties everything together. /  / In our case we made a custom website that stiches everthing togehter / higgs can also do this using their new feature Super computer. /  / but for our use case its a little different.\nBLOCK higgsfield generates four 15 second seedance videos which is the max length a seedance video can be. /  / then we have claude drop that video into our custom website and  /  / then the website stitches them together and automatically / edits them.\nBLOCK In summarythe complexity of automating this can vary depending on what format you are trying to replicate. /  / But ultimately every