orkflow / and have claude + higgs MCP drop videos in there.  /  / think about it like this /  / > Claude is your executioner  / > Higgsfield is your artist  / > your workflow is what ties everything together. /  / In our case we made a custom website that stiches everthing togehter / higgs can also do this using their new feature Super computer. /  / but for our use case its a little different.\nBLOCK higgsfield generates four 15 second seedance videos which is the max length a seedance video can be. /  / then we have claude drop that video into our custom website and  /  / then the website stitches them together and automatically / edits them.\nBLOCK In summarythe complexity of automating this can vary depending on what format you are trying to replicate. /  / But ultimately everything can be done with enough prompting. /  / Then you can use @postbridge to schedule out the content to Tiktok, Youtube and Instagram right from the custom platform. /  / and thats literally it, now you have a content factory that can generate unlimited videos for unlimited characters /  / And post them across dozens of accounts.\nBLOCK IN SUMARRY\nBLOCK > connect your higgsfield MCP / > find a viral format to replicate / > create your character using nano banana in higgs / > have the MCP generate the video using your start image / > create your own custom website to scheduele out content and auto edit it / > generate 100s of new creatives per day and post them out\nBLOCK try this for your app and thank me later.\nTEXT we automated an entire AI UGC studio with Claude + Higgsfield AI for context I make $1M+/yr across my apps and businesses. and very recently we scaled one of our apps to $720,000/yr and #22 on the appstore. /  / We did this with a combination of Meta ads, tiktok ads and UGC.  /  / the most effective being UGC, however.. UGC can get quite expensive at scale, think about it  /  / $15 per video  x 2 videos per day / $30 per creator/day * 7 days in the week\nTEXT its $210/week