ENT FACTORY\nTEXT We are in the ERA of 24 hour software. With a claude max plan of $200/mo you are virtually unstoppable in what you can create. /  / Which is why I recommend to create your own website with your own workflow / and have claude + higgs MCP drop videos in there.  /  / think about it like this /  / > Claude is your executioner  / > Higgsfield is your artist  / > your workflow is what ties everything together. /  / In our case we made a custom website that stiches everthing togehter / higgs can also do this using their new feature Super computer. /  / but for our use case its a little different.\nTEXT higgsfield generates four 15 second seedance videos which is the max length a seedance video can be. /  / then we have claude drop that video into our custom website and  /  / then the website stitches them together and automatically / edits them.\nTEXT In summarythe complexity of automating this can vary depending on what format you are trying to replicate. /  / But ultimately everything can be done with enough prompting. /  / Then you can use @postbridge to schedule out the content to Tiktok, Youtube and Instagram right from the custom platform. /  / and thats literally it, now you have a content factory that can generate unlimited videos for unlimited characters /  / And post them across dozens of accounts.\nTEXT postbridge\nTEXT IN SUMARRY\nTEXT > connect your higgsfield MCP / > find a viral format to replicate / > create your character using nano banana in higgs / > have the MCP generate the video using your start image / > create your own custom website to scheduele out content and auto edit it / > generate 100s of new creatives per day and post them out\nTEXT try this for your app and thank me later.\nXURL https://x.com/ErnestoSOFTWARE\nTEXT I own a few apps. currently at $200k MRR, sharing daily B2C scaling strategies. founder of @tryviewtrack\nTEXT https://t.co/vwKQ5fWGMd\nPROFILE ErnestoSOFTWARE Ernesto Lopez {'followers': 58728, 'following': 794,