ormal when you mass hire.  /  / because 90% of our UGC campaigns success comes from the top 5-6 creators the rest are mostly noise.\nBLOCK These cost will obviously decrease as we fire the creators that are not performing and keep the killers. /  / but i encourage you to watch $10,000 leaving your bank account every week  / it really makes you ask yourself some questions.  /  / and for us that question was, how do we take our margins from 30% to 70% / and become extremely profitable? \nBLOCK and the answer to that question is the reason i'm writing this article. \nBLOCK We paid a guy $3.5k last week in bonuses  /  / and he told us that he was surprised we wanted to continue  / working with him. /  / He explained that most brands he works with fire him after he goes viral. /  / In my opinion thats either because their product sucks or because they have no money to sustain the cost.  /  / Thankfully we have a great app all around that helps us stay profitable nonetheless. /  / so while the average NGMI founder is stopping their UGC campaing / we are thinking how do we go beyond 30 creators  /  / How do we get 60 creators without having to double our weekly spend which would be $12,000/week  /  / and thats when we turned our eyes toward AI UGC /  / viral content is no more than  / Hook, script, face, delivery, post.   /  / its a system, a system that can skillfully be replicated with AI.  / and distributed at mass scale to create the same effect of Real UGC /  / at 1/10th of the cost, this is why I deeply believe AI ugc is the future. /  / we have already started to test AI ugc and it works  / with some of \nBLOCK AI ugc is not a theory, its all around us already.   / I've talked to the team from a looks maxing app   /  / they're doing over $30k/mo  running only AI UGC content. /  / I also talked to another 18yo kid who scaled his quit gooning app to $10k/mo with 1 single AI UGC creator. /  / there are plenty of examples so let me just list them a few out here:\nBLOCK  / These accounts alone together have generated over 300+ million views, but how do you actually build an AI UGC creator\nBLOCK What I learned from talking to a founder making $100k/mo with AI UGC\nBLOCK I wanted to see how the top killers in the AI UGC space were scaling\nBLOCK So I got on a call with a founder making $100k/mo with his app that he is scaling with AI UGC, he has been on starter story with verified metrics. /  / he gave me a super simple system /  / 1.  you find a format that already works.  /  / find videos that already went viral in your niche. /  / For us, this is easy because our real UGC creators already  / showed us what works. /  / but you can find this by just scrolling on your niche.\nBLOCK so he basically takes the winning viral format, him and his team finds / and rebuild them with AI.\nBLOCK Then they break the video down. / Every viral UGC video is basically:\nBLOCK Hook → Script →Face → Delivery .\nBLOCK Once you see it that way, it stops being a video  / and becomes a recipe  that can be automated.\nBLOCK 2. you build your AI UGC creator.\nBLOCK you can run the whole thing through Higgsfield Supercomputer.  so you give higgsfield supercomputer the winning format,  the creator and the prompt.\nBLOCK and It handles the rest. / Script, Video Editing, Final asset. /  / And the best part is once you get the AI video back if it looks good. / you can just tell higgs super computer  to create your 100s of variations  /  / And then again spread that across 5-10 influencers / And now you literally have an army. /  / I've already created 4 influencers for our app\nBLOCK 3. Scale with clippers  /  / Once you have your AI ugc creators \nBLOCK you can basically hire US based clippers for $100 a month,literally, to just hit post on the videos that you give them,  /  /  ideally someone you know like you 14yo cousin with a scrolling addiction.  /  / since Higgsfield already edits the videos for you and makes them for you.  / you just give the clippers a google drive folder with the content to post /  / If you don't wanna fully automate it, it's fine to start just posting yourself.  /  / You can do up to 4 or 8  account in your own phone , and if you run out of space just buy a new iphone 8 for $250 and run up 8 more. /  / Shadow bans don't exist.  / and so now instead of paying $900/mo per creator  /  / you can pay  $30-$100/mo per realistic AI UGC creator that you make. /  / and thats literally all you have to do.  /  / I will keep using  this tech and keep you guys posted on how this continues to work for us. /  / be sure to follow for more daily sauce like this! / \nTEXT Last 2 weeks we generated 17M views with an army of 30 UGC creators / which is great, yet this posed a problem we had not thought about before. /  / running a team at this scale  is costing us over $6,000/week base,  but its working... our revenue nearly tripled in the last 2 weeks and our app is ranking #30 in the appstore. /  / last week it was more like $10,000 in spend between ads and our UGC team / which is normal when you mass hire.  /  / because 90% of our UGC campaigns success comes from the top 5-6 creators the rest are mostly noise.\nTEXT These cost will obviously decrease as we fire the creators that are not performing and keep the killers. /  / but i encourage you to watch $10,000 leaving your bank account every week  / it really makes you ask yourself some questions.  /  / and for us that question was, how do we take our margins from 30% to 70% / and become extremely profitable? \nTEXT and the answer to that question is the reason i'm writing this article. \nTEXT We paid a guy $3.5k last week in bonuses  /  / and he told us that he was surprised we wanted to continue  / working with him. /  / He explained that most brands he works with fire him after he goes viral. /  / In my opinion thats either because their product sucks or because they have no money to sustain the cost.  /  / Thankfully we have a great app all around that helps us stay profitable nonetheless. /  / so while the average NGMI founder is stopping their UGC campaing / we are thinking how do we go beyond 30 creators  /  / How do we get 60 creators without having to double our weekly spend which would be $12,000/week  /  / and thats when we turned our eyes toward AI UGC /  / viral content is no more than  / Hook, script, face, delivery, post.   /  / its a system, a system that can skillfully be replicated with AI.  / and distributed at mass scale to create the same effect of Real UGC /  / at 1/10th of the cost, this is why I deeply believe AI ugc is the future. /  / we have already started to test AI ugc and it works  / with some of our videos getting up to 18k views. /  / and while thats not a lot, we literally just started, and nobody knows it's AI\nTEXT AI ugc is not a theory, its all around us already.   / I've talked to the team from a looks maxing app   /  / they're doing over $30k/mo  running only AI UGC content. /  / I also talked to another 18yo kid who scaled his quit gooning app to $10k/mo with 1 single AI UGC creator. /  / there are plenty of examples so let me just list them a few out here:\nTEXT  / These accounts alone together have generated over 300+ million views, but how do you actually build an AI UGC creator\nTEXT What I learned from talking to a founder making $100k/mo with AI UGC\nTEXT I wanted to see how the top killers in the AI UGC space were scaling\nTEXT So I got on a call with a founder making $100k/mo with his app that he is scaling with AI UGC, he has been on starter story with verified metrics. /  / he gave me a super simple system /  / 1.  you find a format that already works.  /  / find videos that already went viral in your niche. /  / For us, this is easy because our real UGC creators already  / showed us what works. /  / but you can find this by just scrolling on your niche.\nTEXT so he basically takes the winning viral format, him and his team finds / and rebuild them with AI.\nTEXT Then they break the video down. / Every viral UGC video is basically:\nTEXT Hook → Script →Face → Delivery .\nTEXT Once you see it that way, it stops being a video  / and becomes a recipe  that can be automated.\nTEXT 2. you build your AI UGC creator.\nTEXT you can run the whole thing through Higgsfield Supercomputer.  so you give higgsfield supercomputer the winning format,  the creator and the prompt.\nTEXT and It handles the rest. / Script, Video Editing, Final asset. /  / And the best part is once you get the AI video back if it looks good. / you can just tell higgs super computer  to create your 100s of variations  /  / And then again spread that across 5-10 influencers / And now you literally have an army. /  / I've already created 4 influencers for our app\nTEXT 3. Scale with clippers  /  / Once you have your AI ugc creators \nTEXT you can basically hire US based clippers for $100 a month,literally, to just hit post on the videos that you give them,  /  /  ideally someone you know like you 14yo cousin with a scrolling addiction.  /  / since Higgsfield already edits the videos for you and makes them for you.  / you just give the clippers a google drive folder with the content to post /  / If you don't wanna fully automate it, it's fine to start just posting yourself.  /  / You can do up to 4 or 8  account in your own phone , and if you run out of space just buy a new iphone 8 for $250 and run up 8 more. /  / Shadow bans don't exist.  / and so now instead of paying $900/mo per creator  /  / you can pay  $30-$100/mo per realistic AI UGC creator that you make. /  / and thats literally all you have to do.  /  / I will keep using  this tech and keep you guys posted on how this continues to work for us. /  / be sure to follow for more daily sauce like this! / \nXURL https://x.com/ErnestoSOFTWARE\nTEXT I own a few apps. currently at $200k MRR, sharing daily B2C scaling strategies. founder of @tryviewtrack\nTEXT https://t.co/UCMoRhQc4g\nPROFILE ErnestoSOFTWARE Ernesto Lopez {