{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_9","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"playbook\":[{\"schema_version\":\"marketing.tactic.v1\",\"id\":\"tactic.center-pin-30-day-focus.v1\",\"source_type\":\"x_article\",\"source_url\":\"https://x.com/3Imzdo3\",\"source_handle\":\"3Imzdo3\",\"source_null_reason\":null,\"captured_at\":\"2026-08-01T14:26:35.807261Z\",\"provenance\":\"live_observed\",\"claim\":\"The observed article recommends choosing the single bottleneck most limiting results, then concentrating on it for 30 days instead of improving multiple channels at once.\",\"mechanism\":\"Force a weekly growth review to identify one measurable bottleneck, freeze unrelated experiments, and run one focused 30-day intervention with a before/after metric.\",\"applies_to\":[\"app\",\"ebook\",\"content\",\"outreach\"],\"testable\":true,\"status\":\"new\",\"evidence_url\":\"https://x.com/3Imzdo3/status/2083479993414529299\",\"evidence_null_reason\":null,\"our_result\":null,\"result_evidence\":null},{\"schema_version\":\"marketing.tactic.v1\",\"id\":\"tactic.pain-to-self-check-owned-channel.v1\",\"source_type\":\"x_article\",\"source_url\":\"https://x.com/3Imzdo3\",\"source_handle\":\"3Imzdo3\",\"source_null_reason\":null,\"captured_at\":\"2026-08-01T14:26:35.807261Z\",\"provenance\":\"live_observed\",\"claim\":\"The observed article describes a short-form funnel that starts with a specific pain, gives a small insight or solution, then offers a free self-check delivered through an owned channel.\",\"mechanism\":\"Create content around a narrowly recognizable problem; teach one diagnostic distinction; invite viewers to complete a relevant free check or receive a tool in the owned channel, measuring view-to-click and click-to-completion rates.\",\"applies_to\":[\"app\",\"ebook\",\"content\",\"outreach\"],\"testable\":true,\"status\":\"new\",\"evidence_url\":\"https://x.com/3Imzdo3/status/2082390961368535423\",\"evidence_null_reason\":null,\"our_result\":null,\"result_evidence\":null},{\"schema_version\":\"marketing.tactic.v1\",\"id\":\"tactic.search-asset-intent-expansion.v1\",\"source_type\":\"x_article\",\"source_url\":\"https://x.com/3Imzdo3\",\"source_handle\":\"3Imzdo3\",\"source_null_reason\":null,\"captured_at\":\"2026-08-01T14:26:35.807261Z\",\"provenance\":\"live_observed\",\"claim\":\"The observed article treats Pinterest content as durable search assets: select one theme, enumerate concrete user problems, and expand successful content into multiple distinct search intents.\",\"mechanism\":\"Choose one audience theme, list 30 situation-based problems, publish one useful asset per intent, and expand only the intents receiving saves or clicks into adjacent variants rather than duplicating the original.\",\"applies_to\":[\"ebook\",\"content\",\"outreach\"],\"testable\":true,\"status\":\"new\",\"evidence_url\":\"https://x.com/3Imzdo3/status/2081668498338807900\",\"evidence_null_reason\":null,\"our_result\":null,\"result_evidence\":null},{\"schema_version\":\"marketing.tactic.v1\",\"id\":\"tactic.saved-decision-loop-memory.v1\",\"source_type\":\"x_article\",\"source_url\":\"https://x.com/woody_research\",\"source_handle\":\"woody_research\",\"source_null_reason\":null,\"captured_at\":\"2026-08-01T14:26:35.807261Z\",\"provenance\":\"live_observed\",\"claim\":\"The observed article says repeated business decisions should be encoded as saved loops so weekly testing, killing, fixing, and scaling decisions compound instead of being recreated in disconnected chats.\",\"mechanism\":\"Maintain a versioned decision brief containing current hypotheses, test outcomes, stop rules, and next actions; require every new content or acquisition cycle to update that brief before generating the next batch.\",\"applies_to\":[\"app\",\"content\",\"outreach\"],\"testable\":true,\"status\":\"new\",\"evidence_url\":\"https://x.com/woody_research/status/2071981134896849206\",\"evidence_null_reason\":null,\"our_result\":null,\"result_evidence\":null},{\"schema_version\":\"marketing.tactic.v1\",\"id\":\"tactic.prepaid-anonymous-verified-choice.v1\",\"source_type\":\"web\",\"source_url\":\"https://itunes.apple.com/search\",\"source_handle\":\"apple.competitors-relationship-jp\",\"source_null_reason\":null,\"captured_at\":\"2026-08-01T14:26:35.807261Z\",\"provenance\":\"live_observed\",\"claim\":\"The observed Japanese relationship-app storefront treatment combines an upfront free-point offer, anonymous use, prepaid spending control, verified providers, reviews, and a three-step provider-selection explanation.\",\"mechanism\":\"Test a storefront and onboarding sequence that leads with low-risk access, privacy, spend control, provider trust signals, and a simple three-step path; compare it against feature-led copy using product-page conversion as the primary metric.\",\"applies_to\":[\"app\"],\"testable\":true,\"status\":\"new\",\"evidence_url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/jp/app/%E3%83%81%E3%83%A3%E3%83%83%E3%83%88%E5%8D%A0%E3%81%84-clear-%E3%82%AF%E3%83%AA%E3%82%A2-%E6%81%8B%E6%84%9B-%E5%BE%A9%E7%B8%81%E7%9B%B8%E8%AB%87%E3%82%A2%E3%83%97%E3%83%AA/id6467590967?uo=4\",\"evidence_null_reason\":null,\"our_result\":null,\"result_evidence\":null}],\"creators\":[{\"schema_version\":\"marketing.creator.v1\",\"id\":\"creator.x.georgelampro20.v1\",\"platform\":\"x\",\"handle\":\"GeorgeLampro20\",\"language\":\"en\",\"product_id\":\"aniccaios\",\"source_url\":\"https://x.com/GeorgeLampro20\",\"source_null_reason\":null,\"captured_at\":\"2026-08-01T14:26:35.807261Z\",\"metrics\":[{\"name\":\"followers\",\"value\":10305,\"observed_at\":\"2026-08-01T14:26:35.807261Z\",\"source_url\":\"https://x.com/GeorgeLampro20\",\"null_reason\":null},{\"name\":\"following\",\"value\":473,\"observed_at\":\"2026-08-01T14:26:35.807261Z\",\"source_url\":\"https://x.com/GeorgeLampro20\",\"null_reason\":null},{\"name\":\"likes\",\"value\":1263,\"observed_at\":\"2026-08-01T14:26:35.807261Z\",\"source_url\":\"https://x.com/GeorgeLampro20\",\"null_reason\":null},